<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1KI" style="id"/>
  <para style="h">I Wa Yo</para>
  <para style="toc1">I WA YO</para>
  <para style="toc2">I Wa Yo</para>
  <para style="toc3">I Wa</para>
  <para style="mt1">I WA YO</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1KI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 1:1"/>Alò, Wa David te vin vye, avanse nan laj. Malgre yo te kouvri li avèk rad, li te toujou fwèt. <verse eid="1KI 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 1:2"/>Konsa, sèvitè li yo te di li: “Kite yo chache yon jenn fi vyèj pou wa a, mèt mwen an, e kite li okipe wa a pou devni enfimyè li. Epi kite li kouche nan sen li pou wa a, mèt mwen an, pou li kapab chofe kò li.” <verse eid="1KI 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 1:3"/>Konsa, yo te chache toupatou yon bèl fi nan tout teritwa Israël la, yo te twouve Abischag, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:18">Jos 19:18</ref> </char></note>Sinamit lan, e yo te mennen li kote wa a. <verse eid="1KI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 1:4"/>Fi a te byen bèl. Li te devni enfimyè a wa a pou te okipe li, men wa a pa t antre nan relasyon avèk li.<verse eid="1KI 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 1:5"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:4">II Sam 3:4</ref></char></note>Adonija, fis a Haggith la te vin vante tèt li. Li te di: “Mwen va devni wa.” Konsa, li te prepare pou li menm cha avèk chevalye avèk senkant òm pou te kouri devan l. <verse eid="1KI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 1:6"/>Papa li pa t janm konfwonte li nan okenn moman pou di: “Poukisa ou fè sa?” Li te osi yon bonòm byen bèl e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:3-4">II Sam 3:3-4</ref></char></note>te ne apre Absalom. <verse eid="1KI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 1:7"/>Li te fè tèt a tèt ansanm avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 11:6">I Kwo 11:6</ref></char></note>Joab, fis a Tseruja a, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 22:20-23">I Sam 22:20-23</ref></char></note>Abiathar, prèt la; epi yo te swiv Adonija pou te ede li. <verse eid="1KI 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 1:8"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 16:39">I Kwo 16:39</ref></char></note>Tsadok, prèt la, Benaja, fis a Jehojada a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:1">II Sam 12:1</ref></char></note>Nathan, pwofèt la, Schimeï, Réï, ak mesye vanyan ki te apatyen a David yo, pa t avèk Adonija.<verse eid="1KI 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 1:9"/>Adonija te fè sakrifis mouton avèk bèf ak bèt gra kote wòch a Zohéleth la, ki akote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:7">Jos 15:7</ref></char></note> En-Rouguel. Li te envite tout frè li yo, fis a wa yo ak tout mesye pwisan Juda yo, sèvitè a wa yo. <verse eid="1KI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 1:10"/>Men li pa t envite Nathan, pwofèt la, Benaja, mesye vanyan yo, ni Salomon, frè l la.<verse eid="1KI 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 1:11"/>Konsa Nathan te pale avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:24">II Sam 12:24</ref></char></note>Bath-Schéba, manman a Salomon. Li te di: “Èske ou pa t tande ke Adonija, fis a Haggith la te devni wa, e David, mèt nou an, pa konnen sa? <verse eid="1KI 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 1:12"/>Pou sa, vini koulye a, souple, kite mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 15:22">Pwov 15:22</ref> </char></note>ba ou konsèy pou sove lavi ou avèk lavi a fis ou a, Salomon. <verse eid="1KI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 1:13"/>Antre koulye a, kote Wa David e di li: ‘Mèt mwen, O Wa a, èske ou pa t sèmante a sèvant ou an, e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:30">I Wa 1:30</ref></char></note>“Anverite Salomon, fis ou a va wa apre mwen, e li va chita sou twòn mwen an”? Poukisa konsa, Adonija gen tan vin wa a?’ <verse eid="1KI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 1:14"/>Veye byen, pandan ou toujou la a ap pale avèk wa a, mwen va parèt pou konfime pawòl ou yo.”<verse eid="1KI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 1:15"/>Konsa, Bath-Schéba te antre kote wa a nan chanm dòmi an. Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:1">I Wa 1:1</ref></char></note>wa a te byen vye, epi Abischag, Sinamit lan, t ap okipe wa a. <verse eid="1KI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 1:16"/>Bath-Schéba te bese kouche nèt atè devan wa a. Epi wa a te di: “Se kisa ke ou vle?”<verse eid="1KI 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 1:17"/>Li te di li: “Mèt mwen, ou te sèmante a sèvant ou a pa SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a, ke: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:13">I Wa 1:13</ref></char></note>Anverite fis ou a, Salomon va devni wa apre mwen, e li va chita sou twòn mwen an.” <verse eid="1KI 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 1:18"/>Alò, gade byen, se Adonija ki wa a. Epi koulye a, mèt mwen an, wa a, ou pa menm konnen. <verse eid="1KI 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 1:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:9">I Wa 1:9</ref></char></note>Li gen tan fè sakrifis bèf avèk bèt gra ak mouton an gran kantite, e li te envite tout fis a wa yo avèk Abiathar, prèt la, avèk Joab, chèf lame a, men li pa t envite Salomon, sèvitè ou a. <verse eid="1KI 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 1:20"/>Epi koulye a, pou ou menm, mèt, wa a, zye a tout Israël ap gade ou, pou di yo se kilès k ap chita sou twòn a mèt mwen an, wa a, apre li. <verse eid="1KI 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 1:21"/>Otreman, li va vin rive ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:16">Det 31:16</ref></char></note>depi mèt mwen an, wa a, vin dòmi avèk zansèt li yo, pou mwen avèk fis mwen an, Salomon va vin konsidere kòm koupab.”<verse eid="1KI 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 1:22"/>Epi gade, pandan li te toujou ap pale, Nathan, pwofèt la te vin antre. <verse eid="1KI 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 1:23"/>Yo te pale wa a, e te di: “Men Nathan, pwofèt la.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 1:23">Konsa, lè l te antre devan wa a, li te pwostène kò l devan wa a avèk figi li atè. <verse eid="1KI 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 1:24"/>Nathan te di: “Mèt mwen, wa a, èske ou te di: ‘Adonaja va wa apre mwen e li va chita sou twòn mwen an’? <verse eid="1KI 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 1:25"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:9">I Wa 1:9</ref></char></note>Paske li te desann jodi a pou te fè sakrifis bèf avèk bèt gra, ak mouton an gran kantite, e li te envite tout fis a wa yo avèk chèf lame a, avèk Abiathar, prèt la. Men vwala, y ap manje bwè devan li, epi yo di: ‘Viv wa Adonija!’ <verse eid="1KI 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 1:26"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:8-10">I Wa 1:8-10</ref></char></note>Men mwen menm, sèvitè ou a, avèk Tsadok, prèt la ak Benaja, fis a Jehojada a, e sèvitè ou a, Salomon, li pa t envite nou. <verse eid="1KI 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 1:27"/>Èske bagay sa a te fèt pa mèt mwen an, wa a? Èske ou pa t montre sèvitè ou yo kilès ki ta dwe chita sou twòn a mèt mwen an, wa a, apre li?”<verse eid="1KI 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 1:28"/>Konsa, Wa David te reponn: “Rele Bath-Schéba vin kote m”. Li te parèt nan prezans a wa a e li te kanpe devan wa a. <verse eid="1KI 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 1:29"/>Wa a te sèmante. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 4:9">II Sam 4:9</ref></char></note>“Jan SENYÈ a viv la, Li menm ki te peye ranson lavi mwen soti nan tout twoub, <verse eid="1KI 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 1:30"/>anverite, jan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:13-17">I Wa 1:13-17</ref></char></note>mwen te sèmante a ou menm pa SENYÈ a, Bondye a Israël la, e te di: ‘Fis ou a, Salomon va devni wa a apre mwen. Li va chita sou twòn mwen an nan plas mwen’. Mwen va, anverite, fè sa menm jodi a.”<verse eid="1KI 1:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 1:31"/>Bath-Schéba te bese avèk figi li atè devan wa a. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:4">Dan 2:4</ref></char></note>“Ke mèt mwen an, Wa David, viv pou tout tan.”<verse eid="1KI 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 1:32"/>Alò, Wa David te di: “Rele vin kote m <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:8">I Wa 1:8</ref></char></note>Tsadok, prèt la, Nathan, pwofèt la, ak Benaja, fis a Jehojada a.” Epi yo te vini nan prezans a wa a. <verse eid="1KI 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 1:33"/>Wa a te di yo: “Pran avèk ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:6-7">II Sam 20:6-7</ref></char></note>sèvitè a mèt ou yo, e fè fis mwen an, Salomon, monte sou milèt pa m nan pou l mennen anba nan Guihon. <verse eid="1KI 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 1:34"/>Kite Tsadok, prèt la ak Nathan, pwofèt la onksyone li la kòm wa sou Israël. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:10">II Sam 15:10</ref></char></note>Soufle twonpèt la e di: ‘Viv wa a, Salomon!’ <verse eid="1KI 1:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 1:35"/>Alò, ou va vin monte apre li. Li va vin chita sou twòn mwen an e li va vin wa nan plas mwen. Paske mwen te chwazi li pou renye sou Israël avèk Juda.”<verse eid="1KI 1:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 1:36"/>Benaja, fis a Jehojada a te reponn wa a. Li te di: “Amen!” Kite se konsa ke SENYÈ a, Bondye a mèt mwen an, pale. <verse eid="1KI 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 1:37"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:5-17">Jos 1:5-17</ref></char></note>Jan SENYÈ a te avèk mèt mwen an, wa a, konsa ke li kapab avèk Salomon e fè twòn li an pi gran ke twòn a mèt mwen an, Wa David!<verse eid="1KI 1:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 1:38"/>Konsa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:8">I Wa 1:8</ref></char></note>Tsadok, prèt la, Nathan, pwofèt la, Benaja, fis a Jehojada a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:16">II Sam 8:16</ref></char></note>Keretyen yo, Peletyen yo te desann. Yo te fè Salomon monte sou milèt a David la pou te mennen li kote Guihon. <verse eid="1KI 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 1:39"/>Tsadok, prèt la, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:23-32">Egz 30:23-32</ref></char></note>pran kòn lwil la nan tant lan pou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:22">I Kwo 29:22</ref></char></note>onksyone Salomon. Yo te soufle twonpèt la, e tout pèp la te di: “Viv wa Salomon!”<verse eid="1KI 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 1:40"/>Tout pèp la te monte apre li. Pèp la t ap jwe flit, yo t ap rejwi avèk gran jwa, jiskaske tè a te vin souke avèk bwi ke yo t ap fè yo. <verse eid="1KI 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 1:41"/>Alò, Adonaja avèk tout envite ki te avèk li yo te tande sa pandan yo te fin manje. Lè Joab te tande bwi a twonpèt la, li te di: “Poukisa gen zen lavil la konsa?”<verse eid="1KI 1:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 1:42"/>Pandan li te toujou ap pale, men vwala, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:27-36">II Sam 15:27-36</ref></char></note>Jonathan, fis a Abiathar a, prèt la te vin rive. Alò Adonaja te di: “Antre, pwiske ou se yon nonm vanyan ki pote bòn nouvèl.”<verse eid="1KI 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 1:43"/>Men Jonathan te reponn a Adonaja: “Non! Mèt nou, Wa David, te fè Salomon wa. <verse eid="1KI 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 1:44"/>Wa a te anplis, voye avèk li Tsadok, prèt la, Nathan, pwofèt la, Benaja, fis a Jehojada a, Keretyen yo, Peletyen yo, epi yo te fè li monte sou milèt a wa a. <verse eid="1KI 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 1:45"/>Tsadok, prèt la, avèk Nathan, pwofèt la, te onksyone li wa nan Guihon. Yo te vin monte depi la, ranpli avèk jwa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:40">I Wa 1:40</ref></char></note>jiskaske tout vil la te vin boulvèse. Sa se bwi ke nou te tande a. <verse eid="1KI 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 1:46"/>Anplis menm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:23">I Kwo 29:23</ref></char></note>Salomon te vin pran chèz li sou twòn wayòm nan. <verse eid="1KI 1:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 1:47"/>Toujou, sèvitè a wa yo te vin beni mèt nou an, Wa David. Yo te di: ‘Ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:37">I Wa 1:37</ref></char></note>Bondye ou a kapab fè non a Salomon pi bon ke non ou, e twòn pa li a pi gran ke twòn pa w la!’ Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:31">Jen 47:31</ref></char></note>wa a te bese sou kabann nan. <verse eid="1KI 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 1:48"/>Wa a osi te di konsa: ‘Beni se SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, ki <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">II Sam 7:12</ref></char></note>te pèmèt yon moun vin chita sou twòn mwen an jodi a pandan pwòp zye m toujou wè.’”<verse eid="1KI 1:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 1:49"/>Alò, tout envite a Adonija yo te ranpli avèk gwo laperèz. Yo te leve e yo chak te ale fè wout yo. <verse eid="1KI 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 1:50"/>Konsa, Adonija te pè Salomon. Li te leve ale pou sezi kòn lotèl yo, e li te di: “Kite Salomon sèmante a mwen menm jodi a ke li p ap mete sèvitè li a lanmò avèk nepe.” <verse eid="1KI 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 1:51"/>Alò, yo te pale a Salomon. Yo te di: “Gade byen, Adonija pè Wa Salomon; paske tande byen, li te ale sezi kòn lotèl yo, e li t ap di: ‘Kite Wa Salomon sèmante a mwen menm jodi a ke li p ap mete sèvitè li a lanmò avèk nepe.’”<verse eid="1KI 1:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 1:52"/>Salomon te di: “Si li se yon moun onèt, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 14:45">I Sam 14:45</ref></char></note>nanpwen menm youn nan cheve li k ap tonbe atè, men si se mechanste ki twouve nan li, li va mouri.”<verse eid="1KI 1:52"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 1:53"/>Konsa, Wa Salomon te voye mennen li desann soti nan lotèl la. Epi li te vin lonje kò l atè nèt devan Wa Salomon. Salomon te di li: “Ale lakay ou.”<verse eid="1KI 1:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1KI 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 2:1"/>Lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 47:29">Jen 47:29</ref></char></note>tan pou David mouri an t ap pwoche, li te bay lòd a Salomon. Li te di: <verse eid="1KI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 2:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 23:14">Jos 23:14</ref></char></note>“Mwen prale nan chemen a tout tè a. Pou sa, rete dyanm e montre ke se gason ou ye. <verse eid="1KI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 2:3"/>Kenbe lòd SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a, pou mache nan tout vwa li yo, pou kenbe règleman Li yo, kòmandman Li yo, òdonans Li yo, avèk temwayaj Li yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:18-20">Det 17:18-20</ref></char></note>selon sa ki ekri nan Lalwa Moïse la, pou ou kapab vin genyen nan tout sa ke ou antreprann ak nenpòt kote ke ou vire. <verse eid="1KI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 2:4"/>Pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:25">II Sam 7:25</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a kapab akonpli pawòl ke li te pale konsènan mwen menm nan, lè l te di: ‘Si fis ou yo fè atansyon nan chemen pa yo, pou mache devan M nan verite avèk tout kè yo e avèk tout nanm yo, ou p ap janm manke yon nonm pa ou sou twòn Israël la.’<verse eid="1KI 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 2:5"/>“Alò, ou konnen tou, sa ke Joab, fis a Tseruja a te fè m, sa ke li te fè a de chèf lame Israël yo, a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:32">I Wa 2:32</ref></char></note>Abner, fis a Ner a ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:10">II Sam 20:10</ref> </char></note>Amasa, fis a Jéther a, ke li te touye. Anplis li te vèse san lagè nan tan lapè. Epi li te mete san lagè nan sentiwon senti li ak sou sandal nan pye li. <verse eid="1KI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 2:6"/>Pou sa, aji <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:9">I Wa 2:9</ref></char></note>konsa, selon sajès ou e pa kite cheve blanch li desann nan sejou lanmò yo anpè. <verse eid="1KI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 2:7"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:31-38">II Sam 19:31-38</ref></char></note>montre ladousè a fis a Barzillaï yo, Galaadit la, e kite yo pami sila ki manje sou tab ou yo, paske yo te ede mwen lè m te sove ale kite Absalom, frè ou a.<verse eid="1KI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 2:8"/>“Veye byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:5-8">II Sam 16:5-8</ref></char></note>genyen avè w<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:5-8">II Sam 16:5-8</ref></char></note>Schimeï, fis a Guéra a, Benjamit a Bachurim nan. Se te li menm ki te fè madichon sou mwen nan jou ke m te ale Mahanaïm nan. Men lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:18-23">II Sam 19:18-23</ref></char></note>li te desann bò kote m nan Jourdain an, mwen te sèmante a li menm pa SENYÈ a. Mwen te di: ‘Mwen p ap mete ou a lanmò avèk nepe.’ <verse eid="1KI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 2:9"/>Konsa, pou sa, pa kite li sòti san pini. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:6">I Wa 2:6</ref></char></note>Paske ou se yon nonm saj. Ou va konnen sa ke ou ta dwe fè a li menm, epi ou va fè tèt cheve blanch li an desann nan sejou lanmò nan san.”<verse eid="1KI 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 2:10"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:29">Trav 2:29</ref></char></note>David te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo e li te antere nan lavil David la. <verse eid="1KI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 2:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:4-5">II Sam 5:4-5</ref></char></note>Jou ke David te renye sou Israël yo te karant ane. Sèt ane, li te renye Hébron e trann-twa ane, li te renye Jérusalem. <verse eid="1KI 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 2:12"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:23">I Kwo 29:23</ref></char></note>Salomon te chita sou twòn David la, papa li e wayòm li an te etabli byen solid.<verse eid="1KI 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 2:13"/>Alò Adonija, fis a Haggith la, te vini a Bath-Schéba, manman a Salomon. Bath-Schéba te mande: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 16:4">I Sam 16:4</ref></char></note>“Èske ou vini anpè?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:13">Adonija te di, “Anpè.” <verse eid="1KI 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 2:14"/>Epi li te di: “Mwen gen yon bagay pou mande ou.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:14">Bath-Schéba te di: “Pale.”<verse eid="1KI 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 2:15"/>Konsa li te di: “Ou konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:3-4">II Sam 3:3-4</ref></char></note>wayòm nan te pou mwen e ke tout Israël te sipoze ke se mwen ki t ap wa. Sepandan, wayòm nan te chavire e li te vin devni pou frè m, paske depi nan SENYÈ a, se te pou li. <verse eid="1KI 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 2:16"/>Alò, se yon sèl bagay ke m ta mande a ou menm; pa refize mwen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:16">Epi li te di li: “Pale.”<verse eid="1KI 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 2:17"/>Alò, li te di: “Souple, pale avèk Salomon, wa a, paske li p ap refize ou, pou li kapab ban mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:3-4">I Wa 1:3-4</ref></char></note>Abischag, Sinamit la, kòm madanm.”<verse eid="1KI 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 2:18"/>Bath-Schéba te di li: “Trè byen; mwen va pale avèk wa a pou ou.”<verse eid="1KI 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 2:19"/>Konsa, Bath-Schéba te ale kote Wa Salomon pou pale avèk li pou Adonija. Epi wa a te leve pou rankontre li. Li te bese devan l, e te chita sou twòn li an. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:1-3">I Wa 15:1-3</ref></char></note>fè yo ranje yon twòn pou manman a wa a, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 45:9">Sòm 45:9</ref></char></note>li te chita bò kote men dwat li. <verse eid="1KI 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 2:20"/>Alò, li te di: “Mwen ap fè yon sèl ti demann a ou menm; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:16">I Wa 2:16</ref></char></note>pa refize mwen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:20">Epi wa a te di a li: “Mande manman m, paske mwen p ap refize ou.”<verse eid="1KI 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 2:21"/>Konsa, li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:3-4">I Wa 1:3-4</ref></char></note>“Kite Abischag Sinamit lan, vin bay a Adonija, frè ou a, kòm madanm.”<verse eid="1KI 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 2:22"/>Wa Salomon te reponn li, e te di a manman li: “Epi poukisa w ap mande Abischag, Sinamit lan pou Adonija? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:8">II Sam 12:8</ref></char></note>Mande wayòm nan pou li tou—paske li se pi gran frè m— menm pou li, pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:7">I Wa 1:7</ref></char></note>Abiathar, prèt la ak pou Joab, fis a Tseruja a!” <verse eid="1KI 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 2:23"/>Salomon te sèmante pa SENYÈ a e te di: “Ke Bondye kapab fè m sa e menm plis, si Adonija <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 1:17">Rt 1:17</ref></char></note>pa gen tan pale pawòl sa a kont pwòp vi pa li. <verse eid="1KI 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 2:24"/>Koulye a, pou sa, jan SENYÈ a viv la, ki te etabli mwen, e ki te fè m chita sou twòn a David, papa m nan, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:11-13">II Sam 7:11-13</ref></char></note>ki te fè pou mwen yon kay, jan Li te pwomèt mwen an, anverite Adonija ap mete a lanmò jodi a.”<verse eid="1KI 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 2:25"/>Konsa, Salomon te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:18">II Sam 8:18</ref></char></note>voye Benaja, fis a Jehojada a kote li. Li te tonbe sou li e li te mouri. <verse eid="1KI 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 2:26"/>Epi a Abiathar, prèt la, wa a te di: “Ale nan Anathoth, pwòp chan pa ou a. Paske ou merite mouri, men mwen p ap mete ou a lanmò nan moman sa a, pwiske ou te pote lach la devan papa m, David, epi akoz ou te aflije avèk tout sa ke papa m te aflije yo.” <verse eid="1KI 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 2:27"/>Konsa, Salomon te revoke Abiathar kòm prèt SENYÈ a, pou akonpli <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:27-36">I Sam 2:27-36</ref> </char></note>pawòl SENYÈ a te pale konsènan lakay Éli nan Silo.<verse eid="1KI 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 2:28"/>Alò, nouvèl la te vini a Joab, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:7">I Wa 1:7</ref></char></note>paske Joab te swiv Adonija, malgre li pa t swiv Absalom. Konsa, Joab te sove rive nan tant SENYÈ a e li te sezi kòn lotèl yo. <verse eid="1KI 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 2:29"/>Li te pale a Wa Salomon ke Joab te sove ale nan tant SENYÈ a; epi men vwala, li akote lotèl la. Alò, Salomon te voye Benaja, fis a Jehojada a. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:14">Egz 21:14</ref></char></note>“Ale, tonbe sou li.”<verse eid="1KI 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 2:30"/>Konsa, Benaja te rive nan tant SENYÈ a. Li te di li: “Konsa wa a te di: ‘Sòti deyò.’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Men li te di: “Non, paske mwen va mouri isit la.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 2:30">Benaja te pote bay wa a yon pawòl ankò, e li te di: “Konsa Joab te pale e konsa li te reponn mwen.”<verse eid="1KI 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 2:31"/>Wa a te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:14">Egz 21:14</ref></char></note>“Fè sa ke li te pale a. Tonbe sou li, e antere li, pou ou kapab fè sòti sou mwen ak sou lakay papa m san ke Joab te vèse san koz la. <verse eid="1KI 2:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 2:32"/>SENYÈ a va fè san li retounen sou pwòp tèt li, akoz li te tonbe sou de mesye ki te pi dwat e pi bon ke li menm yo. Li te touye yo avèk nepe, pandan papa m, David pa t konnen: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 3:27">II Sam 3:27</ref></char></note>Abner, fis a Ner a, chèf lame Israël la ak Amasa, fis a Jéther a, chèf lame a Juda. <verse eid="1KI 2:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 2:33"/>Konsa, san yo va retounen sou tèt Joab avèk tèt desandan li yo pou tout tan. Men a David avèk desandan li yo, lakay li ak twòn li an, pou kapab gen lapè soti nan SENYÈ a pou tout tan.”<verse eid="1KI 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 2:34"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:25">I Wa 2:25</ref></char></note>Benaja, fis a Jehojada a te monte tonbe sou Joab pou te mete li a lanmò. Li te antere bò lakay li a nan dezè a. <verse eid="1KI 2:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 2:35"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:4">I Wa 4:4</ref></char></note>Wa a te chwazi Benaja, fis a Jehojada a sou lame a nan plas li e wa a te chwazi Tsadok kòm prèt nan plas Abiathar.<verse eid="1KI 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 2:36"/>Alò wa a te voye chache <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:5">II Sam 16:5</ref></char></note>Schimeï e te di li: “Bati pou ou menm yon kay Jérusalem, e rete la. Pa deplase sòti la pou ale nan okenn lòt plas. <verse eid="1KI 2:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 2:37"/>Paske nan jou ke ou sòti <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:23">II Sam 15:23</ref></char></note>travèse dlo Cédron an, ou mèt konnen byensi ke anverite, ou va mouri. San ou va sou pwòp tèt pa ou.”<verse eid="1KI 2:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 2:38"/>Alò, Schimeï te di a wa a: “Pawòl la bon. Jan mèt mwen an, wa a te pale a, se konsa sèvitè ou va fè.” Konsa, Schimeï te viv Jérusalem pandan anpil jou.<verse eid="1KI 2:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 2:39"/>Men li te vin rive nan fen twazan yo, ke de sèvitè a Schimeï yo te chape rive jwenn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 27:2">I Sam 27:2</ref> </char></note>Akisch, fis a Maaca a, wa Gath la. Epi yo te di Schimeï “Gade byen, sèvitè ou yo se nan Gath”.<verse eid="1KI 2:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 2:40"/>Epi Schimeï te leve sele bourik li e li te ale Gath kote Akisch pou chache jwenn sèvitè li yo. Epi Schimeï te ale mennen sèvitè li yo retounen soti Gath. <verse eid="1KI 2:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 2:41"/>Sa te pale a Salomon ke Schimeï te kite Jérusalem pou ale Gath e li te retounen.<verse eid="1KI 2:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 2:42"/>Pou sa, wa a te voye rele Schimeï e te di li: “Èske mwen pa t fè ou sèmante pa SENYÈ a, e avèti ou solanèlman pou di ou ke: ‘Ou va konnen byensi nan jou ke ou sòti, ale nenpòt kote ke ou va, anverite, mouri’? Epi ou te di mwen: ‘Pawòl ke mwen tande a bon.’ <verse eid="1KI 2:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 2:43"/>Poukisa konsa ou pa t swiv sèman bay SENYÈ a ak lòd ke m te mete sou ou a?” <verse eid="1KI 2:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 2:44"/>Wa a te osi di a Schimeï: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 16:5-13">II Sam 16:5-13</ref></char></note>“Ou konnen tout mal ke ou rekonèt nan kè ou, ke ou te fè a papa m, David. Akoz sa, SENYÈ a va remèt mal sa a sou pwòp tèt pa ou. <verse eid="1KI 2:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 2:45"/>Men Wa Salomon va beni e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:13">II Sam 7:13</ref></char></note>twòn David la va vin etabli devan SENYÈ a pou tout tan.” <verse eid="1KI 2:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 2:46"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:25-34">I Wa 2:25-34</ref></char></note>Epi wa a te kòmande Benaja, fis a Jehojada a. Li te sòti deyò e li te tonbe sou li e li te mouri. Se konsa wayòm nan te etabli nan men a Salomon.<verse eid="1KI 2:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1KI 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 3:1"/>Apre, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:16-24">I Wa 9:16-24</ref></char></note>Salomon te fè yon alyans maryaj avèk Égypte, li te pran fi Farawon an e li te mennen li nan vil David la jiskaske li te fin bati pwòp kay li, lakay SENYÈ a, ak mi ki te antoure Jérusalem nan. <verse eid="1KI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 3:2"/>Men<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 17:3-5">Lev 17:3-5</ref></char></note>pèp la te toujou ap fè sakrifis sou wo plas yo, akoz pa t gen kay la pou non SENYÈ a jis rive nan jou sa yo. <verse eid="1KI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 3:3"/>Alò, Salomon te renmen SENYÈ a. Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:4-38">I Wa 11:4-38</ref></char></note>mache nan tout règleman papa li yo, David, sof ke li te fè sakrifis e li te brile lansan nan wo plas yo. <verse eid="1KI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 3:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 1:3">II Kwo 1:3</ref></char></note>Wa a te konn ale Gabaon pou fè sakrifis la, paske se la ke wo plas prensipal la te ye. Salomon te ofri mil ofrann brile sou lotèl sila a. <verse eid="1KI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 3:5"/>Nan Gabaon, SENYÈ a te parèt a Salomon nan yon rèv pandan lannwit. Bondye te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 15:7">Jn 15:7</ref></char></note>“Mande sa ou pito e m ap ba ou li.”<verse eid="1KI 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 3:6"/>Salomon te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:8-17">II Sam 7:8-17</ref></char></note>“Ou te montre lanmou dous Ou anpil a sèvitè ou a, David, papa m, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:4">I Wa 9:4</ref></char></note>selon jan li te mache devan Ou, anverite, avèk ladwati, avèk kè ki dwat anvè Ou. Ou te konsève pou li gran amou sila a, ke Ou te ba li yon fis ki pou chita sou twòn li an, jan sa ye jodi a. <verse eid="1KI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 3:7"/>Koulye a, O SENYÈ, Bondye mwen an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:9-13">I Kwo 22:9-13</ref></char></note>Ou te fè sèvitè ou wa nan plas a papa m, David, malgre mwen pa plis ke yon timoun. Mwen pa menm konnen kijan pou m antre ni kijan pou m sòti. <verse eid="1KI 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 3:8"/>Sèvitè Ou a nan mitan a pèp ke Ou te chwazi a; yon gran pèp ki twòp menm pou kontwole ni konte. <verse eid="1KI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 3:9"/>Pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 1:10">II Kwo 1:10</ref></char></note>bay sèvitè Ou yon kè ki konprann pou li kab jije pèp Ou a, e distenge byen antre sa ki bon ak sa ki mal. Paske pou gran pèp Ou a, se kilès ki kab jije yo?”<verse eid="1KI 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 3:10"/>Sa te fè plezi nan zye SENYÈ a ke Salomon te mande bagay sa a. <verse eid="1KI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 3:11"/>Bondye te di li: “Akoz ou te mande bagay sa a, e ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 4:3">Jc 4:3</ref></char></note>pa t mande pou ou menm lavi ki long, ni richès pou ou menm, ni ou pa t mande pou pran lavi lènmi ou yo, men te mande pou ou menm ta gen kapasite pou konprann lajistis, <verse eid="1KI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 3:12"/>vwala, Mwen te fè selon pawòl ou yo. Veye byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:29-31">I Wa 4:29-31</ref></char></note>Mwen te ba ou yon kè avèk konprann ak sajès, jiskaske nanpwen moun tankou ou ni avan ou, ni p ap genyen yon moun tankou ou k ap vini apre ou. <verse eid="1KI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 3:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:21-24">I Wa 4:21-24</ref></char></note>Mwen te ba ou osi sa ke ou pa t mande, ni richès ni onè, jiskaske p ap gen okenn pami wa ki tankou ou pandan tout jou ou yo. <verse eid="1KI 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 3:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:6">I Wa 3:6</ref></char></note>Si ou mache nan chemen Mwen yo e kenbe règleman Mwen yo, tankou papa ou, David te mache a, alò, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:16">Sòm 91:16</ref></char></note>pwolonje jou ou yo.”<verse eid="1KI 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 3:15"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 41:7">Jen 41:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Salomon te vin leve e vwala, se yon rèv li te ye. Konsa, li te vini Jérusalem, e li te kanpe devan SENYÈ a, pou ofri ofrann brile ak ofrann lapè, e li te fè yon fèt pou tout sèvitè li yo.<verse eid="1KI 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 3:16"/>Alò, de fanm ki te pwostitiye te parèt kote wa a, e yo te kanpe devan l. <verse eid="1KI 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 3:17"/>Youn nan fanm yo te di: “O mèt mwen, fanm sila avèk mwen menm rete nan menm kay. Mwen te fè yon pitit pandan li te nan kay la. <verse eid="1KI 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 3:18"/>Li te vin rive nan twazyèm jou ke m te fin akouche a, ke fanm sila a te fè yon pitit tou. Se te nou de sèl ansanm ke nou te ye. <verse eid="1KI 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 3:19"/>Pitit a fanm sa a te mouri nan lannwit akoz li te kouche sou li. <verse eid="1KI 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 3:20"/>Konsa, li te leve nan mitan nwit lan, e li te pran pitit gason mwen an soti kote mwen, pandan sèvant ou an t ap dòmi. Li te mete li sou sen li e li te mete pitit mouri an sou sen mwen. <verse eid="1KI 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 3:21"/>Lè m te leve nan maten pou fè pitit la pran tete, men vwala, li te mouri. Men lè m te gade li byen nan maten, gade byen, se pa pitit mwen an ke m fenk fin akouche a li te ye.”<verse eid="1KI 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 3:22"/>Alò, lòt fanm nan te di: “Non! Paske sila ki vivan an se fis mwen e sila ki mouri an se pitit pa w la.” Men premye fanm nan te di: “Non! Paske sila ki mouri an se fis pa w la e vivan an se pitit pa m nan.” Konsa, yo te pale devan wa a.<verse eid="1KI 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 3:23"/>Konsa, wa a te di: “Youn di: ‘Sa se fis mwen k ap viv la e pitit pa w la se sila ki mouri an;’ epi lòt la di: ‘Non! Paske fis pa w la se sila ki mouri an e se pitit mwen an ki viv la.’”<verse eid="1KI 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 3:24"/>Wa a te di: “Chache pou mwen yon nepe.” Epi yo te pote yon nepe devan wa a.<verse eid="1KI 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 3:25"/>Wa a te di: “Divize pitit vivan an an de mòso; bay mwatye a youn e mwatye a lòt la.”<verse eid="1KI 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 3:26"/>Alò fanm avèk pitit vivan an te pale ak wa a, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 31:20">Jr 31:20</ref></char></note>li te boulvèse jis rive nan fon kè l sou fis li a e te di: “O mèt mwen, ba li pitit la e sitou, pa touye li.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 3:26">Men lòt la te di: “Li p ap pou ou, ni pou mwen; divize l!”<verse eid="1KI 3:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 3:27"/>Alò, wa a te di: “Bay pitit vivan an a premye fanm nan e pa okenn mwayen, pa touye li. Se li ki manman l.”<verse eid="1KI 3:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 3:28"/>Lè tout Israël te tande koze a jijman sa a ke wa a te lonje bay, yo te krent wa a. Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:17">Dan 1:17</ref></char></note>yo te wè ke sajès Bondye te nan li pou administre jistis la.<verse eid="1KI 3:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1KI 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 4:1"/>Alò, Wa Salomon te wa sou tout Israël. <verse eid="1KI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 4:2"/>Sila yo se te ofisye pa li yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:10">I Kwo 6:10</ref></char></note>Azaria, fis a Tsadok a, prèt la; <verse eid="1KI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 4:3"/>Élihoreph avèk Achija, fis a Schischa yo te sekretè; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:16">II Sam 8:16</ref></char></note>Josaphat, fis a Achilud la, grefye; <verse eid="1KI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 4:4"/>epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:35">I Wa 2:35</ref></char></note>Benaja, fis a Jehojada a te sou lame a; epi Tsadok avèk Abiathar te prèt; <verse eid="1KI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 4:5"/>Azaria, fis a Nathan an te sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:7">I Wa 4:7</ref></char></note>depite yo; epi Zabud, fis a Nathan an, yon prèt, te zanmi a wa a; <verse eid="1KI 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 4:6"/>epi Achischar te sou tout afè kay la; epi Adoniram, fis a Abda a te sou mesye travo fòse yo.<verse eid="1KI 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 4:7"/>Salomon te gen douz depite sou tout Israël, ki te fè pwovizyon pou wa a avèk lakay li. Chak mesye yo te oblije bay pwovizyon yo pou yon mwa chak ane. <verse eid="1KI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 4:8"/>Sila yo se non pa yo: Ben-Hur, nan peyi ti kolin Éphraïm yo. <verse eid="1KI 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 4:9"/>Ben-Déker nan Makats, Saalbim avèk Beth-Schémesch ak Élon avèk Beth-Hannan. <verse eid="1KI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 4:10"/>Ben-Hésed nan Arubboth <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 15:35">Jos 15:35</ref></char></note>(Soco te pou li avèk tout teritwa Hépher); <verse eid="1KI 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 4:11"/>Ben-Abinadab nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:1-2">Jos 11:1-2</ref> </char></note>wotè kote Dor a (Thaphath, fi a Salomon an te madanm li). <verse eid="1KI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 4:12"/>Baana, fis a Achilud la, nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 5:19">Jij 5:19</ref></char></note>Thaanac avèk Meguiddo, avèk tout Beth-Schean ki akote Tsarthan anba Jizreel, soti Beth-Schean rive Abel-Mehola, jis rive lòtbò Jokmean. <verse eid="1KI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 4:13"/>Ben-Guéber nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:3-15">I Wa 22:3-15</ref></char></note>Ramoth-Galaad (vil a Jaïr yo, fis a Manassé, ki Galaad la te pou li: nan zòn Argob, ki Basan an, swasant gran vil avèk mi yo fè an bwonz te pou li); <verse eid="1KI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 4:14"/>Achinadab, fis a Iddo a nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:26">Jos 13:26</ref></char></note>Mahanaïm; <verse eid="1KI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 4:15"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:27">II Sam 15:27</ref></char></note>Achimaats, nan Nephtali. (Li osi te marye avèk Basmath, fi a Salomon an); <verse eid="1KI 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 4:16"/>Banna, fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 15:32">II Sam 15:32</ref></char></note>Huschaï a nan Aser avèk Bealoth; <verse eid="1KI 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 4:17"/>Josaphat, fis a Parauch la nan Issacar; <verse eid="1KI 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 4:18"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 1:8">I Wa 1:8</ref></char></note>Schimeï, fis a Éla a, nan Benjamin; <verse eid="1KI 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 4:19"/>Guéber, fis a Uri a, nan peyi Galaad la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 3:8-10">Det 3:8-10</ref></char></note>nan ansyen peyi a Sihon, wa Amoreyen yo ak Og, wa Basan an; epi li te sèl depite nan tout zòn sila a.<verse eid="1KI 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 4:20"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 22:17">Jen 22:17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Juda avèk Israël te anpil tankou sab arebò lanmè an kantite; yo t ap manje, bwè, e rejwi. <verse eid="1KI 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 4:21"/>Alò, Salomon te renye sou tout wayòm yo soti Rivyè Euphrate la, jis rive nan peyi Filisten yo ak nan lizyè a Égypte yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:2-6">II Sam 8:2-6</ref></char></note>Yo te mennen pèyman obligatwa e yo te sèvi Salomon tout jou lavi li yo. <verse eid="1KI 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 4:22"/>Pwovizyon pou Salomon pou yon sèl jou se te trant barik farin fen ak swasant barik farin, <verse eid="1KI 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 4:23"/>dis bèf gra, ven bèf chan, san mouton anplis ke sèf, gazèl, chèvrèt mal ak tout kalite zwazo domestik gra. <verse eid="1KI 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 4:24"/>Paske li te byen domine sou tout sila ki te vè lwès Larivyè a, soti nan Thiphsach, jis rive nan Gaza, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:2-6">II Sam 8:2-6</ref></char></note>sou tout wa yo vè lwès Larivyè a. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:9">I Kwo 22:9</ref></char></note>li te gen lapè sou tout akote ki antoure li yo. <verse eid="1KI 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 4:25"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:6">Jr 23:6</ref></char></note>Konsa, Juda avèk Israël te viv ansekirite, chak moun anba chan rezen pa yo avèk pye fig etranje pa yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:20">I Sam 3:20</ref></char></note>soti nan Dan jis rive nan Beer-Schéba, pandan tout jou a Salomon yo. <verse eid="1KI 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 4:26"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:26">I Wa 10:26</ref></char></note>Salomon te gen karant-mil kote kouvri pou cheval ki te rale cha yo ak douz-mil chevalye. <verse eid="1KI 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 4:27"/>Depite yo te founi pou Wa Salomon avèk tout sila ki te vini sou tab a Wa Salomon yo, yo chak pandan mwa pa yo. Yo pa t kite li manke anyen. <verse eid="1KI 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 4:28"/>Yo te osi pote lòj avèk pay pou cheval avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 8:10-14">Est 8:10-14</ref></char></note>pi bèl sèl cheval byen vit pou mete kote li ta dwe ye a, yo chak selon chaj yo. <verse eid="1KI 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 4:29"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:12">I Wa 3:12</ref></char></note>Bondye te bay Salomon sajès avèk gran kapasite pou fè bon jijman, avèk entèlijans ki te vast tankou sab arebò lanmè. <verse eid="1KI 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 4:30"/>Sajès a Salomon te depase sajès a tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:1">Jen 29:1</ref></char></note>fis a lès yo ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 19:11">És 19:11</ref></char></note>tout sajès an Égypte la. <verse eid="1KI 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 4:31"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:12">I Wa 3:12</ref></char></note>li te pi saj pase tout moun, pase Éthan, Ezrachit la, Héman, Calcol, avèk Darda, fis a Machol yo; epi repitasyon li te nan tout nasyon ki te antoure li yo. <verse eid="1KI 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 4:32"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 12:9">Ekl 12:9</ref></char></note>Li te osi pale plis ke twa-mil pwovèb e chanson li yo te yon mil senk. <verse eid="1KI 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 4:33"/>Li te pale konsènan pyebwa yo soti nan sèd ki Liban an, jis rive nan izòp ki grandi sou mi an. Li te pale osi de bèt ak zwazo avèk reptil ak pwason. <verse eid="1KI 4:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 4:34"/>Moun te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:1">I Wa 10:1</ref> </char></note>vini soti nan tout pèp yo pou tande sajès a Salomon, soti nan tout wa sou latè ki te tande afè sajès li a.<verse eid="1KI 4:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1KI 5"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 5:1"/>Alò, Hiram, wa Tyr la, te voye sèvitè li yo kote Salomon lè li te tande ke yo te onksyone li wa nan plas a papa li, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:11">II Sam 5:11</ref></char></note>Hiram te konn toujou zanmi David. <verse eid="1KI 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 5:2"/>Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:5">II Sam 7:5</ref></char></note>Salomon te voye kote Hiram pou di: <verse eid="1KI 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 5:3"/>“Ou konnen ke David, papa m, pa t kapab bati yon kay pou non a SENYÈ a, akoz gè ki te antoure li yo, jiskaske SENYÈ a te mete yo anba pla pye li. <verse eid="1KI 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 5:4"/>Men koulye a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:24">I Wa 4:24</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te ban m repo tout kote. Nanpwen advèsè ni malè. <verse eid="1KI 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 5:5"/>Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">II Sam 7:12-13</ref></char></note> “Mwen gen entansyon bati yon kay pou non SENYÈ a, Bondye mwen an, jan SENYÈ a te pale a David la, papa m nan, kon Li te di: ‘Fis ou a, ke mwen va mete sou twòn pa w la, nan plas ou a, li va bati kay la pou non Mwen.’ <verse eid="1KI 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 5:6"/>Alò, pou sa, bay lòd pou yo koupe pou mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 2:8">II Kwo 2:8</ref></char></note>sèd Liban e sèvitè mwen yo va la avèk sèvitè pa ou yo, epi mwen va ba ou salè pou sèvitè ou yo selon tout sa ke ou di. Paske ou konnen ke nanpwen pami nou ki konprann kijan pou koupe bwa tankou Sidonyen yo.”<verse eid="1KI 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 5:7"/>Lè Hiram te tande pawòl a Salomon yo, li te rejwi anpil. Li te di: “Beni se SENYÈ a nan jou sila a, ki te bay a David yon fis ki saj sou gran pèp sa a.” <verse eid="1KI 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 5:8"/>Konsa, Hiram te voye kote Salomon e te di: “Mwen te tande sa ke ou voye di mwen an. Mwen va fè sa ke ou vle de bwa sèd avèk pichpen an. <verse eid="1KI 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 5:9"/>Sèvitè mwen yo va mennen yo desann soti Liban rive kote lanmè a. Mwen va mare yo ansanm pou fè yo rive pa lanmè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 2:16">II Kwo 2:16</ref></char></note>nan plas kote ou dirije m nan. Nou va kase yo la pou moun ou yo kab pote yo ale. Alò, ou va akonpli volonte m e ou bay manje a tout lakay mwen.”<verse eid="1KI 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 5:10"/>Konsa, Hiram te bay Salomon tout sa li te vle nan bwa sèd avèk pichpen yo. <verse eid="1KI 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 5:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 2:10">II Kwo 2:10</ref></char></note>Salomon te bay Hiram ven-mil barik nan ble a kòm manje pou lakay li ak ven barik nan lwil bat la. Konsa Salomon te bay Hiram ane pa ane. <verse eid="1KI 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 5:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:12">I Wa 3:12</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te ba li sajès, jis jan ke Li te pwomèt li a. Epi te gen lapè antre Hiram avèk Salomon e yo de a te fè yon akò.<verse eid="1KI 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 5:13"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:6">I Wa 4:6</ref></char></note>Wa Salomon te fè kòve obligatwa soti nan tout Israël la. Kòve fòse yo te konte trant-mil moun. <verse eid="1KI 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 5:14"/>Li te voye yo nan Liban, di-mil moun pa mwa, yon ekip apre lòt ak de mwa lakay. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:6">I Wa 4:6</ref></char></note>Adoniram te chèf sou ouvriye kòve yo. <verse eid="1KI 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 5:15"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:20-22">I Wa 9:20-22</ref></char></note>Salomon te gen swasann-di-mil transpòtè ak katre-ven-mil ki t ap taye wòch nan mòn yo. <verse eid="1KI 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 5:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:23">I Wa 9:23</ref></char></note>Anplis, Salomon te gen twa-mil-twa-san depite an chèf ki te sou pwojè a. Yo te chèf dirijan sou moun ki t ap fè travay yo. <verse eid="1KI 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 5:17"/>Alò, wa a te pase lòd pou yo te taye<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:7">I Wa 6:7</ref></char></note>gwo wòch yo, wòch chè pou poze fondasyon kay la ak wòch taye. <verse eid="1KI 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 5:18"/>Konsa, moun Salomon ki t ap bati yo, moun Hiram ki t ap bati yo, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:5">Jos 13:5</ref></char></note>Gibliyen yo t ap koupe yo e prepare bwa yo ansanm ak wòch yo pou bati kay la.<verse eid="1KI 5:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1KI 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 6:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 3:1-2">II Kwo 3:1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, li te vin rive nan kat-san-katreven ane apre fis Israël yo te sòti nan peyi Égypte la, nan katriyèm ane règn Salomon sou Israël la, nan mwa Ziv la, sa se dezyèm mwa a, ke li te kòmanse bati lakay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="1KI 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 6:2"/>Selon kay ke Salomon te bati pou SENYÈ a, longè li te swasant koude, lajè li te ven koude e wotè li, trant koude. <verse eid="1KI 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 6:3"/>Galeri pa devan antre kay la te ven koude nan longè, ki te koresponn avèk lajè kay la e pwofondè devan kay la te dis koude. <verse eid="1KI 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 6:4"/>Osi pou kay la li te fè fenèt avèk ankadreman atizan yo. <verse eid="1KI 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 6:5"/>Kont mi kay la, li te bati etaj won ki te antoure mi kay la nèt, ni pa devan, avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:19-20">I Wa 6:19-20</ref></char></note>sanktyè enteryè a; konsa, li te fè chanm yo toupatou. <verse eid="1KI 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 6:6"/>Etaj pi ba a te senk koude nan lajè, mitan an te sis koude nan lajè e twazyèm nan te sèt koude nan lajè. Paske pa deyò, li te fè retrè pou travès yo pa fonse antre nan miray kay la. <verse eid="1KI 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 6:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:25">Egz 20:25</ref></char></note>Kay la, pandan li t ap bati, te bati avèk wòch ki te taye kote yo te fè min wòch. Pa t gen mato, ni rach, ni okenn zouti an fè ki te konn tande nan kay la pandan li t ap bati. <verse eid="1KI 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 6:8"/>Pòtay chanm akote piba a te sou kote dwat a kay la. Epi yo te konn monte pa eskalye ki te fè won pou rive nan etaj mitan an e soti nan mitan an a nan twazyèm nan. <verse eid="1KI 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 6:9"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:14-38">I Wa 6:14-38</ref></char></note>li te bati kay la e te fin fè l. Li te kouvri kay la avèk travès ak planch sèd. <verse eid="1KI 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 6:10"/>Li te bati anplis etaj ki te kont tout kay la, yo chak nan wotè a senk koude. Yo te tache nan kay la avèk bwa sèd.<verse eid="1KI 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 6:11"/>Alò, pawòl SENYÈ a te vini a Salomon e te di: <verse eid="1KI 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 6:12"/>“Kay sa a ke w ap bati a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:5-16">II Sam 7:5-16</ref></char></note>si ou va mache nan règleman Mwen yo, egzekite lòd Mwen yo, kenbe tout kòmandman Mwen yo e mache ladan yo, alò, mwen va fin konplete pawòl ke M te pale a David, papa ou a, avèk ou. <verse eid="1KI 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 6:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:8">Egz 25:8</ref></char></note>Mwen va vin viv pami fis Israël yo e Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:5">Eb 13:5</ref></char></note>p ap janm kite pèp mwen an, Israël.”<verse eid="1KI 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 6:14"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 6:9-38">I Wa 6:9-38</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, Salomon te bati kay la e te fini avèk li. <verse eid="1KI 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 6:15"/>Li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:7">I Wa 7:7</ref></char></note>bati mi kay la pa anndan avèk planch sèd. Soti atè jis rive nan plafon an, li te kouvri mi anndan yo avèk bwa e li te kouvri tout atè kay la avèk planch bwa pichpen. <verse eid="1KI 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 6:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 3:8">II Kwo 3:8</ref></char></note>Li te bati ven koude nan kote dèyè kay la avèk planch sèd soti atè a jis rive nan plafon an. Li te bati yo pou li sou anndan kòm yon sanktyè enteryè, menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:3">Eb 9:3</ref></char></note>kote ki pi sen an. <verse eid="1KI 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 6:17"/>Pa devan sanktyè tanp la te karant koude nan longè. <verse eid="1KI 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 6:18"/>Te gen bwa sèd sou kay la anndan, taye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:24">I Wa 7:24</ref></char></note>nan fòm a kalbas avèk flè ki louvri nèt. Tout te fèt an sèd. Pa t gen wòch ki te vizib. <verse eid="1KI 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 6:19"/>Li te prepare yon sanktyè enteryè anndan kay la pou l te kab plase la, lach akò SENYÈ a. <verse eid="1KI 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 6:20"/>Sanktyè enteryè a te ven koude nan longè, ven koude nan lajè ak ven koude nan wotè. Li te kouvri li nèt avèk lò pi. Li te kouvri lotèl la avèk sèd. <verse eid="1KI 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 6:21"/>Konsa, Salomon te kouvri anndan kay la avèk lò pi. Li te fè chenn an lò travèse pati devan nan sanktyè enteryè a, e li te kouvri li avèk lò. <verse eid="1KI 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 6:22"/>Li te kouvri tout kay la avèk lò jiskaske tout kay la te fini. Osi, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:1-6">Egz 30:1-6</ref></char></note>tout lotèl ki te akote sanktyè enteryè li a te kouvri avèk lò.<verse eid="1KI 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 6:23"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 37:7-9">Egz 37:7-9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nan sanktyè enteryè a, li te fè de cheriben ak bwa doliv, yo chak nan dis koude wotè. <verse eid="1KI 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 6:24"/>Yon zèl nan cheriben an te senk koude e lòt la te senk koude. Soti nan pwent a yon zèl jis rive nan pwent a lòt zèl la se te dis koude. <verse eid="1KI 6:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 6:25"/>Lòt cheriben an te dis koude. Toude cheriben yo te menm mezi avèk menm fòm. <verse eid="1KI 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 6:26"/>Wotè a yon cheriben se te dis koude e lòt cheriben an te menm jan an. <verse eid="1KI 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 6:27"/>Li te plase cheriben yo nan mitan kay enteryè a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:20">Egz 25:20</ref></char></note>Zèl a cheriben yo te lonje tou louvri, jiskaske zèl a youn te touche mi an, e zèl a lòt cheriben an te touche lòt mi an. Konsa, zèl a chak nan yo te touche zèl a lòt la nan mitan kay la. <verse eid="1KI 6:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 6:28"/>Li te kouvri cheriben yo avèk lò.<verse eid="1KI 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 6:29"/>Epi li te grave tout mi nan kay yo toupatou avèk cheriben yo, pye palmis ak flè louvri yo grave nan sanktyè enteryè ansanm ak eksteryè yo. <verse eid="1KI 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 6:30"/>Li te kouvri planch atè yo avèk lò, nan sanktyè enteryè avèk eksteryè a. <verse eid="1KI 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 6:31"/>Nan antre sanktyè enteryè a, li te fè pòt avèk bwa doliv, ankadreman chanbrann nan avèk poto pòtay yo an senk fas. <verse eid="1KI 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 6:32"/>Konsa, li te fè de pòt avèk bwa doliv la e li te grave sou yo cheriben grave yo, pye palmis yo, avèk flè louvri yo. Li te kouvri yo avèk lò. Epi li te gaye lò a sou cheriben yo avèk pye palmis yo. <verse eid="1KI 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 6:33"/>Anplis, li te fè poto yo an kat fas avèk bwa doliv la pou gran antre eksteryè a, <verse eid="1KI 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 6:34"/>epi de pòt an bwa siprè; de mwatye a yon pòt ki vire sou pivo e de mwatye sou lòt pòt la te vire sou pivo. <verse eid="1KI 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 6:35"/>Li te grave sou li cheriben yo, pye palmis ak flè louvri yo; epi li te kouvri yo avèk lò aplike nan menm fòs toupatou. <verse eid="1KI 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 6:36"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:12">I Wa 7:12</ref></char></note>Li te bati galeri enteryè a avèk twa ranje wòch taye ak yon ranje travès fèt an sèd.<verse eid="1KI 6:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 6:37"/>Nan katriyèm ane a, nan mwa Ziv la, fondasyon kay SENYÈ a te fin poze. <verse eid="1KI 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 6:38"/>Nan onzyèm ane a, nan mwa Bul la, ki se uityèm mwa a, kay la te fini nan tout pati li e selon plan pa li a. Konsa, li te bati pandan sèt ane.<verse eid="1KI 6:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1KI 7"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 7:1"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:1">I Wa 3:1</ref></char></note>Salomon te bati pwòp kay pa li pandan trèz ane, e li te fini tout kay li a nèt. <verse eid="1KI 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 7:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:17-21">I Wa 10:17-21</ref></char></note>Li te bati kay la avèk materyo forè Liban an. Longè li te san koude, lajè li te senkant koude e wotè li te trant koude, sou kat ranje pilye yo fèt an sèd avèk travès sèd sou pilye yo. <verse eid="1KI 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 7:3"/>Li te mete pano an sèd yo anwo chanm akote ki te sou karant-senk pilye yo, kenz nan chak ranje. <verse eid="1KI 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 7:4"/>Te gen fenèt ki te dekore an twa ranje ak fenèt ki te opoze a fenèt yo an twa ranje. <verse eid="1KI 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 7:5"/>Tout pòtay avèk poto pòt yo te gen ankadreman kare, byen dekore e fenèt yo te opoze a pòt yo an twa ranje. <verse eid="1KI 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 7:6"/>Li te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:12">I Wa 7:12</ref></char></note>galeri a avèk pilye yo. Longè li te senkant koude, lajè li te trant koude e yon galeri te devan yo avèk pilye avèk yon pòtay antre pa devan yo. <verse eid="1KI 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 7:7"/>Li te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 122:5">Sòm 122:5</ref></char></note>sal twòn kote li ta jije moun nan, sal jijman an, e atè a te kouvri avèk pano sèd soti nan yon bò pou rive nan lòt la. <verse eid="1KI 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 7:8"/>Kay kote li t ap viv nan lòt lakou anndan an te fèt avèk menm kalite travay la. Li te osi fè yon kay tankou sal sila a pou fi a Farawon an, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:1">I Wa 3:1</ref></char></note>avèk sila li te marye a. <verse eid="1KI 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 7:9"/>Tout sa yo se te avèk wòch presye avèk wòch ki te koupe sou mezi, ki te siye avèk si, anndan kon deyò; menm soti nan fondasyon an jis rive anba twati yo e menm jan an, sou eksteryè a rive nan gran lakou a. <verse eid="1KI 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 7:10"/>Fondasyon an te fèt avèk wòch presye, gwo wòch, wòch nan dis koude ak wòch nan uit koude. <verse eid="1KI 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 7:11"/>Anwo se te wòch presye ki te koupe sou mezi, ansanm ak bwa sèd. <verse eid="1KI 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 7:12"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:36">I Wa 6:36</ref></char></note>gran lakou toutotou a te gen twa ranje wòch koupe ak yon ranje travès sèd; menm jan avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:16">I Wa 7:16</ref></char></note>lakou enteryè lakay SENYÈ a ak galri kay la.<verse eid="1KI 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 7:13"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 2:13-14">II Kwo 2:13-14</ref></char></note>Wa Salomon te voye mennen Hiram soti Tyr. <verse eid="1KI 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 7:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:14">II Wa 2:14</ref></char></note>Li te fis a yon vèv soti nan tribi Nephtali e papa li te yon moun Tyr, yon travayè nan bwonz. Li te ranpli avèk sajès avèk konprann ak kapasite pou fè nenpòt kalite èv an bwonz. Konsa li te vini a Wa Salomon pou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 4:11-16">II Kwo 4:11-16</ref></char></note>fè tout travay li yo. <verse eid="1KI 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 7:15"/>Li te fòme <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:17">II Wa 25:17</ref></char></note>de pilye an bwonz yo, dizuit koude se te wotè a chak pilye e yon lign a douz koude te mezire distans antoure won a toude. <verse eid="1KI 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 7:16"/>Li osi te fè de tèt kouvèti an bwonz fonn pou plase sou tèt a pilye yo. Wotè a yon tèt kouvèti te senk koude e wotè a lòt tèt kouvèti a te senk koude. <verse eid="1KI 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 7:17"/>Te gen yon sistèm rezo fèt avèk chenn an fil tòde pou tèt kouvèti ki te sou tèt pilye yo: sèt pou yon tèt kouvèti e sèt pou lòt tèt kouvèti a. <verse eid="1KI 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 7:18"/>Konsa, li te fè pilye yo: te gen de ranje antoure youn nan sistèm rezo yo pou kouvri tèt kouvèti ki te anwo grenad yo; epi se konsa li te fè pou lòt tèt kouvèti a. <verse eid="1KI 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 7:19"/>Tèt kouvèti ki te sou tèt pilye nan galeri yo te fèt ak desen flè lis, nan lajè kat koude. <verse eid="1KI 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 7:20"/>Te gen tèt kouvèti yo sou de pilye yo, antoure avèk de-san grenad an ranje won ki pa an wo a chak tèt kouvèti, toupre rezo a. Epi de-san grenad te ranje toutotou de toulède tèt kouvèti yo. <verse eid="1KI 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 7:21"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 3:17">II Kwo 3:17</ref></char></note>Konsa, li te ranje pilye yo sou galeri gran chanm nan. Epi li te monte pilye adwat la e li te rele li Jakin; li te monte pilye agoch la e li te rele li Boaz. <verse eid="1KI 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 7:22"/>Sou tèt pilye yo se te yon desen flè lis. Se konsa èv pilye yo te fini.<verse eid="1KI 7:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 7:23"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 4:2">II Kwo 4:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, li te fè fòm lanmè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:17">II Wa 16:17</ref></char></note>fonde an metal dis koude soti nan yon bò a yon lòt, an fòm tou won e wotè li se te senk koude ak trant koude ki pou antoure l. <verse eid="1KI 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 7:24"/>Anba bò li a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:18">I Wa 6:18</ref></char></note>kalbas yo te antoure li tou won, dis nan chak koude e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 4:3">II Kwo 4:3</ref></char></note>antoure lanmè a nèt. Kalbas yo te an de ranje, fonde ansanm avèk tout lòt bagay. <verse eid="1KI 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 7:25"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 4:4-5">II Kwo 4:4-5</ref></char></note>Lanmè a te kanpe sou douz bèf, twa avèk fas vè nò, twa avèk fas vè lwès, twa avèk fas vè sid e twa avèk fas vè lès. Li te poze sou yo e tout pati dèyè yo te vè anndan. <verse eid="1KI 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 7:26"/>Gwosè li te mezi a yon pla men pwès e arebò li te fèt tankou arebò a yon tas, tankou yon flè lis. Li te kab kenbe kantite volim a de mil bat.<verse eid="1KI 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 7:27"/>Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:38">I Wa 7:38</ref></char></note>li te fè dis baz yo an bwonz. Longè a chak baz te kat koude, lajè li se te kat koude e wotè li se te twa koude. <verse eid="1KI 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 7:28"/>Sila a se te desen a baz yo: yo te gen arebò, menm arebò antre ankadreman travès yo. <verse eid="1KI 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 7:29"/>Epi sou arebò ki te antre ankadreman yo, te gen lyon yo, bèf yo, avèk cheriben yo. Sou ankadreman yo, te gen yon etaj anlè e anba lyon yo avèk bèf yo, te gen zèv atizan kouwòn ki te pann. <verse eid="1KI 7:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 7:30"/>Alò, chak baz te gen kat wou an bwonz avèk shaf an bwonz, kat pye li yo te gen soutyen yo. Anba basen an, te soutni sipò yo avèk gilann yo chak kote. <verse eid="1KI 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 7:31"/>Ouvèti li anndan tèt kouvèti pa anwo baz la te yon koude e ouvèti li a te won tankou desen a yon etaj won, yon koude-edmi; epi osi nan ouvèti li a, te grave desen yo, arebò yo te kare, yo pa t won. <verse eid="1KI 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 7:32"/>Kat wou yo te anba arebò yo e shaf a wou yo te sou baz la. Wotè a wou a te yon koude edmi. <verse eid="1KI 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 7:33"/>Kalite travay a wou yo te tankou kalite travay a yon wou cha. Shaf pa yo, jant yo, reyon yo e mitan wo a tout te fonde. <verse eid="1KI 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 7:34"/>Alò, te gen kat soutyen nan kat kwen a chak baz. Soutyen yo te yon pati nan baz la menm. <verse eid="1KI 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 7:35"/>Anwo baz la te kanpe yon fòm fèt tou won, avèk wotè a yon mwatye koude. Sou tèt a baz la, soutyen pa li avèk arebò li yo te fèt tankou yon pati ladann. <verse eid="1KI 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 7:36"/>Li te grave sou plat a soutyen li yo, sou arebò li yo, cheriben yo, lyon yo ak pye palmis yo selon espas disponib nan chak, avèk kouwòn yo toutotou li. <verse eid="1KI 7:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 7:37"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 4:14">II Kwo 4:14</ref></char></note>Li te fè dis baz yo konsa: yo tout te fonde menm jan; yon sèl mezi ak yon sèl fòm. <verse eid="1KI 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 7:38"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 30:18">Egz 30:18</ref></char></note>Li te fè dis basen yo an bwonz, yon basen te kenbe karant bat 880 lit; chak basen te kat koude e nan chak nan dis baz yo, te gen yon basen. <verse eid="1KI 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 7:39"/>Li te poze baz yo, senk sou kote dwat a kay la e senk sou kote goch a kay la. Li te poze lanmè an metal fonn nan sou kote dwat a kay la vè lès la, vè sid.<verse eid="1KI 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 7:40"/>Alò Hiram te fè basen sa yo, ansanm ak pèl ak bòl yo. Konsa, Hiram te fin fè tout èv ke li te fè pou Salomon lakay SENYÈ a: <verse eid="1KI 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 7:41"/>de pilye yo, de bòl pou tèt kouvèti ki te poze sou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:17-18">I Wa 7:17-18</ref></char></note>de pilye yo ak de sistèm rezo pou kouvri de bòl tèt kouvèti ki te sou tèt pilye yo. <verse eid="1KI 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 7:42"/>Anplis, li te mete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:20">I Wa 7:20</ref></char></note>kat-san grenad pou de sistèm rezo yo, de ranje grenad pou chak sistèm rezo, pou kouvri de tèt kouvèti ki te sou tèt pilye yo; <verse eid="1KI 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 7:43"/>dis baz avèk dis basen yo sou baz yo; <verse eid="1KI 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 7:44"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:23-25">I Wa 7:23-25</ref></char></note>yon sèl lanmè ak douz bèf anba lanmè a; <verse eid="1KI 7:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 7:45"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 27:3">Egz 27:3</ref></char></note>bokit yo avèk pèl yo ak tèt kouvèti yo. Menm tout zouti sila yo ke Hiram te fè pou Wa Salomon nan kay SENYÈ a te fèt avèk bwonz poli. <verse eid="1KI 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 7:46"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 4:17">II Kwo 4:17</ref></char></note>Nan plèn Jourdain an, wa a te fonn yo, nan tè ajil la antre Succoth ak Tsarthan. <verse eid="1KI 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 7:47"/>Salomon te kite tout veso yo san peze, paske yo te twòp. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 22:3-14">I Kwo 22:3-14</ref></char></note>Pwa a bwonz lan pa t kab detèmine.<verse eid="1KI 7:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 7:48"/>Salomon te fè tout mèb ki te lakay SENYÈ a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 37:10-29">Egz 37:10-29</ref></char></note> lotèl an lò, tab an lò, sou sila <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:30">Egz 25:30</ref></char></note>pen a Prezans lan te ye a; <verse eid="1KI 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 7:49"/>chandelye yo, senk adwat e senk agoch, pa devan nan sanktyè enteryè a, avèk lò pi; epi flè yo avèk lanp yo avèk pensèt yo, tout te an lò. <verse eid="1KI 7:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 7:50"/>Epi tas yo avèk etoufè yo, bòl yo avèk kiyè yo ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 27:3">Egz 27:3</ref></char></note>plato an lò pi pou resevwa sann yo; epi chanyè pou toulède pòt kay enteryè yo, lye pi sen pase tout kote a, ak chanyè pou pòt kay la, sa vle di, gran sanktyè a, te an lò.<verse eid="1KI 7:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 7:51"/>Konsa, tout travay ke Wa Salomon te fè lakay SENYÈ a te fini. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:11">II Sam 8:11</ref></char></note>Salomon te fè antre tout bagay ki te dedye pa papa li, David—ajan avèk lò ak zouti yo—li te mete yo nan trezò a lakay SENYÈ a.<verse eid="1KI 7:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1KI 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 8:1"/>Alò, Salomon te rasanble ansyen Israël yo avèk tout tèt a tribi yo, chèf a fanmi zansèt a fis Israël yo, kote Wa Salomon Jérusalem, pou mennen fè monte<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 5:2-10">II Kwo 5:2-10</ref></char></note>lach akò SENYÈ a soti nan lavil David ki Sion an. <verse eid="1KI 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 8:2"/>Tout mesye Israël yo te rasanble yo menm kote ak Wa Salomon nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:34">Lev 23:34</ref></char></note>fèt la nan mwa Éthanim nan, ki se setyèm mwa a. <verse eid="1KI 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 8:3"/>Tout ansyen Israël yo te vini, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:9">Det 31:9</ref></char></note>prèt yo te leve pran lach la. <verse eid="1KI 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 8:4"/>Yo te mennen fè monte lach SENYÈ a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:4">I Wa 3:4</ref></char></note>tant asanble a, avèk tout zouti sen ki te nan tant yo. Prèt yo avèk Levit yo te mennen fè yo monte. <verse eid="1KI 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 8:5"/>Wa Salomon avèk tout kongregasyon Israël la, ki te rasanble vè li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:13">II Sam 6:13</ref></char></note>te avèk li devan lach la. Yo t ap fè sakrifis a yon tèlman gran kantite mouton avèk bèf ke yo pa t kab konte ni kontwole. <verse eid="1KI 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 8:6"/>Prèt yo te mennen lach akò SENYÈ a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:19">I Wa 6:19</ref></char></note>nan plas li. Yo te mete l nan sanktyè enteryè a kay la, nan plas ki sen pase tout lòt yo a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:27">I Wa 6:27</ref></char></note>anba zèl a cheriben yo. <verse eid="1KI 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 8:7"/>Cheriben yo te lonje zèl pa yo anwo plas lach la e yo te sèvi kon yon kouvèti sou lach la avèk poto li yo soti anwo. <verse eid="1KI 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 8:8"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:13-15">Egz 25:13-15</ref></char></note>poto yo te tèlman long ke pwent poto yo te vizib sèlman soti nan lye sen an devan sanktyè enteryè a. Men yo pa t kab wè pa deyò; epi yo la jis rive jodi a. <verse eid="1KI 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 8:9"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:2-5">Det 10:2-5</ref></char></note>Pa t gen anyen nan lach la sof ke de tablo wòch ke Moïse te mete la nan Horeb yo, kote SENYÈ a te fè yon akò avèk fis Israël yo, lè yo te sòti nan peyi Égypte la. <verse eid="1KI 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 8:10"/>Li te fèt ke lè prèt yo te sòti nan lye sen an ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:34-35">Egz 40:34-35</ref></char></note>nwaj la te ranpli kay SENYÈ a, <verse eid="1KI 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 8:11"/>jiskaske prèt yo pa t kab fè sèvis akoz nwaj la. Paske glwa SENYÈ a te ranpli kay SENYÈ a.<verse eid="1KI 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 8:12"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 6:1">II Kwo 6:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, Salomon te di: “SENYÈ a te di ke Li ta abite nan nwaj pwès. <verse eid="1KI 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 8:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:13">II Sam 7:13</ref></char></note>Mwen te vrèman bati pou Ou yon kay byen wo, yon plas pou Ou ta abite jis pou tout tan.”<verse eid="1KI 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 8:14"/>Konsa, wa a te vire tounen e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 6:18">II Sam 6:18</ref></char></note>beni tout asanble Israël la pandan tout asanble Israël la te kanpe. <verse eid="1KI 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 8:15"/>Li te di: “Beni se SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-13">II Sam 7:12-13</ref> </char></note>ki te pale avèk bouch li a papa m David, e ki te akonpli sa avèk men l, e ki te di: <verse eid="1KI 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 8:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:4-5">II Sam 7:4-5</ref></char></note>‘Depi jou ke M te fè pèp Mwen an, Israël, sòti an Égypte, Mwen pa t chwazi yon vil nan tout tribi Israël yo pou M ta bati yon kay pou non Mwen ta kapab la; men mwen te chwazi David pou renye sou pèp Mwen an, Israël.’<verse eid="1KI 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 8:17"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 7:2-3">II Sam 7:2-3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Alò, sa te nan kè papa m, David pou bati yon kay pou non SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la. <verse eid="1KI 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 8:18"/>Men SENYÈ a te di a papa m, David: ‘Akoz li te nan kè ou pou bati yon kay pou non Mwen, ou te fè byen, paske se te nan kè ou. <verse eid="1KI 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 8:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:5-13">II Sam 7:5-13</ref></char></note>Sepandan, ou p ap bati kay la, men fis ou ki va fèt a ou menm nan, li va bati kay la pou non Mwen.’ <verse eid="1KI 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 8:20"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te fin akonpli pawòl ke Li te pale a. Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 28:5-6">I Kwo 28:5-6</ref></char></note>mwen te leve nan plas papa m, David. Mwen chita sou twòn Israël la, jan SENYÈ a te pwomèt la, e mwen te bati kay la pou non SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la. <verse eid="1KI 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 8:21"/>La mwen te poze yon plas pou lach la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:26">Det 31:26</ref></char></note>nan sila akò a ke SENYÈ a te fè avèk zansèt nou yo lè Li te mennen yo soti nan peyi Égypte la.”<verse eid="1KI 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 8:22"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:54">I Wa 8:54</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Salomon te kanpe devan lotèl SENYÈ a nan prezans a tout asanble Israël la, e te lonje ouvri men li vè syèl la. <verse eid="1KI 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 8:23"/>Li te di: “O SENYÈ, Bondye Israël la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:2">I Sam 2:2</ref></char></note>nanpwen Bondye tankou Ou nan syèl la anwo, ni sou latè anba, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:9">Det 7:9</ref></char></note>k ap kenbe akò e montre lanmou dous a sèvitè Ou yo ki mache devan Ou avèk tout kè yo, <verse eid="1KI 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 8:24"/>ki te kenbe avèk sèvitè Ou, papa m, David, sa ke Ou te pwomèt li a. Anverite Ou te pale avèk bouch Ou e Ou te akonpli li avèk men Ou, jan sa ye nan jou sila a. <verse eid="1KI 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 8:25"/>Alò, pou sa, O SENYÈ, Bondye Israël la, kenbe avèk sèvitè Ou a, David, papa m, sa ke Ou te pwomèt li a lè Ou te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:4">I Wa 2:4</ref></char></note>‘Ou p ap manke yon nonm pou chita sou twòn Israël la, si sèlman fis ou yo veye chemen yo, pou mache devan Mwen menm jan ke ou te mache a.’<verse eid="1KI 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 8:26"/>“Koulye a, pou sa, O Bondye Israël la, kite pawòl Ou, mwen priye, vin konfime <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:25">II Sam 7:25</ref></char></note>ke Ou te pale a sèvitè Ou a, papa m, David. <verse eid="1KI 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 8:27"/>Men èske Bondye, anverite, va rete sou latè? Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 139:7-16">Sòm 139:7-16</ref></char></note>syèl la avèk syèl pi wo a p ap kab kenbe Ou; konbyen anplis kay sa a ke m te bati a! <verse eid="1KI 8:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 8:28"/>Sepandan, gade lapriyè sèvitè Ou a, avèk siplikasyon pa li, O SENYÈ, Bondye mwen, pou koute kri ak lapriyè ke sèvitè Ou a fè devan Ou jodi a; <verse eid="1KI 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 8:29"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 7:15">II Kwo 7:15</ref></char></note>pou zye Ou ta rete louvri vè kay sila a lajounen kon lannwit, vè plas kote Ou te di: ‘Non Mwen va rete la,’ pou koute lapriyè ke sèvitè ou a va fè vè plas sa a. <verse eid="1KI 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 8:30"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 6:1">Né 6:1</ref></char></note>Koute siplikasyon a sèvitè Ou, e a pèp Ou a, Israël <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 6:10">Dan 6:10</ref></char></note>lè yo priye vè plas sila a. Koute nan syèl la, kote Ou abite a; e lè Ou koute, padone.<verse eid="1KI 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 8:31"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 22:8-11">Egz 22:8-11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Si yon nonm peche kont vwazen li, e si li oblije fè yon ve, si li vin fè ve a devan lotèl Ou, nan kay sila a, <verse eid="1KI 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 8:32"/>alò, tande nan syèl la e pran desizyon pou jije sèvitè Ou yo; <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:1">Det 25:1</ref></char></note>kondane mechan an, fè chemen pa li a vin sou pwòp tèt li. Epi fè jistis vini sou sila ki dwat la, lè Ou ba li selon ladwati li.<verse eid="1KI 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 8:33"/>“Lè pèp Ou a, Israël fin bat devan yon lènmi, akoz yo te peche kont Ou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:40-42">Lev 26:40-42</ref></char></note>si yo vire vè Ou ankò pou konfese non Ou, priye e fè siplikasyon vè Ou nan kay sa a, <verse eid="1KI 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 8:34"/>alò, tande nan syèl la, e padone peche a pèp Ou a Israël, e mennen yo retounen nan peyi ke Ou te bay zansèt yo.<verse eid="1KI 8:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 8:35"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 11:16-17">Det 11:16-17</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Lè syèl yo fèmen e nanpwen lapli, akoz yo te peche kont Ou, si yo priye vè plas sila a, konfese non Ou, e vire kite peche pa yo lè Ou aflije yo, <verse eid="1KI 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 8:36"/>alò, tande nan syèl la e padone peche a sèvitè Ou yo, e a pèp Ou a, Israël. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 5:8">Sòm 5:8</ref></char></note>Anverite, enstwi yo nan bon chemen nan sila yo ta dwe mache a, e voye lapli sou peyi ke Ou te bay a pèp Ou a, ke Ou te bay yo a kòm eritaj la.<verse eid="1KI 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 8:37"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 26:16-26">Lev 26:16-26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>“Si gen gwo grangou nan peyi a, si gen toumant, si gen gwo maladi sou jaden oswa bèt, oswa wouy, epidemi nan youn nan espès krikèt volan yo, si lènmi pa yo fè syèj sou yo nan peyi vil pa yo, nenpòt kalite toumant, nenpòt gwo maladi, <verse eid="1KI 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 8:38"/>nenpòt lapriyè oswa siplikasyon ki fèt pa nenpòt moun, oswa pa tout pèp Israël yo, chak moun ki konnen afliksyon nan pwòp kè pa li, e ki leve men l ouvri vè kay sila a; <verse eid="1KI 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 8:39"/>alò, tande nan syèl la, kote Ou abite a, padone, aji e rann a chak moun selon tout chemen yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:3">I Sam 2:3</ref></char></note>kè a sila Ou konnen an, paske se Ou sèl ki konnen kè a tout fis a lòm yo; <verse eid="1KI 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 8:40"/>pou yo kapab gen lakrent Ou tout jou ke yo viv nan peyi ke Ou te bay a zansèt nou yo.<verse eid="1KI 8:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 8:41"/>“Anplis, konsènan etranje ki pa apatyen a pèp Israël Ou a, lè li sòti nan yon peyi lwen pou koz non Ou, <verse eid="1KI 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 8:42"/>(paske yo va tande afè gran non Ou, ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:3">Egz 13:3</ref></char></note>men pwisan Ou, ak bra louvri Ou), pou lè l vini fè lapriyè vè kay sila a, <verse eid="1KI 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 8:43"/>tande nan syèl la, kote ou abite a e fè tout sa ke etranje a mande Ou fè, jis pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 4:23-24">Jos 4:23-24</ref></char></note>tout pèp sou tout latè yo kapab konnen non Ou, pou gen lakrent Ou, tankou pèp Ou a Israël, pou yo kapab konnen ke kay sila a, mwen te bati a, rele pa non pa Ou.<verse eid="1KI 8:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 8:44"/>“Lè pèp Ou a sòti nan batay kont lènmi yo, nan nenpòt chemen Ou ta voye yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:11">II Kwo 14:11</ref></char></note>yo priye a SENYÈ nan direksyon vil ke Ou te chwazi a, ak kay ke mwen te bati pou non Ou a, <verse eid="1KI 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 8:45"/>alò, tande nan syèl la lapriyè yo, ak siplikasyon yo, e bay soutyen a ka pa yo. <verse eid="1KI 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 8:46"/>Lè yo peche kont Ou (pwiske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:23">Wo 3:23</ref></char></note>nanpwen moun ki pa peche), Ou vin fache avèk yo, e Ou livre yo bay lènmi an pou fè yo sòti kaptif nan peyi a lènmi an, kit lwen, kit pre; <verse eid="1KI 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 8:47"/>si yo vin reflechi nan peyi kote yo te mennen kaptif la, yo vin repanti, e fè siplikasyon a Ou menm nan peyi a sila ki te pran yo kaptif la, e di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 9:6-7">Esd 9:6-7</ref></char></note>‘Nou te peche e te fè inikite, nou te aji mal;’ <verse eid="1KI 8:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 8:48"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:29">Det 4:29</ref></char></note>si yo retounen a Ou menm avèk tout kè yo e avèk tout nanm yo nan peyi a lènmi ki te mennen yo kaptif yo, yo priye a Ou menm, vè peyi ke Ou te bay a zansèt yo, vil ke Ou te chwazi a, ak kay ke mwen te bati pou non Ou an; <verse eid="1KI 8:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 8:49"/>alò, tande priyè yo, avèk siplikasyon yo, nan syèl la, plas kote Ou rete a e bay soutyen a koz pa yo, <verse eid="1KI 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 8:50"/>epi padone pèp Ou a ki te peche kont Ou an ak tout transgresyon ke yo te fè kont Ou yo, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:46">Sòm 106:46</ref></char></note>bay yo mizerikòd devan sila ki te fè yo kaptif yo, pou yo gen konpasyon pou yo. <verse eid="1KI 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 8:51"/>(Pwiske se pèp Ou yo ye, e eritaj ke Ou te mennen sòti an Égypte la, ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:20">Det 4:20</ref></char></note>soti nan mitan founo fè a). <verse eid="1KI 8:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 8:52"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:29">I Wa 8:29</ref></char></note>Pou zye Ou kapab louvri a siplikasyon a sèvitè Ou, e a siplikasyon a pèp Ou a, Israël, pou koute yo nenpòt lè ke yo rele Ou. <verse eid="1KI 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 8:53"/>Paske Ou te mete yo apa de tout lòt pèp sou latè kòm eritaj Ou, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:5-6">Egz 19:5-6</ref></char></note>jan Ou te pale pa Moïse, sèvitè Ou a, pandan Ou te mennen zansèt pa nou yo sòti an Égypte, O Senyè, BONDYE.”<verse eid="1KI 8:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1KI 8:54"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:54 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 7:1">II Kwo 7:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Lè Salomon te fin priye tout priyè sila a, li te leve soti devan lotèl a SENYÈ a, soti sou jenou li avèk men li louvri anvè syèl la. <verse eid="1KI 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1KI 8:55"/>Li te kanpe e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:23-26">Nonb 6:23-26</ref></char></note>beni tout asanble Israël la avèk yon gwo vwa. Li te di: <verse eid="1KI 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1KI 8:56"/>“Beni se SENYÈ a ki te bay repo a pèp Li a, Israël, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:10">Det 12:10</ref></char></note>selon tout sa ke Li te pwomèt yo. Pa menm yon mo pa t fè fayit nan tout bonte ke Li te pwomèt nou pa Moïse yo, sèvitè li a. <verse eid="1KI 8:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1KI 8:57"/>Ke SENYÈ a, Bondye nou an, kapab avèk nou, jan Li te ye avèk zansèt nou yo. Ke Li pa janm kite nou ni abandone nou, <verse eid="1KI 8:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1KI 8:58"/>pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 119:36">Sòm 119:36</ref></char></note>Li kapab atire kè nou vè Li menm, pou mache nan tout vwa Li yo e pou kenbe kòmandman Li yo avèk règleman Li yo avèk òdonans Li yo, ke Li te kòmande a zansèt nou yo. <verse eid="1KI 8:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1KI 8:59"/>Epi ke pawòl pa m sa yo, avèk sila mwen te fè siplikasyon devan SENYÈ a, kapab toupre SENYÈ a, Bondye pa nou an, lajounen kon lannwit, pou Li kapab bay soutyen a koz pèp Li a, Israël, jan chak jou mande a, <verse eid="1KI 8:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1KI 8:60"/>pou tout pèp sou latè yo kapab konnen ke SENYÈ a se Bondye; ke nanpwen okenn lòt.<verse eid="1KI 8:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="1KI 8:61"/>“Pou sa, kite kè nou vin dedye nèt a SENYÈ a, pou mache nan règleman Li yo, kenbe kòmandman Li, menm jan sa ye nan jou sila a.”<verse eid="1KI 8:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1KI 8:62"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:62 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 7:4-10">II Kwo 7:4-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, wa a ak tout Israël avèk li te ofri sakrifis yo devan SENYÈ a. <verse eid="1KI 8:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1KI 8:63"/>Salomon te ofri kòm ofrann lapè ke Li te lofri SENYÈ a, venn-de-mil bèf avèk san-ven-mil mouton. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:63 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:15-18">Esd 6:15-18</ref></char></note>Konsa wa a, avèk tout fis Israël yo te dedye kay SENYÈ a. <verse eid="1KI 8:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="1KI 8:64"/>Nan menm jou sa a, wa a te konsakre lakou mitan ki te devan kay SENYÈ a, akoz se la li te ofri ofrann brile avèk ofrann sereyal yo, e grès a ofrann lapè yo. Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 4:1">II Kwo 4:1</ref></char></note>lotèl bwonz ki te devan SENYÈ a te twò piti pou kenbe ofrann brile avèk ofrann sereyal yo, avèk grès a ofrann lapè yo.<verse eid="1KI 8:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="1KI 8:65"/>Konsa, Salomon te obsève fèt la nan lè sa a, e tout Israël avèk li, yon gran asanble <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:65 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 34:8">Nonb 34:8</ref></char></note>soti nan antre Hamath jis rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:65 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 13:3">Jos 13:3</ref></char></note>ti kouran dlo Égypte la, devan SENYÈ a Bondye nou an, pandan sèt jou e avèk sèt jou anplis, katòz jou nèt. <verse eid="1KI 8:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="1KI 8:66"/>Nan uityèm jou a, li te voye pèp la ale, e yo te beni wa a. Epi yo te ale nan tant pa yo ranpli avèk jwa, kontan nan kè pou tout bonte ke SENYÈ a te montre a David, sèvitè li, e a Israël, pèp Li a.<verse eid="1KI 8:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1KI 9"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 9:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 7:11">II Kwo 7:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, li te vin rive ke lè Salomon te fin bati kay SENYÈ a, ak kay wa a ak tout sa ke Salomon te vle fè, <verse eid="1KI 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 9:2"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:5">I Wa 3:5</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a te parèt a Salomon yon dezyèm fwa, jan Li te parèt kote li nan Gabaon an. <verse eid="1KI 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 9:3"/>SENYÈ a te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 10:17">Sòm 10:17</ref></char></note>“Mwen fin tande priyè ou ak siplikasyon ke ou te fè devan M nan. Mwen te konsakre kay sa a ke ou te bati nan mete non Mwen la pou tout tan. Zye Mwen avèk kè Mwen va la pou tout tan ale nèt. <verse eid="1KI 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 9:4"/>E selon ou menm, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:3">II Wa 20:3</ref></char></note>si ou va mache devan Mwen tankou papa ou, David te mache a, nan entegrite a kè ou, avèk ladwati, e fè selon tout sa ke M te kòmande ou yo, e si ou va kenbe règleman Mwen yo, avèk òdonans Mwen yo, <verse eid="1KI 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 9:5"/>alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12-16">II Sam 7:12-16</ref></char></note>Mwen va etabli twòn wayòm ou sou Israël pou tout tan, jis jan ke M te pwomèt a papa ou, David la, lè M te di: ‘Ou p ap janm manke yon moun sou twòn Israël la.’ <verse eid="1KI 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 9:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:14-16">II Sam 7:14-16</ref></char></note>Men si ou menm, oswa fis ou yo, anverite, vire kite Mwen e pa kenbe kòmandman Mwen yo avèk règleman Mwen ke M te mete devan nou yo; epi ale sèvi lòt dye pou adore yo, <verse eid="1KI 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 9:7"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:4-14">Jr 7:4-14</ref></char></note>alò, Mwen va koupe, retire Israël soti nan peyi ke M te ba yo a, ak kay ke M te konsakre a non Mwen an. Mwen va retire li devan zye m. Konsa, Israël va devni yon pwovèb ak yon pawòl rizib pami tout pèp yo. <verse eid="1KI 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 9:8"/>Epi kay sila a va devni yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:9">II Wa 25:9</ref></char></note>pil ranblè. Tout moun ki pase va sezi e soufle e yo va di: “Poukisa SENYÈ a te fè sa a peyi ak kay sa a? <verse eid="1KI 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 9:9"/>Epi konsa yo va reponn: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:25-28">Det 29:25-28</ref></char></note>‘Akoz yo te abandone SENYÈ a, Bondye pa yo a, ki te mennen zansèt pa yo sòti nan peyi Égypte la. Yo te adopte lòt dye pou te adore yo ak sèvi yo. Pou sa, SENYÈ a te fè rive tout gwo twoub sa a sou yo.’”<verse eid="1KI 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 9:10"/>Li te vin rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:37-38">I Wa 6:37-38</ref></char></note>vè fen ventan ke Salomon t ap bati de kay yo, kay SENYÈ a ak kay wa a, <verse eid="1KI 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 9:11"/>(Hiram, wa Tyr la te founi Salomon avèk bwa sèd ak bwa pichpen avèk lò, selon sa ke li te vle a), alò, Wa Salomon te bay Hiram ven vil nan peyi Galilée. <verse eid="1KI 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 9:12"/>Konsa, Hiram te sòti Tyr pou vin wè vil ke Salomon te ba li yo, e yo pa t fè l kontan. <verse eid="1KI 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 9:13"/>Li te di: “Ki vil sa yo ke ou te ban mwen yo, frè mwen?” Pou rezon sa a, yo te ba yo non a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:27">Jos 19:27</ref></char></note>peyi a Cabul menm rive jis jodi a. <verse eid="1KI 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 9:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:11">I Wa 9:11</ref> </char></note>Epi Hiram te voye a wa a san ven talan lò.<verse eid="1KI 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 9:15"/>Alò, sa se istwa a travay kòve ke Wa Salomon te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 5:13">I Wa 5:13</ref></char></note>fè leve pou bati kay SENYÈ a, lakay pa li a, ak Sitadèl Millo a, miray Jérusalem nan, Hatsor, Méguiddo ak Guézer. <verse eid="1KI 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 9:16"/>Paske Farawon, wa Égypte la te monte, kaptire Guézer. Li te brile li avèk dife, e li te touye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 16:10">Jos 16:10</ref></char></note>Kananeyen ki te rete nan vil yo. Epi li te ba li kòm dwa maryaj fi li a, madanm a Salomon. <verse eid="1KI 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 9:17"/>Konsa, Salomon te rebati Guézer, e piba <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:10">Jos 10:10</ref></char></note>Beth-Horon, <verse eid="1KI 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 9:18"/>epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:44">Jos 19:44</ref></char></note>Balath avèk Tamar nan dezè a, nan peyi Juda, <verse eid="1KI 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 9:19"/>ak tout vil depo ke Salomon te genyen yo, menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:26">I Wa 10:26</ref></char></note>vil pou cha li ak vil pou chevalye pa li yo avèk tout sa ki te fè Salomon plezi pou bati Jérusalem, nan Liban ak nan tout teritwa a anba règ pa li. <verse eid="1KI 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 9:20"/>Tout pèp ki te retay Amoreyen yo, Etyen yo, Ferezyen yo, Evyen yo, Jebizyen yo, ki pa t nan fis Israël yo— <verse eid="1KI 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 9:21"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 1:21-29">Jij 1:21-29</ref></char></note>ak desandan yo ki te swiv yo, nan peyi ke fis Israël yo pa t kapab fin detwi nèt—soti nan yo, Salomon te leve ouvriye kòve yo, menm jiska jodi a. <verse eid="1KI 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 9:22"/>Men Salomon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:39">Lev 25:39</ref></char></note>pa t fè esklav yo pami fis Israël yo, paske yo te sèvi kòm mesye lagè yo, sèvitè li yo, prens li yo, kapitèn li yo, kòmandan a cha li yo, avèk chevalye li yo. <verse eid="1KI 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 9:23"/>Sila yo se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 8:10">II Kwo 8:10</ref></char></note>chèf ofisye ki te sou zèv Salomon yo; senk-san-senkant ki te chèf sou moun ki te fè travay la yo.<verse eid="1KI 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 9:24"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:1">I Wa 3:1</ref></char></note>fi Farawon an te monte soti nan vil David la pou rive nan kay ki te bati pou li a. Epi konsa, Salomon te bati Sitadèl Millo a.<verse eid="1KI 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 9:25"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:14-17">Egz 23:14-17</ref></char></note>twa fwa pa ane, Salomon te ofri ofrann brile avèk ofrann lapè sou lotèl ke li te bati bay SENYÈ a. Li te brile lansan sou yo, sou lotèl ki te devan SENYÈ a. Konsa, li te fini kay la.<verse eid="1KI 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 9:26"/>Wa Salomon osi te bati yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:48">I Wa 22:48</ref></char></note>kantite gwo bato nan Etsjon-Guéber, ki te toupre Éloth arebò Lamè Wouj la, nan peyi Édom an. <verse eid="1KI 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 9:27"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 5:6-9">I Wa 5:6-9</ref></char></note>Epi Hiram te voye sèvitè li yo avèk bato yo, moun lanmè ki te konnen afè lanmè, ansanm avèk sèvitè a Salomon yo. <verse eid="1KI 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 9:28"/>Yo te ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:4">I Kwo 29:4</ref></char></note>Ophir, yo te pran kat-san-ven talan an lò soti la e yo te pote bay Wa Salomon.<verse eid="1KI 9:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1KI 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 10:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:42">Mat 12:42</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, lè rèn Séba a te tande koze a repitasyon Salomon pa non SENYÈ a, li te vini pou pase l a leprèv avèk kesyon difisil. <verse eid="1KI 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 10:2"/>Li te vini Jérusalem avèk yon trè gran kantite moun, avèk chamo ki t ap <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:10">I Wa 10:10</ref></char></note>pote epis, anpil lò avèk pyè presye. Lè li te vini kote Salomon, li te pale avèk li selon tout sa ki te nan kè li. <verse eid="1KI 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 10:3"/>Salomon te reponn a tout kesyon li yo; anyen pa t kache a wa a pou l pa t eksplike li. <verse eid="1KI 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 10:4"/>Lè rèn a Séba te vin konprann tout sajès a Salomon an, kay ke li te bati a, <verse eid="1KI 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 10:5"/>manje sou tab li, kapasite sèvitè li yo, jan moun ki te sèvi tab yo te atantif, jan yo abiye, pòtè tas diven yo, ak eskalye li, kote li te monte rive lakay SENYÈ a, li te vin pa gen kouraj ankò. <verse eid="1KI 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 10:6"/>Konsa, li te di a wa a: “Rapò ke m te tande soti nan peyi mwen selon pawòl ou avèk sajès ou a te vrè. <verse eid="1KI 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 10:7"/>Men mwen pa t kwè rapò yo jiskaske mwen te rive e zye m te wè li. Epi vwala, yo pa t pale m mwatye verite. Ou depase nan sajès avèk richès rapò ke m te tande a. <verse eid="1KI 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 10:8"/>Jan mesye pa ou yo <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 8:34">Pwov 8:34</ref></char></note>beni! Beni se sèvitè ki kanpe devan ou yo tout tan pou tande sajès ou. <verse eid="1KI 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 10:9"/>Beni se SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a, ki te pran plezi nan ou pou mete ou sou twòn Israël la. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 17:22">I Kwo 17:22</ref></char></note>Akoz SENYÈ a te renmen Israël pou tout tan, se pou sa Li te fè ou wa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 72:2">Sòm 72:2</ref> </char></note>pou fè lajistis avèk ladwati.” <verse eid="1KI 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 10:10"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:2">I Wa 10:2</ref></char></note>Li te bay wa a san-ven talan lò, yon gran kantite epis avèk pyè presye. Fòs kantite epis sa a tankou sa ke rèn Séba a te bay a Wa Salomon an pa t janm antre ankò.<verse eid="1KI 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 10:11"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 9:27-28">I Wa 9:27-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Osi, bato a Hiram ki te pote lò ki sòti Ophir yo, te mennen fè antre soti Ophir yon gran kantite pye bwa koray avèk pyè presye. <verse eid="1KI 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 10:12"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:11">II Wa 9:11</ref></char></note>Wa a te fè soutyen lakay SENYÈ a avèk lakay wa a avèk bwa koray yo e osi ap yo avèk gita pou chantè yo. Bwa koray yo tankou sila yo pa t janm antre ankò, ni yo pa t janm wè jis rive jodi a.<verse eid="1KI 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 10:13"/>Wa Salomon te bay a rèn Séba tout sa ke li te dezire, tout sa ke li te mande, anplis de sa li te ba li selon bonte wayal li. Konsa, li te vire retounen nan pwòp peyi pa li a, ansanm avèk sèvitè pa li yo.<verse eid="1KI 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 10:14"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 9:13-28">II Kwo 9:13-28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, pwa lò a ki te antre pou Salomon nan yon ane se te sis-san-swasann-sis talan lò, <verse eid="1KI 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 10:15"/>anplis de sa ki te sòti nan machann avèk byen a tout komèsan yo, tout wa pami <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 9:14">II Kwo 9:14</ref></char></note>Arab yo avèk gouvènè nan chak peyi yo. <verse eid="1KI 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 10:16"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:26-28">I Wa 14:26-28</ref></char></note>Wa Salomon te fè de-san gran boukliye avèk lò bat avèk sis-san sik lò nan chak gran boukliye. <verse eid="1KI 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 10:17"/>Avèk twa-san boukliye nan lò bat, ki te sèvi twa min lò sou chak boukliye e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:2">I Wa 7:2</ref></char></note>wa a te mete yo nan kay Forè Liban an. <verse eid="1KI 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 10:18"/>Anplis, wa a te fè yon gwo twòn avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 9:17">II Kwo 9:17</ref></char></note>ivwa e li te kouvri li avèk lò rafine. <verse eid="1KI 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 10:19"/>Avèk sis machpye monte pou rive nan twòn nan, e yon tèt won sou twòn nan pa dèyè li, bra yo nan chak kote chèz la, e de lyon ki te kanpe akote bra yo. <verse eid="1KI 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 10:20"/>Douz lyon te kanpe la sou sis machpye yo, sou yon kote e menm jan an sou lòt la. Anyen tankou li pa t fèt nan okenn lòt wayòm. <verse eid="1KI 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 10:21"/>Tout veso a Wa Salomon pou bwè yo te fèt an lò. Tout veso nan kay Forè a Liban yo te an lò pi. Nanpwen ki te an ajan. Sa pa t konsidere kòm bagay chè nan jou a Salomon yo. <verse eid="1KI 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 10:22"/>Paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:26-28">I Wa 9:26-28</ref></char></note>wa a te gen sou lanmè a bato a Tarsis avèk bato a Hiram yo. Yon fwa chak twazan bato a Tarsis yo te vini pote lò avèk ajan, ivwa avèk makak ak bèl zwazo pan yo.<verse eid="1KI 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 10:23"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 3:12-13">I Wa 3:12-13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Konsa, Wa Salomon te vin pi gran ke tout wa sou latè yo nan richès avèk sajès. <verse eid="1KI 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 10:24"/>Tout latè t ap chache prezans a Salomon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:9-28">I Wa 3:9-28</ref></char></note>pou tande sajès li ke Bondye te mete nan kè li. <verse eid="1KI 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 10:25"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 68:29">Sòm 68:29</ref></char></note>Chak moun te pote kado li, afè an ajan avèk lò, vètman, zam, epis, cheval avèk milèt, an gran kantite ane pa ane.<verse eid="1KI 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 10:26"/>Alò, Salomon te ranmase cha avèk cheval yo. Li te gen mil-kat-san cha avèk douz-mil chevalye e li te estasyone yo nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:19">I Wa 9:19</ref></char></note>vil cha yo avèk wa a nan Jérusalem. <verse eid="1KI 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 10:27"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:17">Det 17:17</ref></char></note>Wa a te fè ajan vin gaye toupatou tankou wòch Jérusalem. Li te fè sèd yo vin anpil tankou bwa sikomò ki rete nan ba plèn nan. <verse eid="1KI 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 10:28"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:16">Det 17:16</ref></char></note>Osi, lè Salomon te enpòte cheval yo, yo te soti an Égypte avèk Kuwe. Machann a wa yo te chache yo soti Kuwe pou yon pri. <verse eid="1KI 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 10:29"/>Yon cha te konn enpòte soti Égypte pou sis-san sik an ajan ak yon cheval pou san-senkant e pa menm mwayen an, yo te ekspòte yo a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 7:6-7">II Wa 7:6-7</ref></char></note>tout wa Etyen avèk wa Siryen yo.<verse eid="1KI 10:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1KI 11"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 11:1"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:17">Det 17:17</ref></char></note>Wa Salomon te renmen anpil fanm etranje ansanm avèk fi Farawon an: Moabit yo, Amonit yo, Edomit yo, Sidonyen yo ak fanm Etyen yo, <verse eid="1KI 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 11:2"/>ki te soti nan nasyon de sila SENYÈ a te di a fis Israël yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:31-33">Egz 23:31-33</ref></char></note>“Ou p ap asosye avèk yo, ni yo p ap asosye avè w; paske yo va anverite vire kè ou lwen apre dye pa yo.” Salomon te kenbe rèd a sila yo nan renmen an. <verse eid="1KI 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 11:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:13-16">II Sam 5:13-16</ref></char></note>Li te gen sèt-san prensès kòm madanm, twa-san ti mennaj e madanm li yo te vire kè li lwen. <verse eid="1KI 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 11:4"/>Paske lè Salomon te vin vye, madanm li yo te vire kè li lwen apre lòt dye yo. Epi kè li pa t konsakre nèt a SENYÈ a, Bondye pa li a, jan kè David, papa li te ye a. <verse eid="1KI 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 11:5"/>Paske Salomon te kouri dèyè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 7:3-4">I Sam 7:3-4</ref></char></note>Astarté deyès a Sidonyen yo e apre <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:7">I Wa 11:7</ref></char></note>Milcom, zidòl abominab a Amonit yo. <verse eid="1KI 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 11:6"/>Salomon te fè sa ki te mal nan zye a SENYÈ a e li pa t swiv SENYÈ a nèt, jan David, papa li te fè a. <verse eid="1KI 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 11:7"/>Epi Salomon te bati yon wo plas pou Kemosh, wa abominab a Moab la, sou mòn ki nan lès Jérusalem lan e pou Moloc, zidòl abominab a fis a Ammon yo. <verse eid="1KI 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 11:8"/>Se konsa li te fè pou tout madanm etranje li yo. Li te brile lansan e fè sakrifis a dye pa yo. <verse eid="1KI 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 11:9"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te byen fache avèk Salomon akoz kè li te vire lwen SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 3:5">I Wa 3:5</ref></char></note>ki te vin parèt a li de fwa. <verse eid="1KI 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 11:10"/>Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:12">I Wa 6:12</ref></char></note>te kòmande li sou bagay sa a, ke li pa ta dwe ale apre lòt dye yo, men li pa t swiv sa ke SENYÈ a te kòmande a. <verse eid="1KI 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 11:11"/>Pou sa, SENYÈ a te di a Salomon: “Akoz ou te fè sa e ou pa t kenbe akò Mwen, avèk règleman Mwen yo, ke M te kòmande ou pou fè yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 2:30">I Sam 2:30</ref></char></note>Mwen va, anverite, chire wayòm nan soti nan men ou e Mwen va bay li a sèvitè ou. <verse eid="1KI 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 11:12"/>Sepandan, se pa nan jou pa w yo ke M ap fè l, pou koz David, papa ou. Men m ap chire l nan men fis ou yo. <verse eid="1KI 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 11:13"/>Malgre sa, mwen p ap rache tout wayòm nan, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:32-36">I Wa 11:32-36</ref></char></note>Mwen va bay yon tribi a fis ou pou koz a sèvitè Mwen an, David e pou koz Jérusalem ke M te chwazi a.”<verse eid="1KI 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 11:14"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te fè leve yon lènmi a Salomon, Hadad, Edomit lan; li te nan ras wayal a Édom an. <verse eid="1KI 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 11:15"/>Paske li te vin rive ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:14">II Sam 8:14</ref></char></note>lè David te Édom e Joab, chèf lame a te monte pou antere mò yo, li te frape touye tout gason nan Édom yo <verse eid="1KI 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 11:16"/>(paske Joab avèk tout Israël te rete la pandan si mwa, jiskaske li te koupe, fè desann tout gason nan Édom yo.) <verse eid="1KI 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 11:17"/>Se nan moman sa a ke Hadad te sove ale rive an Égypte, li menm avèk kèk Edomit ki te sèvitè a papa li avèk li, pandan Hadad te jenn gason. <verse eid="1KI 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 11:18"/>Yo te leve soti Madian, pou rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 10:12">Nonb 10:12</ref></char></note>Paran. Yo te pran mesye yo avèk yo soti Paran pou te rive an Égypte, kote Farawon, wa Égypte la. Farawon te bay yo yon kay e li te founi Hadad avèk manje e li te bay li tè. <verse eid="1KI 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 11:19"/>Alò, Hadad te twouve gran favè devan Farawon. Konsa, li te ba li nan maryaj, sè a pwòp madanm li, sè a Thachpenès, rèn nan. <verse eid="1KI 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 11:20"/>Sè a Thachpenès la te fè fis li, Guenubath, ke Thachpenès te sevre lakay Farawon pami fis a Farawon yo. <verse eid="1KI 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 11:21"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 2:10">I Wa 2:10</ref></char></note>lè Hadad te tande an Égypte ke David te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo, e ke Joab, chèf lame a te mouri, Hadad te di a Farawon: “Voye mwen ale, pou m kab rive nan pwòp peyi pa mwen.”<verse eid="1KI 11:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 11:22"/>Alò, Farawon te di li: “Men kisa ou te manke avè m, ke konsa, w ap chache ale nan pwòp peyi pa ou?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 11:22">Li te reponn li: “Anyen: men anverite, fòk ou kite mwen ale.”<verse eid="1KI 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 11:23"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 11:14">I Wa 11:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Bondye te osi leve yon lòt lènmi a li menm, Rezon, fis a Éliada a, ki te sove ale devan Chèf li, Hadadézer wa Tsoba a. <verse eid="1KI 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 11:24"/>Li te ranmase moun vè li menm pou te devni chèf a yon twoup bandi mawon. Apre David te vin touye yo nan Tsoba, yo te deplase a Damas pou rete la e te renye Damas. <verse eid="1KI 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 11:25"/>Konsa, li te lènmi a Israël pou tout jou a Salomon yo, ansanm avèk mechanste ke Hadad te fè yo. Li te rayi Israël e li te renye sou Syrie.<verse eid="1KI 11:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 11:26"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:11-28">I Wa 11:11-28</ref></char></note>Jéroboam, fis a Nebath la, yon Efratyen nan Tseréda, yon sèvitè a Salomon, manman a sila ki te rele Tserua a, yon vèv, li osi te fè rebèl kont wa a. <verse eid="1KI 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 11:27"/>Alò, se te pou rezon sa ke li te fè rebèl kont wa a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:15-24">I Wa 9:15-24</ref></char></note>Salomon te bati sitadèl Millo, e li te fèmen brèch nan lavil papa l la, David. <verse eid="1KI 11:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 11:28"/>Alò, Jéroboam te yon gèrye vanyan e lè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 22:29">Pwov 22:29</ref></char></note>Salomon te wè ke jennonm nan te travay byen, li te chwazi li sou tout kòvey lakay Joseph yo. <verse eid="1KI 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 11:29"/>Li te vin rive vè lè sa a, lè Jéroboam te kite Jérusalem, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:15">I Wa 12:15</ref></char></note>pwofèt la, Achija, te mete yon manto nèf sou li; epi yo de a te rankontre ansanm san lòt moun nan mitan chan an. <verse eid="1KI 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 11:30"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:27-28">I Sam 15:27-28</ref></char></note>Achija te sezi kenbe manto nèf ki te sou li a, e li te chire li nan douz mòso. <verse eid="1KI 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 11:31"/>Li te di a Jéroboam: “Pran pou ou menm dis mòso; paske konsa pale SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la: ‘Gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:11-12">I Wa 11:11-12</ref></char></note>Mwen va chire wayòm nan sòti nan men Salomon, e ba ou dis tribi <verse eid="1KI 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 11:32"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:21">I Wa 12:21</ref></char></note>(men li va gen yon tribi pou koz sèvitè Mwen an, David, ak pou koz Jérusalem, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:21">I Wa 14:21</ref></char></note>vil ke M te chwazi soti nan tout tribi Israël yo), <verse eid="1KI 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 11:33"/>akoz yo te abandone Mwen e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:5-8">I Wa 11:5-8</ref></char></note>te adore Astarté deyès a Sidonyen yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 48:7-13">Jr 48:7-13</ref></char></note>Kemosh, dye a Moab la ak Milcom, dye a fis Ammon yo. Epi yo pa t mache nan vwa Mwen yo, pou fè sa ki dwat nan zye M, e swiv règleman Mwen yo avèk òdonans Mwen yo, jan papa li, David te fè a.<verse eid="1KI 11:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 11:34"/>“‘Sepandan, Mwen p ap pran tout wayòm nan sòti nan men l, men Mwen va fè li chèf pandan tout jou lavi li, pou koz David, ke Mwen te chwazi, ki te swiv kòmandman Mwen yo avèk règleman Mwen yo, <verse eid="1KI 11:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 11:35"/>men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:12">I Wa 11:12</ref></char></note>Mwen va rache wayòm nan nan men fis li pou bay ou, menm dis tribi. <verse eid="1KI 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 11:36"/>Men a fis li yo, mwen va bay yon tribi, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:19">II Wa 8:19</ref></char></note>pou sèvitè Mwen an, David kab toujou gen yon lanp devan Mwen nan Jérusalem, vil kote Mwen te chwazi pou Mwen menm nan pou mete non Mwen an. <verse eid="1KI 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 11:37"/>Mwen va pran ou e ou va renye sou nenpòt sa ou vle e ou va wa sou Israël. <verse eid="1KI 11:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 11:38"/>Epi li va ye, ke si ou koute tout sa ke M kòmande ou, mache nan vwa Mwen yo, fè sa ki dwat nan zye Mwen, e swiv règleman Mwen yo avèk kòmandman Mwen yo jan sèvitè Mwen David te fè a, alò, Mwen va avèk ou pou bati pou ou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:11-27">II Sam 7:11-27</ref></char></note>kay k ap dire, jis jan ke M te bati pou David la, e Mwen va bay Israël a ou menm. <verse eid="1KI 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 11:39"/>Konsa, Mwen va aflije desandan a David yo pou sa, men pa pou tout tan.’”<verse eid="1KI 11:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 11:40"/>Akoz sa, Salomon te chache mete Jéroboam a lanmò, men Jéroboam te leve e te sove ale rive an Égypte kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:25">I Wa 14:25</ref></char></note>Schischak, wa Égypte la, e li te rete an Égypte jiska lanmò Salomon.<verse eid="1KI 11:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 11:41"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 9:29">II Wa 9:29</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò tout lòt zèv a Salomon yo ak tout sa li te fè ak sajès li, èske yo pa ekri nan liv a zèv Salomon yo? <verse eid="1KI 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 11:42"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 9:30">II Kwo 9:30</ref></char></note>tan ke Salomon te renye Jérusalem sou tout Israël la se te karantan. <verse eid="1KI 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 11:43"/>Epi Salomon te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo, e li te antere nan vil a papa li, David e fis li a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:21">I Wa 14:21</ref></char></note>Roboam te renye nan plas li.<verse eid="1KI 11:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1KI 12"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 12:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 10:1">II Kwo 10:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Roboam te ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:6">Jij 9:6</ref></char></note>Sichem, paske tout Israël te vini Sichem pou fè li wa a. <verse eid="1KI 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 12:2"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:26-40">I Wa 11:26-40</ref></char></note>lè Jéroboam, fis a Nebath la te tande sa, li t ap viv an Égypte (paske li te toujou an Égypte kote li te sove ale rive soti nan prezans a Wa Salomon). <verse eid="1KI 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 12:3"/>Konsa, yo te voye rele li e Jéroboam avèk tout asanble Israël la te vin pale avèk Roboam. Yo te di: <verse eid="1KI 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 12:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:11-18">I Sam 8:11-18</ref></char></note>“Papa ou te fè jouk nou rèd. Alò pou sa, fè sèvis di a papa ou vin pi lejè e mwens lou ke li te mete sou nou e nou va sèvi ou.”<verse eid="1KI 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 12:5"/>Epi li te di yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:12">I Wa 12:12</ref></char></note>“Kite mwen pandan twa jou e retounen bò kote mwen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 12:5">Konsa, pèp la te ale.<verse eid="1KI 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 12:6"/>Wa Roboam te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:1-6">I Wa 4:1-6</ref></char></note>konsiltasyon avèk ansyen ki te sèvi papa li yo, Salomon, pandan li te toujou vivan an, e li te di: “Ki konsèy n ap ban mwen pou repons a pèp sa a?”<verse eid="1KI 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 12:7"/>Alò, yo te pale avèk li. Yo te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 10:7">II Kwo 10:7</ref></char></note>“Si ou va sèvi pèp sa a jodi a, sede a yo sa ke yo mande e pale bon pawòl avèk yo. Konsa, yo va sèvitè ou pou tout tan.”<verse eid="1KI 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 12:8"/>Men li te rejte konsèy ansyen yo te bay li a e li te konsilte avèk jennonm ki te elve ansanm avèk li pou te sèvi li a. <verse eid="1KI 12:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 12:9"/>Konsa, li te mande yo: “Ki konsèy n ap ban mwen pou nou kapab reponn pèp sa a ki te pale avè m e te di: ‘Fè jouk ke papa ou te mete sou nou an vin pi lejè’?”<verse eid="1KI 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 12:10"/>Jennonm ki te elve ansanm avèk li yo te reponn li e te di: “Se konsa pou ou ta pale avèk pèp sa a ki te pale avèk ou a pou di: ‘Papa ou te fè jouk nou lou. Alò, ou menm, fè l vin pi lejè pou nou.’ Konsa, ou va di yo: ‘Ti dwèt pi piti mwen an pi gwo ke senti papa mwen! <verse eid="1KI 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 12:11"/>Kote nou wè papa m te chaje nou avèk yon jouk lou, mwen va mete ankò sou jouk nou. Papa m te fè disiplin avèk frèt; men mwen va sèvi ak eskòpyon.’”<verse eid="1KI 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 12:12"/>Alò, Jéroboam avèk tout pèp la te vini a Roboam nan twazyèm jou a jan wa a te mande l la, lè l te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:5">I Wa 12:5</ref></char></note>“Retounen kote mwen nan twazyèm jou a. <verse eid="1KI 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 12:13"/>Wa a te reponn pèp la byen rèd, paske li te abandone konsèy ke ansyen yo te bay li a. <verse eid="1KI 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 12:14"/>Li te pale avèk yo selon konsèy a jennonm yo, e te di: ‘Papa m te fè jouk nou byen lou, men mwen va mete anplis sou fado nou. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:13">Egz 1:13</ref></char></note>Papa m te fè disiplin avèk frèt, men mwen va fè disiplin avèk eskòpyon.’”<verse eid="1KI 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 12:15"/>Konsa, wa a pa t koute pèp la; paske evenman yo se te yon dewoulman ki te sòti nan SENYÈ a, jis pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:11-31">I Wa 11:11-31</ref></char></note>Li ta kapab etabli pawòl ke SENYÈ a te pale pa Achija, Siloyit la, a Jéroboam, fis a Nebath la. <verse eid="1KI 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 12:16"/>Lè tout Israël te wè ke wa a pa t koute yo, pèp la te reponn wa a e te di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">“Ki pati nou gen nan David?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">Nanpwen eritaj nan fis Jesse a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">Rive nan tant ou yo O Israël! Soti koulye a!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1KI 12:16">Konsa, David, okipe pwòp lakay ou!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 12:16">Konsa Israël te pati rive nan tant pa yo.<verse eid="1KI 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 12:17"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:13-36">I Wa 11:13-36</ref></char></note>pou fis Israël ki te rete nan vil Juda yo, Roboam te renye sou yo. <verse eid="1KI 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 12:18"/>Epi Wa Roboam te voye <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:24">II Sam 20:24</ref> </char></note>Adoram ki te chèf sou kòve yo, e tout Israël te lapide li avèk kout wòch jiska lanmò. Konsa, Wa Roboam te fè vit monte cha li pou kite Jérusalem. <verse eid="1KI 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 12:19"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:21">II Wa 17:21</ref></char></note>Konsa, Israël te fè rebèl kont lakay David jiska jodi a.<verse eid="1KI 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 12:20"/>Li te vin rive ke lè tout Israël te tande ke Jéroboam te retounen, yo te voye rele li nan asanble a pou te fè li wa sou tout Israël. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:13-36">I Wa 11:13-36</ref></char></note>Okenn sof ke Juda te swiv lakay David.<verse eid="1KI 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 12:21"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 11:1">II Kwo 11:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, lè Roboam te retounen Jérusalem, li te rasanble tout kay Juda a ak tribi Benjamin an, 180,000 mesye chwazi ki te gèrye, pou goumen kont lakay Israël la pou restore wayòm a Roboam nan, fis Salomon an. <verse eid="1KI 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 12:22"/>Men pawòl Bondye te vini a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 11:2">II Kwo 11:2</ref></char></note>Schemaeja, nonm a Bondye a, e te di: <verse eid="1KI 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 12:23"/>“Pale avèk Roboam, fis a Salomon an, wa Juda a e a tout lakay Juda avèk Benjamin, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:17">I Wa 12:17</ref></char></note>a tout lòt pèp yo. Di yo: <verse eid="1KI 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 12:24"/>‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a, “Fòk ou pa monte goumen kont fanmi ou yo, fis Israël yo. Retounen tout moun nan nou lakay nou, paske bagay sa a sòti nan Mwen menm.”’” Konsa, yo te koute pawòl SENYÈ a, e yo te retounen fè wout yo selon pawòl SENYÈ a.<verse eid="1KI 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 12:25"/>Epi, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:45-49">Jij 9:45-49</ref></char></note>Jéroboam te bati Sichem nan peyi ti kolin Ephraïm yo, e li te rete la. Li te sòti depi la pou te bati <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:30-31">Jen 32:30-31</ref></char></note>Penuel. <verse eid="1KI 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 12:26"/>Jéroboam te di nan kè l: “Koulye a, wayòm nan va retounen lakay David. <verse eid="1KI 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 12:27"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:5-7">Det 12:5-7-14</ref></char></note>Si moun sa yo monte pou ofri sakrifis nan kay SENYÈ a Jérusalem; alò, kè a pèp sa a va retounen vè mèt yo; menm vè Roboam, wa Juda a. Epi yo va touye mwen e retounen a Roboam, wa Juda a.” <verse eid="1KI 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 12:28"/>Pou sa, wa Jéroboam te konsilte, e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 8:4-7">Os 8:4-7</ref></char></note>fè de ti bèf an lò. Li te di a pèp la: “Se twòp pou nou ta monte Jérusalem. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:4-8">Egz 32:4-8</ref></char></note>Men vwala, dye pa nou yo, O Israël, ki te mennen nou monte soti nan peyi Égypte la.” <verse eid="1KI 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 12:29"/>Li te plase <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:5">Os 10:5</ref></char></note>youn nan Béthel e lòt la, li te mete li Dan. <verse eid="1KI 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 12:30"/>Alò, bagay sa a te devni yon peche. Paske pèp la te ale pou adore devan youn nan yo jis rive Dan. <verse eid="1KI 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 12:31"/>Konsa, Jéroboam te fè kay sou wo plas yo e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:33">I Wa 13:33</ref></char></note>fè prèt yo soti pami moun ki pa t pami fis a Lévi yo. <verse eid="1KI 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 12:32"/>Jéroboam te etabli yon fèt nan di-zuityèm mwa, sou kenzyèm jou nan mwa a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:33-34">Lev 23:33-34</ref></char></note>tankou fèt ki nan Juda a, e li te monte vè lotèl la. Konsa li te fè nan Béthel e li te fè sakrifis a ti bèf ke li te fè yo. Anplis, li te estasyone Béthel prèt pou wo plas ke li te fè yo. <verse eid="1KI 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 12:33"/>Alò, li te monte kote lotèl ke li te fè Béthel nan kenzyèm jou nan di-zuityèm mwa ke li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 15:39">Nonb 15:39</ref></char></note>chwazi nan pwòp kè li a; epi li te etabli yon fèt pou fis Israël yo, e li te monte vè lotèl la pou brile lansan.<verse eid="1KI 12:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1KI 13"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 13:1"/>Alò, vwala, te vini <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:22">I Wa 12:22</ref></char></note> yon nonm Bondye soti Juda rive Béthel pa pawòl SENYÈ a, pandan Jéroboam te kanpe akote lotèl la pou brile lansan an. <verse eid="1KI 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 13:2"/>Li te kriye kont lotèl la pa pawòl SENYÈ a. Li te di: “O lotèl, lotèl, konsa di SENYÈ a: ‘Veye byen, yon fis va ne nan kay David la. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:15-16">II Wa 23:15-16</ref></char></note>Josias va non li. Epi sou ou, li va fè sakrifis a prèt ki brile lansan sou ou yo, ak zo Kretyen yo ki va brile sou ou.’” <verse eid="1KI 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 13:3"/>Konsa, li te bay yon sign nan menm jou sa, e li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:18">Jn 2:18</ref></char></note>“Sa se sign ke SENYÈ a te pale a: Gade byen, lotèl la va vin fann separe e sann ki sou li yo va vide deyò.”<verse eid="1KI 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 13:4"/>Alò, lè wa a te tande pawòl a nonm Bondye a, ke li te kriye kont lotèl Béthel la, Jéroboam te lonje men l soti nan lotèl la. Li te di: “Sezi li.” Men men ke li te lonje kont li an te vin sèch, jiskaske li pa t kab rale retounen l kote li. <verse eid="1KI 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 13:5"/>Lotèl la osi te ouvri fann e sann yo te vide nèt soti nan lotèl la, selon sign ke nonm a Bondye a te bay selon pawòl SENYÈ a. <verse eid="1KI 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 13:6"/>Wa a te di a nonm Bondye a: “Souple, fè yon lapriyè a SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a e mande pou mwen, pou men m kapab vin restore a mwen menm.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 13:6">Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luc 6:27-28</ref></char></note>nonm Bondye a te priye a SENYÈ a, epi men a wa a te restore de li menm. Li te vin jan li te ye avan an.<verse eid="1KI 13:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 13:7"/>Alò, wa a te di a nonm Bondye a: “Vin lakay la avèk mwen pou rafrechi ou, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 9:7-8">I Sam 9:7-8</ref></char></note>mwen va ba ou yon rekonpans.”<verse eid="1KI 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 13:8"/>Men nonm Bondye a te di a wa a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:18">Nonb 22:18</ref></char></note>“Menmsi ou te ban mwen menm mwatye kay ou, mwen pa t ap prale avèk ou, ni mwen pa t ap manje pen, ni bwè dlo nan plas sa a. <verse eid="1KI 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 13:9"/>Paske se konsa li te kòmande mwen pa pawòl SENYÈ a e te di: ‘Ou pa pou manje okenn pen, ni bwè dlo, ni retounen pa chemen ke ou te vini an.’” <verse eid="1KI 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 13:10"/>Pou sa, li te fè yon lòt chemen e li pa t retounen pa chemen ke li te vini Béthel la.<verse eid="1KI 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 13:11"/>Alò, yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:25">I Wa 13:25</ref></char></note>pwofèt granmoun t ap viv Béthel, epi fis li yo te vini pou te di li tout zèv ke nonm Bondye a te fè pandan jou sa nan Béthel. Yo te pale li pawòl yo ke li te pale a wa a.<verse eid="1KI 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 13:12"/>Papa yo te di yo: “Se ki direksyon li te pran?” Alò, fis li yo te wè direksyon ke nonm Bondye ki te sòti Juda a te pran an. <verse eid="1KI 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 13:13"/>Epi li te di a fis li yo: “Sele bourik la pou mwen.” Konsa, yo te sele bourik la pou li e li te sòti sou li. <verse eid="1KI 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 13:14"/>Konsa, li te ale dèyè nonm Bondye a. Li te twouve li te chita anba yon pye bwadchenn. Konsa, li te mande l: “Èske ou menm se nonm Bondye ki te sòti Juda a?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 13:14">Li te reponn: “Se mwen”.<verse eid="1KI 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 13:15"/>Konsa, li te di li: “Vin lakay mwen pou manje pen.”<verse eid="1KI 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 13:16"/>Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:8-9">I Wa 13:8-9</ref></char></note>“Mwen p ap kab retounen avèk ou, ni ale avèk ou, ni mwen p ap manje pen ni bwè dlo avèk ou nan plas sa a. <verse eid="1KI 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 13:17"/>Paske yon lòd rive jwenn mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 20:35">I Wa 20:35</ref></char></note>pa pawòl SENYÈ a: ‘Ou pa pou manje pen, ni bwè dlo, ni pa retounen pa chemen ke ou te vini an.’”<verse eid="1KI 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 13:18"/>Li te di li: “Mwen menm se yon pwofèt tankou ou, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 1:8">Gal 1:8</ref></char></note>yon zanj te pale avèk mwen pa pawòl SENYÈ, e li te di: ‘Mennen li retounen lakay ou avèk ou pou l kab manje pen ak bwè dlo. Men se manti li t ap fè.’”<verse eid="1KI 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 13:19"/>Konsa, li te retounen avèk li e te manje pen lakay li a e te bwè dlo. <verse eid="1KI 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 13:20"/>Alò, li te vin rive, pandan yo te chita sou tab la a, ke pawòl SENYÈ a te vini a pwofèt ki te fè li retounen an; <verse eid="1KI 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 13:21"/>epi li te kriye a nonm Bondye ki te sòti Juda a, e li te di: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a: ‘Akoz ou te dezobeyi kòmandman SENYÈ a e pa t swiv lòd ke SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a, te kòmande ou a, <verse eid="1KI 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 13:22"/>men ou te retounen, ou te manje pen e bwè dlo nan plas kote Li te di ou: “Pa manje okenn pen ni bwè okenn dlo a”; kò ou p ap rive nan tonm papa ou a.’”<verse eid="1KI 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 13:23"/>Li te vin rive lè li te fin manje pen an e bwè a, ke li te sele bourik la pou li, pou pwofèt la te mennen li retounen. <verse eid="1KI 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 13:24"/>Alò, lè li t ap prale, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 20:36">I Wa 20:36</ref></char></note>yon lyon te rankontre li sou wout la e te touye li, kò li te jete sou wout la, avèk bourik la kanpe akote li ak lyon an osi te kanpe akote kò a. <verse eid="1KI 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 13:25"/>Epi vwala, moun yo t ap pase kote l, e yo te wè kò a jete sou wout la ak lyon an ki te kanpe akote kò a. Konsa, yo te rive pale sa nan vil kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:11">I Wa 13:11</ref></char></note>pwofèt granmoun nan te rete a. <verse eid="1KI 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 13:26"/>Alò, lè pwofèt ki te mennen li retounen soti nan chemen an te tande sa, li te di: “Se nonm Bondye ki te dezobeyi lòd SENYÈ a. Pou sa, SENYÈ a te bay li a lyon, ki te chire li e touye li selon pawòl ke SENYÈ a te pale li a.” <verse eid="1KI 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 13:27"/>Alò, li te pale avèk fis li yo e te di: “Sele bourik la pou mwen.” Epi yo te sele li. <verse eid="1KI 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 13:28"/>Li te ale twouve kò li ki te jete sou wout la avèk bourik la ak lyon ki te kanpe akote kò a. Lyon an pa t manje kò a, ni li pa t chire bourik la. <verse eid="1KI 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 13:29"/>Konsa, pwofèt la te leve pran kò a nonm Bondye a. Li te kouche li sou bourik la, e li te mennen li retounen. Li te rive nan vil a pwofèt granmoun nan pou kriye pou li e antere li. <verse eid="1KI 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 13:30"/>Li te kouche kadav la nan pwòp tonm pa li, e yo te kriye pou li, e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:18">Jr 22:18</ref></char></note>“Anmwey, frè m!”<verse eid="1KI 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 13:31"/>Apre li te fin antere li, li te pale avèk fis li yo e te di: “Lè m mouri, antere mwen nan tonm kote nonm Bondye a antere a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 1:17">Rt 1:17</ref> </char></note>Kouche zo pa m yo akote zo pa l yo. <verse eid="1KI 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 13:32"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:2">I Wa 13:2</ref></char></note>Paske bagay la, anverite, va rive ke li te kriye selon pawòl SENYÈ a kont lotèl la Béthel ak kont tout kay plas wo ki nan vil a Samarie yo.”<verse eid="1KI 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 13:33"/>Apre evenman sa a, Jéroboam pa t kite chemen mechanste li, men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:31-32">I Wa 12:31-32</ref></char></note>ankò li te fè prèt pou wo plas yo soti nan tout pèp la. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 17:5">Jij 17:5</ref></char></note>Nenpòt moun ki ta vle fè sa, li te òdone pou devni prèt nan wo plas yo. <verse eid="1KI 13:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 13:34"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:30">I Wa 12:30</ref></char></note>Evenman sa a te devni peche lakay Jéroboam, jis menm pou ta detwi kay li e fè l disparèt sou fas tè a.<verse eid="1KI 13:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1KI 14"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 14:1"/>Nan lè sa a, Abija, fis a Jéroboam nan, te vin malad. <verse eid="1KI 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 14:2"/>Jéroboam te di a madanm li: “Leve vit e abiye kòmsi pou yo pa rekonèt ou kòm madanm a Jéroboam. Konsa, ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:1">Jos 18:1</ref></char></note>Silo! Gade byen, Achija, pwofèt ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:29-31">I Wa 11:29-31</ref></char></note>pale konsènan mwen kòm wa sou pèp sa a la. <verse eid="1KI 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 14:3"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 9:7-8">I Sam 9:7-8</ref></char></note>Pran dis pen avèk ou, kèk gato ak yon boutèy siwo myèl, e ale kote li. Li va di ou kisa ki va rive gason an.”<verse eid="1KI 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 14:4"/>Madanm a Jéroboam nan te fè sa, li te leve ale Silo e li te rive kote lakay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:29">I Wa 11:29</ref></char></note>Achija. Alò, Achija pa t kab wè, pwiske zye li te vin fèb akoz laj li. <verse eid="1KI 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 14:5"/>Alò, SENYÈ a te di a Achija: “Gade byen, madanm a Jéroboam nan ap vin mande ou konsèy de fis li a, paske li malad. Ou va pale li konsa; paske li va fèt ke lè l rive, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 14:2">II Sam 14:2</ref></char></note>l ap fè kòmsi se yon lòt fanm li ye.”<verse eid="1KI 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 14:6"/>Lè Achija te tande son a pye li ki t ap antre nan pòtay la, li te di: “Antre, madanm a Jéroboam, poukisa w ap fè kòmsi se yon lòt fanm ou ye a? Paske mwen te voye kote ou avèk yon mesaj byen di. <verse eid="1KI 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 14:7"/>Ale, pale Jéroboam: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a. Bondye Israël la: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:28-31">I Wa 11:28-31</ref></char></note>“Akoz Mwen te egzalte ou soti nan mitan pèp la, e te fè ou chèf sou pèp Mwen an, Israël, <verse eid="1KI 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 14:8"/>e akoz Mwen te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:31">I Wa 11:31</ref></char></note>chire wayòm nan sòti lakay David pou te bay li a ou menm—sepandan, ou pa t fè jan sèvitè mwen an, David, ki te kenbe kòmandman Mwen yo e ki te swiv Mwen avèk tout kè li, pou fè sèlman sa ki te dwat nan zye Mwen. <verse eid="1KI 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 14:9"/>Anplis, ou te fè plis mechanste pase tout sila ki te avan ou yo, epi ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28">I Wa 12:28</ref></char></note>te fè pou ou menm lòt dye avèk <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:17">Egz 34:17</ref></char></note>imaj fonn pou pwovoke mwen a lakòlè, e ou te jete Mwen dèyè do ou— <verse eid="1KI 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 14:10"/>Pou sa, gade byen, Mwen ap mennen gwo malè sou lakay Jéroboam e Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:21">I Wa 21:21</ref></char></note>koupe retire nan men Jéroboam tout gason, ni lib, ni esklav an Israël e Mwen va fè bale nèt lakay Jéroboam jan yon moun ta bale fè sòti poupou bèt jiskaske li retire li nèt. <verse eid="1KI 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 14:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:4">I Wa 16:4</ref></char></note>Nenpòt moun ki apatyen a Jéroboam ki mouri nan vil la, chen va manje li. Epi sila ki mouri nan chan an, zwazo syèl yo va manje l, paske SENYÈ a te pale.”’ <verse eid="1KI 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 14:12"/>Koulye a, ou menm, leve ale lakay ou. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:17">I Wa 14:17</ref></char></note>Lè pye ou fin antre nan vil la, pitit la va mouri. <verse eid="1KI 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 14:13"/>Tout Israël va fè lamantasyon pou li e antere li, paske se sèlman li nan tout fanmi Jéroboam ki va rive nan tonm nan, akoz nan li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 19:3">II Kwo 19:3</ref></char></note>yon bon bagay te twouve anvè SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, nan kay Jéroboam nan. <verse eid="1KI 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 14:14"/>Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:27-29">I Wa 15:27-29</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a va fè leve pou kont Li, yon wa sou Israël ki va koupe lakay Jéroboam. Men jou sa rive! E kisa? Wi. Koulye a menm! <verse eid="1KI 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 14:15"/>Paske SENYÈ a va frape Israël, tankou yon wozo k ap tranble nan dlo. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:28">Det 29:28</ref></char></note>Li va dechouke Israël soti nan bon peyi ke Li te bay a zansèt pa li yo, e Li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:29">II Wa 15:29</ref></char></note>va gaye yo lòtbò Rivyè Euphrate la, akoz yo te fè Asherim pa yo, ki te pwovoke SENYÈ a a lakòlè. <verse eid="1KI 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 14:16"/>Li va abandone Israël akoz peche ke Jéroboam te fè a, e avèk sila ke li te fè Israël antre nan peche a.”<verse eid="1KI 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 14:17"/>Alò, madanm a Jéroboam te leve ale e te rive Thirtsa. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:12">I Wa 14:12</ref></char></note>Pandan li t ap pase nan chanbrann pòt la, pitit la te mouri. <verse eid="1KI 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 14:18"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:13">I Wa 14:13</ref></char></note>Tout Israël te antere li e te kriye pou li, selon pawòl SENYÈ a te pale pa sèvitè li, Achija, pwofèt la.<verse eid="1KI 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 14:19"/>Alò, tout lòt zèv a Jéroboam yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:30">I Wa 14:30</ref></char></note>jan li te fè lagè ak jan li te renye, men vwala, yo ekri nan Liv Kwonik a Wa Israël yo. <verse eid="1KI 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 14:20"/>Tan ke Jéroboam te renye a te venn-dezan. Konsa, li te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo, e Nadab, fis li a te renye nan plas li a.<verse eid="1KI 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 14:21"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 12:13">II Kwo 12:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, Roboam fis a Salomon an te renye Juda. Roboam te gen trante-yen ane daj lè li te vin wa, e li te renye di-sèt ane Jérusalem, vil ke SENYÈ a te chwazi soti nan tout tribi Israël yo pou mete non Li a. Epi manman li te Naama, yon fi Amonit. <verse eid="1KI 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 14:22"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 12:1-14">II Kwo 12:1-14</ref></char></note>Juda te fè mal nan zye a SENYÈ a e yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Det 32:21</ref></char></note>pwovoke Li a jalouzi plis pase tout zansèt pa yo te fè, avèk peche ke yo te fè yo. <verse eid="1KI 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 14:23"/>Paske yo tou te bati pou yo menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 16:24">Éz 16:24</ref></char></note>wo plas yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 16:22">Det 16:22</ref></char></note>pilye sakre yo avèk Asherim sou chak wotè ti kolin e anba chak bèl bwa vèt. <verse eid="1KI 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 14:24"/>Te gen osi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:5">Jen 19:5</ref></char></note>gason ki fè pwostitiye tanp zidòl nan peyi a. Yo te fè selon tout abominasyon a lòt nasyon ke SENYÈ a te fè sòti devan fis Israël yo.<verse eid="1KI 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 14:25"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 11:40">I Wa 11:40</ref> </char>
    </note>Alò, li te fèt nan senkyèm ane a Wa Roboam, Schischak, wa Égypte la te vin monte kont Jérusalem. <verse eid="1KI 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 14:26"/>Li te pran trezò lakay SENYÈ a avèk trezò lakay wa a. Li te pran tout bagay yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 10:17">I Wa 10:17</ref></char></note>menm tout boukliye an lò ke Salomon te fè yo. <verse eid="1KI 14:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 14:27"/>Pou sa, Wa Roboam te fè boukliye an bwonz nan plas yo e te fè kòmandan a gad ki te veye pòtay kay la wa a responsab sou yo. <verse eid="1KI 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 14:28"/>Epi li te vin rive ke nenpòt lè wa a te antre lakay SENYÈ a, ke gad yo ta pote mennen yo retounen nan chanm gad yo.<verse eid="1KI 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 14:29"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 12:15-16">II Kwo 12:15-16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, tout lòt zèv a Roboam avèk tout sa li te fè yo, èske yo pa ekri nan liv a Kwonik a Wa Juda yo? <verse eid="1KI 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 14:30"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:21">I Wa 12:21</ref></char></note>Te gen lagè antre Roboam avèk Jéroboam tout tan. <verse eid="1KI 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 14:31"/>Epi Roboam te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo, e li te antere avèk zansèt li yo nan lavil David. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:21">I Wa 14:21</ref></char></note>Non manman li se te Naama, fi Amonit lan. Abijam, fis li a, te vin wa nan plas li.<verse eid="1KI 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1KI 15"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 15:1"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 13:1">II Kwo 13:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, nan di-zuityèm ane a Wa Jéroboam, fis Nebat la, Abijam te vin wa sou Juda. <verse eid="1KI 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 15:2"/>Li te renye pandan twazan nan Jérusalem. Non manman li se te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 13:2">II Kwo 13:2</ref></char></note>Maaca, fis a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 11:21">II Kwo 11:21</ref></char></note>Abisalom lan. <verse eid="1KI 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 15:3"/>Li te mache nan tout peche a papa li te fè devan li yo. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:4">I Wa 11:4</ref></char></note>Kè li pa t dedye nèt a SENYÈ a, Bondye li a, tankou kè a papa zansèt li a, David. <verse eid="1KI 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 15:4"/>Men pou koz David, SENYÈ a, Bondye li a, te ba li yon lanp nan Jérusalem, pou fè leve monte fis li apre li, e pou etabli Jérusalem. <verse eid="1KI 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 15:5"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:6">Luc 1:6</ref></char></note>Li te fè sa paske David te fè sa ki te dwat nan zye a SENYÈ a, e li pa t vire akote de nenpòt sa ke Li te kòmande li pandan tout jou lavi li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 11:3-17">II Sam 11:3-17</ref></char></note>sof ke ka a Urie a, Etyen an. <verse eid="1KI 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 15:6"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:30">I Wa 14:30</ref></char></note>Te gen lagè antre Roboam avèk Jéroboam pandan tout vi li. <verse eid="1KI 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 15:7"/>Alò, tout lòt zèv a Abijam avèk tout sa li te fè yo, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv Kwonik a Wa a Juda yo? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 13:3-20">II Kwo 13:3-20</ref></char></note>Anplis, te gen lagè antre Abijam avèk Jéroboam. <verse eid="1KI 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 15:8"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:1">II Kwo 14:1</ref></char></note>Epi Abijam te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo, e yo te antere li nan lavil David. Asa, fis li a te devni wa nan plas li.<verse eid="1KI 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 15:9"/>Konsa, nan ventyèm ane a Jéroboam, wa Israël la, Asa te kòmanse renye kòm wa nan Juda. <verse eid="1KI 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 15:10"/>Li te renye pandan karanteyen ane Jérusalem. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:2">I Wa 15:2</ref></char></note>Non manman li se te Maaca, fi a Abisalom lan. <verse eid="1KI 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 15:11"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:2">II Kwo 14:2</ref></char></note>Asa te fè sa ki te dwat nan zye SENYÈ a tankou David, papa zansèt li a. <verse eid="1KI 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 15:12"/>Anplis, li te retire mal pwostitiye nan peyi a e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 14:2">II Kwo 14:2</ref></char></note>retire tout zidòl ke zansèt li yo te fè yo. <verse eid="1KI 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 15:13"/>Anplis, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:16-18">II Kwo 15:16-18</ref></char></note>li te fè retire Maaca, manman li nan pozisyon rèn nan, paske li te fè yon imaj abominab tankou yon Astarté. Asa te koupe imaj abominab li a e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:20">Egz 32:20</ref></char></note>brile li nan flèv Cédron an. <verse eid="1KI 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 15:14"/>Men wo plas yo pa t retire. Malgre sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:61">I Wa 8:61</ref></char></note>kè Asa te dedye nèt a SENYÈ a pandan tout jou li yo. <verse eid="1KI 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 15:15"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:51">I Wa 7:51</ref></char></note>Li te fè antre nan kay SENYÈ a tout afè dedye pa papa li avèk tout afè dedye pa li menm; zouti fèt an ajan avèk lò.<verse eid="1KI 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 15:16"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 15:32">I Wa 15:32</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò te gen lagè antre Asa avèk Baescha, wa Israël la pandan tout jou pa yo. <verse eid="1KI 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 15:17"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 16:1-6">II Kwo 16:1-6</ref></char></note>Baescha, wa Israël la, te monte kont Juda e te ranfòse Rama pou anpeche moun antre, oswa sòti kote Asa, wa Juda a. <verse eid="1KI 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 15:18"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:26">I Wa 14:26</ref></char></note>Asa te pran tout ajan avèk lò ki te rete nan trezò lakay SENYÈ a ak trezò lakay wa a e li te livre yo nan men a sèvitè li yo. Epi Wa Asa te voye yo bay Ben-Hadad, fis Thabrimmon an, fis a Hezjon an, wa Syrie a, ki te rete Damas la. Li te di: <verse eid="1KI 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 15:19"/>“Kite yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 16:7">II Kwo 16:7</ref></char></note>akò fèt antre ou menm avèk mwen, tankou antre papa ou avèk papa m. Gade byen, mwen voye ba ou yon kado ajan avèk lò. Ale kraze akò ou avèk Baescha, wa Israël la, pou li retire lame li a sou mwen.”<verse eid="1KI 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 15:20"/>Konsa, Ben-Hadad te koute Wa Asa e te voye chèf lame li yo kont vil Israël yo, li te bat yo e pran Ijjon, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 18:29">Jij 18:29</ref></char></note>Dan, Abel-Beth-Maaca, tout <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 11:2">Jos 11:2</ref></char></note>Kinneroth la ak tout teritwa Nephtali a. <verse eid="1KI 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 15:21"/>Lè Baescha fin tande koze sa a, li te sispann ranfòse Rama e li te vin rete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:17">I Wa 14:17</ref></char></note>Thirtsa. <verse eid="1KI 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 15:22"/>Epi Wa Asa te fè yon pwoklamasyon a tout Juda——nanpwen pèsòn ki te eksepte——-epi yo tout te pote ale tout wòch nan Rama yo avèk bwa ke Baescha te sèvi pou bati yo. Wa Asa te bati avèk yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 18:24">Jos 18:24</ref></char></note>Guéba nan Benjamin ak Mitspa. <verse eid="1KI 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 15:23"/>Alò, tout lòt zèv Asa yo avèk tout pwisans li, tout sa li te fè ak vil ke li te bati yo, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv Kwonik a Wa a Juda yo? Men nan tan vyeyès li, li te aflije avèk maladi nan pye li. <verse eid="1KI 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 15:24"/>Konsa, Asa te dòmi avèk zansèt pa li yo e li te antere avèk zansèt li yo nan lavil David la, papa li. Epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:41-44">I Wa 22:41-44</ref></char></note>Josaphat te renye nan plas li.<verse eid="1KI 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 15:25"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:20">I Wa 14:20</ref></char></note>Nadab, fis a Jéroboam nan, te vin wa sou Israël nan dezyèm ane Asa a, wa Juda a e li te renye sou Israël pandan dezan. <verse eid="1KI 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 15:26"/>Li te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28-33">I Wa 12:28-33</ref></char></note>mache nan chemen papa li ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:30-34">I Wa 15:30-34</ref></char></note>nan peche avèk sila li te fè Israël peche a. <verse eid="1KI 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 15:27"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:14">I Wa 14:14</ref></char></note>Baescha, fis Achija a, a lakay Issacar a, te fè konplo kont Nadab, e Baescha te frape l fè l mouri nan Guibbethon, ki te apatyen a Filisten yo, pandan Nadab avèk tout Israël t ap fè syèj nan Guibbethon. <verse eid="1KI 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 15:28"/>Konsa, Baescha te touye li nan twazyèm ane Asa a, wa Juda a e li te vin renye nan plas li. <verse eid="1KI 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 15:29"/>Li te vin rive ke depi li te wa a, li te frape tout lakay Jéroboam. Li pa t kite a Jéroboam okenn moun vivan, jiskaske li te detwi yo nèt, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:9-16">I Wa 14:9-16</ref></char></note>selon pawòl ke SENYÈ a te pale pa sèvitè li a, Achija, Siloyit la. <verse eid="1KI 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 15:30"/>Akoz peche ke Jéroboam te fè yo e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:26">I Wa 15:26</ref></char></note>avèk sila, li te fè Israël peche yo, akoz pwovokasyon li avèk sila li te pwovoke SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, a lakòlè.<verse eid="1KI 15:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 15:31"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 14:19">I Wa 14:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, lòt zèv a Nadab yo avèk tout sa ke li te fè yo, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv Kwonik a Wa Israël yo? <verse eid="1KI 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 15:32"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:16">I Wa 15:16</ref></char></note>Te gen lagè antre Asa avèk Baescha, fis a Achija a pandan tout jou pa yo.<verse eid="1KI 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 15:33"/>Nan twazyèm ane Asa a, wa a Juda a, Baescha, fis a Achija a, te devni wa sou tout Israël nan Thirtsa e li te renye venn-kat ane. <verse eid="1KI 15:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 15:34"/>Li te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a e li <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:26">I Wa 15:26</ref></char></note>te mache nan chemen Jéroboam ak nan peche pa li avèk sila li te fè Israël peche yo.<verse eid="1KI 15:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1KI 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 16:1"/>Alò, pawòl SENYÈ a te vini a<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:7">I Wa 16:7</ref></char></note>Jéhu, fis a Hanani a kont Baescha, e te di: <verse eid="1KI 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 16:2"/>“Mwen te egzalte ou, Baescha, soti nan pousyè e Mwen te fè ou chèf sou pèp Mwen an, Israël. E <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:34">I Wa 15:34</ref></char></note>ou te mache nan chemen Jéroboam pou te fè pèp Mwen an, Israël peche e te pwovoke M a lakòlè avèk peche pa yo. <verse eid="1KI 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 16:3"/>Veye byen, Mwen va manje <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:11">I Wa 16:11</ref></char></note>Baescha nèt avèk lakay li e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:29">I Wa 15:29</ref></char></note>Mwen va fè lakay ou tankou lakay Jéroboam, fis a Nebat la. <verse eid="1KI 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 16:4"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:11">I Wa 14:11</ref></char></note>Nenpòt moun nan Baescha ki mouri nan vil la, li va manje pa chen e nenpòt moun nan sila ki mouri nan chan, zwazo syèl yo va manje l.”<verse eid="1KI 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 16:5"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 14:19">I Wa 14:19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, lòt zèv a Baescha, sa li te fè ak pwisans li, èske yo pa t ekri nan Liv Kwonik a Wa Israël yo? <verse eid="1KI 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 16:6"/>Epi Baescha te dòmi avèk zansèt li yo, e li te antere <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:7">I Wa 14:7</ref></char></note>Thirtsa. Epi Éla, fis li a, te vin wa nan plas li.<verse eid="1KI 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 16:7"/>Anplis, pawòl SENYÈ a, pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:1">I Wa 16:1</ref></char></note>pwofèt la, Jéhu, fis a Hanani an, osi te vini kont Baescha avèk lakay li, akoz tout mal li te fè nan zye SENYÈ a, lè l te pwovoke Li a lakòlè avèk zèv a men li yo, lè li te vin tankou lakay Jéroboam e osi akoz li te frape li.<verse eid="1KI 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 16:8"/>Nan venn-sizyèm ane Asa a, wa a Juda a, Éla, fis a Baescha a, te vin wa sou Israël nan Thirtsa e li te renye pandan dezan. <verse eid="1KI 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 16:9"/>Sèvitè li, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:30-33">II Wa 9:30-33</ref></char></note>Zimri, chèf a mwatye cha li yo, te fè konplo kont li. Alò, li te lakay Thirtsa, e li t ap bwè jiskaske li te vin sou lakay Artsa, ki te chèf sou tout kay Thirtsa a. <verse eid="1KI 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 16:10"/>Alò, Zimri te antre frape li e te mete l a lanmò nan venn-setyèm ane Asa a, wa a Juda a e li te devni wa nan plas li.<verse eid="1KI 16:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 16:11"/>Li te vin rive ke lè li te devni wa a, depi li te chita sou twòn nan, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:29">I Wa 15:29</ref></char></note>li te touye tout manm lakay Baesche yo. Li pa t kite menm yon gason, ni pami fanmi, ni nan zanmi li yo. <verse eid="1KI 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 16:12"/>Konsa, Zimri te detwi tout lakay Baesche, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:3">I Wa 16:3</ref></char></note>selon pawòl ke SENYÈ a te pale kont Baesche pa <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 19:2">II Kwo 19:2</ref></char></note>Jéhu, pwofèt la, <verse eid="1KI 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 16:13"/>pou tout peche a Baesche yo ak peche a Éla, fis li a, peche ke yo te fè e avèk sila yo te fè Israël peche yo, e ki te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Det 32:21</ref></char></note>pwovoke Li a lakòlè avèk zidòl pa yo. <verse eid="1KI 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 16:14"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:5">I Wa 16:5</ref></char></note>Alò, tout lòt zèv a Éla yo avèk tout sa ke li te fè yo, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv Kwonik a Wa Israël yo?<verse eid="1KI 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 16:15"/>Nan venn-setyèm ane Asa a, wa Juda a, Zimri, te renye pandan sèt jou nan Thirtsa. Alò, pèp la te fè kan kont <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:27">I Wa 15:27</ref></char></note>Guibbethon, ki te pou Filisten yo. <verse eid="1KI 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 16:16"/>Moun ki te nan kan yo te tande li e te di: “Zimri te fè konplo pou vin frape wa a.” Pou sa, tout Israël te fè Omri chèf lame a wa a sou Israël menm jou sa a nan kan an. <verse eid="1KI 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 16:17"/>Alò, Omri ak tout Israël avèk li te monte soti nan Guibbethon pou te fè syèj kont Thirtsa. <verse eid="1KI 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 16:18"/>Lè Zimri te wè vil la te tonbe, li te monte nan sitadèl lakay wa a. Li te brile lakay wa a sou pwòp tèt li avèk dife, e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 31:4-5">I Sam 31:4-5</ref></char></note>mouri. <verse eid="1KI 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 16:19"/>Sa te fèt akoz peche ke li te fè yo, ak mal li te fè nan zye SENYÈ a, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28">I Wa 12:28</ref></char></note>mache nan chemen Jéroboam. Nan peche li te fè yo, li te fè Israël peche. <verse eid="1KI 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 16:20"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:5-27">I Wa 16:5-27</ref></char></note>Alò lòt zèv a Zimri yo avèk konplo li te fè yo, èske yo pa ekri an Liv Kwonik a Wa Israël yo?<verse eid="1KI 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 16:21"/>Alò, pèp Israël yo te divize an de pati: mwatye te swiv Thibni, fis a Guinath la pou fè l devni wa; mwatye te swiv Omri. <verse eid="1KI 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 16:22"/>Men moun ki te swiv Omri yo te vin genyen sou moun ki te swiv Thibni yo, fis a Guinath la. Epi Thibni te mouri e Omri te vin wa a. <verse eid="1KI 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 16:23"/>Nan tranteyen ane Asa a, wa Juda a, Omri te devni wa sou Israël e li te renye pandan douz ane. Li te renye pandan sizan nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:21">I Wa 15:21</ref></char></note>Thirtsa. <verse eid="1KI 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 16:24"/>Li te achte ti mòn Samarie a nan men Schémer pou de talan ajan; epi li te bati sou ti mòn nan e li te rele vil ke li te bati a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:28-32">I Wa 16:28-32</ref></char></note>Samarie menm non a Schémer, mèt a ti mòn nan. <verse eid="1KI 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 16:25"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 6:16">Mi 6:16</ref></char></note>Omri te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a e li te aji avèk plis mechanste pase tout moun ki te avan l yo. <verse eid="1KI 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 16:26"/>Paske li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:19">I Wa 16:19</ref></char></note>mache nan tout chemen a Jéroboam yo, fis a Nebat la ak nan peche pa li avèk sila li te fè Israël peche yo, e te pwovoke SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, avèk zidòl pa yo. <verse eid="1KI 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 16:27"/>Alò, tout lòt zèv ke Omri te fè yo ak pwisans ke li te montre yo, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv Kwonik a Wa Israël yo? <verse eid="1KI 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 16:28"/>Konsa, Omri te dòmi avèk zansèt pa li yo e li te antere Samarie; epi Achab, fis li a, te devni wa nan plas li.<verse eid="1KI 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 16:29"/>Alò, Achab, fis a Omri a te devni wa sou Israël pandan trann-tuit ane Asa yo, wa Juda a, e Achab, fis a Omri a te renye sou Israël nan Samarie pandan venn-dezan. <verse eid="1KI 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 16:30"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:9">I Wa 14:9</ref></char></note>Achab, fis Omri a te fè mal nan zye a SENYÈ a plis pase tout moun ki te avan li yo. <verse eid="1KI 16:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 16:31"/>Li te vin rive ke kòmsi li te yon ti bagay pou li te mache nan peche a Jéroboam yo, fis a Nebat la, ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:1-5">Det 7:1-5</ref></char></note>li te marye ak Jézabel, fi a Ethbaal la, wa a Sidonyen yo, li te ale sèvi Baal e te adore li. <verse eid="1KI 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 16:32"/>Konsa, li te fè monte yon lotèl pou Baal nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 10:21-27">II Wa 10:21-27</ref></char></note>kay Baal ke li te bati Samarie a. <verse eid="1KI 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 16:33"/>Achab osi te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 13:6">II Wa 13:6</ref></char></note>Astarté. Konsa, Achab te fè plis pou pwovoke SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, pase tout wa a Israël ki te avan li yo. <verse eid="1KI 16:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 16:34"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 6:26">Jos 6:26</ref></char></note>Nan jou pa li yo, Hiel, moun Béthel la te bati Jéricho. Li te poze fondasyon li yo avèk pèt Abiram, premye ne li a e li te monte pòtay li yo avèk pèt a pi piti fis li a, Segub, selon pawòl SENYÈ a te pale pa Josué, fis a Nun nan.<verse eid="1KI 16:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1KI 17"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 17:1"/>Alò, Élie, Tichbit la, ki te pami fondatè Galaad yo, te di a Achab: “Jan SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, viv la, devan sila mwen kanpe a, anverite p ap gen ni lawouze, ni lapli nan ane sila yo, sof ke pa pawòl mwen.”<verse eid="1KI 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 17:2"/>Pawòl SENYÈ a te vini a li e te di: <verse eid="1KI 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 17:3"/>“Kite andwa sila a, vire vè lès e kache akote flèv Kerith ki nan lès a Jourdain an. <verse eid="1KI 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 17:4"/>Li va fèt ke ou va bwè nan flèv la e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:9">I Wa 17:9</ref></char></note>mwen te kòmande zwazo kòbo pou ba ou pwovizyon.” <verse eid="1KI 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 17:5"/>Konsa, li te ale e te fè selon pawòl SENYÈ a; paske li te ale viv akote flèv Kerith la, ki te vè lès a Jourdain an. <verse eid="1KI 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 17:6"/>Kòbo yo te mennen ba li pen avèk vyann, e nan aswè li ta bwè nan flèv la. <verse eid="1KI 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 17:7"/>Li te vin rive apre yon tan ke flèv la te vin sèch, akoz pa t gen lapli nan peyi a.<verse eid="1KI 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 17:8"/>Konsa, pawòl SENYÈ a te vini a li e te di: <verse eid="1KI 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 17:9"/>“Leve ale <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="OBA 1:20">Ab 20</ref></char></note>Sarepta, ki pou Sidon e rete la. Gade byen, Mwen te kòmande yon vèv ki la pou okipe ou.”<verse eid="1KI 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 17:10"/>Konsa, li te leve ale Sarepta e lè li te rive nan pòtay vil la, vwala, yon vèv te la e t ap ranmase bwa. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 24:17">Jen 24:17</ref></char></note>Li te rele li e te di: “Souple, chèche yon ti dlo nan yon veso, pou m kab bwè.”<verse eid="1KI 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 17:11"/>Pandan li t ap pral chèche l, li te rele kote li e te di: “Souple, pote ban m yon ti pen nan men ou.”<verse eid="1KI 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 17:12"/>Men li te di: “Jan SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a, viv la, devan sila mwen kanpe a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:2-7">II Wa 4:2-7</ref></char></note>mwen pa gen pen, sèlman yon men farin nan bòl la avèk yon ti kras lwil nan bokal la. Gade byen, mwen ap ranmase kèk mòso bwa pou m kab antre prepare pou mwen avèk fis mwen an, pou nou kab manje l e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:15-16">Jen 21:15-16</ref> </char></note>mouri.”<verse eid="1KI 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 17:13"/>Élie te di li: “Pa pè. Ale. Fè jan ou te di a, men fè pou mwen yon ti gato pen avè l avan, e pote l deyò ban mwen. Apre, w ap kapab fè pou ou menm ak pou gason ou an. <verse eid="1KI 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 17:14"/>Paske konsa pale SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la: ‘Bòl farin nan p ap vid, ni boutèy lwil la p ap vid, jis jou ke SENYÈ a voye lapli sou fas tè a.’”<verse eid="1KI 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 17:15"/>Konsa, li te ale, e te fè selon pawòl Élie yo, e li menm avèk gason an avèk Élie te manje pandan anpil jou. <verse eid="1KI 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 17:16"/>Bòl farin nan pa t fini, ni boutèy lwil la pa t vid, jan pawòl SENYÈ a te pale pa Élie a.<verse eid="1KI 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 17:17"/>Alò, li te vin rive apre bagay sa yo ke gason a fanm nan, mètrès kay la, te vin malad. Epi maladi li a te tèlman rèd ke li pa t gen souf ki rete nan li. <verse eid="1KI 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 17:18"/>Konsa, famn nan te di a Élie: “Kisa mwen gen avè w, O <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:22">I Wa 12:22</ref></char></note>nonm Bondye? Ou te vin kote mwen pou fè m vin sonje inikite mwen e mete gason mwen an a lanmò!”<verse eid="1KI 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 17:19"/>Li te di a fanm nan: “Ban mwen gason ou an.” Epi li te retire li sou lestonmak li e te pote li monte nan chanm anlè kote li te rete a e li te kouche li sou pwòp kabann pa li. <verse eid="1KI 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 17:20"/>Li te rele SENYÈ a e te di: “O SENYÈ, Bondye mwen an, èske Ou osi te mennen gwo dezas sou vèv la kote mwen rete a e fè pitit li a mouri?”<verse eid="1KI 17:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 17:21"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 4:34-35">II Wa 4:34-35</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, li te lonje kò li sou pitit la twa fwa e li te rele SENYÈ a, e te di: “O SENYÈ, Bondye mwen an, mwen priye Ou, kite lavi pitit sa a retounen nan li.”<verse eid="1KI 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 17:22"/>SENYÈ a te tande vwa Élie, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:14">Luc 7:14</ref></char></note>lavi pitit la te retounen nan li e li te vin refè. <verse eid="1KI 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 17:23"/>Élie te pran pitit la, li te mennen li desann soti chanm anlè a, li te antre nan kay la e li bay li a manman li, epi Élie te di: “Ou wè, gason ou an vivan.”<verse eid="1KI 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 17:24"/>Konsa, fanm nan te di a Élie: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:11">Jn 2:11</ref></char></note>“Koulye a, mwen konnen ke ou se yon nonm Bondye, e ke pawòl SENYÈ a nan bouch ou se verite.”<verse eid="1KI 17:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1KI 18"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 18:1"/>Alò, li te rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:25">Luc 4:25</ref></char></note>apre anpil jou ke pawòl SENYÈ a te vini a Élie nan twazyèm ane a. Li te di: “Ale, montre ou menm a Achab e Mwen va voye lapli sou fas tè a.”<verse eid="1KI 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 18:2"/>Konsa, Élie te ale montre li menm a Achab. Alò, gwo grangou a te byen rèd nan Samarie. <verse eid="1KI 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 18:3"/>Achab te rele Abdias <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:9">I Wa 16:9</ref></char></note>ki te chèf sou lakay li. (Alò, Abdias te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 7:2">Né 7:2</ref></char></note>gen lakrent SENYÈ a anpil; <verse eid="1KI 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 18:4"/>paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:13">I Wa 18:13</ref></char></note>lè Jézabel te detwi pwofèt SENYÈ yo, Abdias te pran yon santèn nan pwofèt yo, li te kache yo pa senkant nan yon kav e li te founi yo avèk pen avèk dlo.) <verse eid="1KI 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 18:5"/>Alò, Achab te di Abdias: “Pase nan peyi kote tout sous dlo yo. Petèt nou va twouve zèb pou kenbe chwal avèk milèt yo vivan e pou nou pa oblije touye nan bèt yo.”<verse eid="1KI 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 18:6"/>Pou sa, yo te divize peyi a antre yo pou yo fè rechèch li. Achab te pran yon chemen e Abdias te pran yon lòt pou kont li. <verse eid="1KI 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 18:7"/>Alò, pandan Abdias te nan wout la, vwala, Élie te rankontre li. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:6-8">II Wa 1:6-8</ref></char></note>Abdias te rekonèt li e te tonbe sou figi li. Li te di: “Èske se ou menm, Élie, mèt mwen an?”<verse eid="1KI 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 18:8"/>Li te di li: “Se mwen. Ale, pale a mèt ou a, ‘Men vwala, Élie isit.’”<verse eid="1KI 18:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 18:9"/>Li te di: “Ki peche mwen te fè ke ou ta vin mete sèvitè ou nan men Achab pou l mete m a lanmò? <verse eid="1KI 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 18:10"/>Jan SENYÈ a, Bondye ou a, viv la, nanpwen nasyon oswa wayòm kote mèt mwen pa t voye chache ou. Lè yo te di: ‘Li pa la’, li te fè wayòm nan oswa nasyon an sèmante ke yo pa t kab jwenn ou. <verse eid="1KI 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 18:11"/>Epi koulye a w ap di: ‘Ale di mèt ou “Men vwala, Élie!”’ <verse eid="1KI 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 18:12"/>Li va vin rive ke lè m kite ou, Lespri SENYÈ a va pote ou kote m pa konnen. Konsa, lè m vini pale Achab, lè l pa kab jwenn ou, li va touye mwen, malgre mwen, sèvitè ou a, te gen lakrent SENYÈ a depi nan jenès mwen. <verse eid="1KI 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 18:13"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:4">I Wa 18:4</ref></char></note>Èske sa pa t pale a mèt mwen sa m te fè lè Jézabel te touye pwofèt SENYÈ yo, ke m te kache yon santèn nan pwofèt SENYÈ a pa senkantèn nan yon kav e mwen te founi yo avèk pen avèk dlo? <verse eid="1KI 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 18:14"/>Epi koulye a, w ap di mwen: ‘Ale pale a mèt ou: “Men Élie!” Epi se konsa l ap touye mwen.’<verse eid="1KI 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 18:15"/>Élie te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">I Wa 17:1</ref></char></note>“Jan SENYÈ dèzame yo viv la, devan sila mwen kanpe a, anverite, mwen va montre mwen menm a li menm jodi a.” <verse eid="1KI 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 18:16"/>Konsa, Abdias te ale rankontre Achab e te pale li, epi Achab te ale rankontre Élie.<verse eid="1KI 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 18:17"/>Lè Achab te wè Élie, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 7:25">Jos 7:25</ref></char></note>Achab te di li: “Èske se ou menm, sila ki twouble Israël la?”<verse eid="1KI 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 18:18"/>Li te di: “Mwen pa t twouble Israël, men ou menm avèk lakay papa ou, akoz <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 9:9">I Wa 9:9</ref></char></note>ou te abandone lòd SENYÈ yo pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:25-26">I Wa 21:25-26</ref></char></note>ou te swiv Baal yo. <verse eid="1KI 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 18:19"/>Alò, pou sa, voye ranmase vè mwen tout Israël nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 19:26">Jos 19:26</ref></char></note>Mòn Carmel avèk kat-san-senkant pwofèt Baal ak kat-san pwofèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:33">I Wa 16:33</ref></char></note>Astarté ki manje sou tab Jézabel la.”<verse eid="1KI 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 18:20"/>Konsa, Achab te voye pami tout fis Israël yo e te mennen pwofèt yo ansanm nan Mont Carmel. <verse eid="1KI 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 18:21"/>Élie te pwoche tout pèp la e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:24">Mat 6:24</ref></char></note>“Pou konbyen de tan n ap kontinye panche de bò, antre de bi? <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 24:5">Jos 24:5</ref></char></note>Si SENYÈ a se Bondye a, swiv Li, men si se Baal, swiv li.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:21">Men moun yo pa t reponn menm yon mo.<verse eid="1KI 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 18:22"/>Konsa, Élie te di a pèp la: “Se mwen sèl ki rete kòm pwofèt SENYÈ a, men pwofèt a Baal yo se kat-san-senkant òm. <verse eid="1KI 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 18:23"/>Alò, kite yo bannou de bèf, e kite yo chwazi yon bèf pou yo menm, koupe li an mòso e mete li sou bwa a, men san pa mete dife; epi mwen va prepare lòt bèf la e kouche li sou bwa e mwen p ap mete dife. <verse eid="1KI 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 18:24"/>Alò, ou va rele non a dye pa nou an e mwen va rele non SENYÈ a, e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:38">I Wa 18:38</ref></char></note>Dye ki reponn pa dife a, se Li menm ki Bondye a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:24">Epi tout moun yo te reponn: “Lide sa a bon.”<verse eid="1KI 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 18:25"/>Konsa, Élie te di a pwofèt a Baal yo: “Chwazi yon bèf pou nou menm e prepare li, paske nou anpil e rele non a dye pa nou an, men pa mete dife.”<verse eid="1KI 18:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 18:26"/>Konsa, yo te pran bèf ki te bay a yo menm nan, yo te prepare li e te rele non Baal la soti nan maten jis rive midi e yo t ap di: “O Baal, reponn nou.” Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 115:4-5">Sòm 115:4-5</ref></char></note>pa t gen vwa e okenn moun pa t reponn. Epi yo te toutotou lotèl ke yo te fè a.<verse eid="1KI 18:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 18:27"/>Li te vin rive vè midi ke Élie te moke yo. Li te di: “Rele avèk vwa fò, paske li se yon dye! Oswa petèt li okipe, ke li okipe! Oswa li te vire akote, oswa li fè yon vwayaj, o petèt li dòmi e ou bezwen fè l leve.”<verse eid="1KI 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 18:28"/>Konsa, yo te kriye avèk gwo vwa. Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:28">Lev 19:28</ref></char></note>koupe kò yo selon abitid pa yo avèk nepe ak frenn jis san te fè flèv sou yo. <verse eid="1KI 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 18:29"/>Lè midi te fin pase, yo te anraje <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:39-41">Egz 29:39-41</ref></char></note>jis rive nan moman pou ofri sakrifis aswè yo, men pa t gen vwa, okenn pa t reponn, ni okenn pa t okipe yo.<verse eid="1KI 18:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 18:30"/>Alò, Élie te di a tout pèp la: “Vin kote mwen.” Konsa, tout pèp la te vin kote li. Konsa, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:10-14">I Wa 19:10-14</ref></char></note>repare lotèl SENYÈ a ki te dechire a. <verse eid="1KI 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 18:31"/>Élie te pran douz wòch selon non tribi a fis a Jacob yo, a sila pawòl SENYÈ a te parèt yo, e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:28">Jen 32:28</ref></char></note>“Israël va non ou.” <verse eid="1KI 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 18:32"/>Konsa, avèk wòch yo, li te bati yon lotèl <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 32:28">Jen 32:28</ref></char></note>nan non SENYÈ a e li te fè yon kanal antoure lotèl la ase laj pou kenbe de mezi semans. <verse eid="1KI 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 18:33"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:9">Jen 22:9</ref></char></note>Apre, li te ranje bwa a, li te koupe bèf la an mòso e li te poze li sou bwa a. <verse eid="1KI 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 18:34"/>Epi li te di: “Ranpli kat po avèk dlo e vide li sou ofrann brile yo ak sou bwa a.” Epi li te di: “Fè l yon dezyèm fwa,” epi yo te fè l yon dezyèm fwa. Epi li te di: “Fè l yon twazyèm fwa,” epi yo te fè l yon twazyèm fwa. <verse eid="1KI 18:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 18:35"/>Dlo a te kouri antoure lotèl la e li te plen kanal la osi.<verse eid="1KI 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 18:36"/>Nan tan ofrann sakrifis aswè a, Élie, pwofèt la, te pwoche e te di: “O SENYÈ, Bondye Abraham, Isaac avèk Israël la, jodi a, kite li byen rekonèt ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:43">I Wa 8:43</ref></char></note>Ou se Bondye an Israël, ke mwen se sèvitè Ou, e ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 16:28-32">Nonb 16:28-32</ref></char></note>mwen te fè tout bagay sa yo pa pawòl Ou menm. <verse eid="1KI 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 18:37"/>Reponn mwen, O SENYÈ, reponn mwen, pou pèp sa a kapab konnen ke Ou menm, O SENYÈ, se Bondye e ke Ou fè kè yo vire retounen kote Ou ankò.”<verse eid="1KI 18:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 18:38"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 10:1-2">Lev 10:1-2</ref></char></note>dife SENYÈ a te tonbe e te konsonmen ofrann brile a avèk bwa a, avèk wòch yo ak pousyè a e te vale tout dlo ki te nan kanal la. <verse eid="1KI 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 18:39"/>Lè tout pèp la te wè sa, yo te tonbe sou figi yo, epi yo te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:21-24">I Wa 18:21-24</ref></char></note>“SENYÈ a, se Li menm Ki Bondye a! SENYÈ a, se Li menm ki Bondye a!”<verse eid="1KI 18:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 18:40"/>Epi Élie te di yo: “Sezi pwofèt a Baal yo! Pa kite youn nan yo chape!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:40">Yo te sezi yo, epi Élie te mennen yo desann nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 4:7">Jij 4:7</ref></char></note>flèv Kison an e <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 10:24-25">II Wa 10:24-25</ref></char></note>te touye yo la.<verse eid="1KI 18:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 18:41"/>Alò, Élie te di a Achab: “Ale monte, manje e bwè; paske gen gwo bwi lapli.”<verse eid="1KI 18:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 18:42"/>Konsa, Achab te monte pou manje e bwè. Men Élie te monte sou tèt Mòn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:19-20">I Wa 18:19-20</ref></char></note>Carmel; epi li te koube jenou li, apiye atè avèk figi li antre jenou li. <verse eid="1KI 18:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 18:43"/>Li te di a sèvitè li: “Ale monte koulye a, gade bò kote lanmè a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:43">Konsa, li te monte gade, e te di: “Nanpwen anyen” epi li te di:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:43">“Ale retounen” menm sèt fwa.”<verse eid="1KI 18:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 18:44"/>Li te vin rive nan setyèm fwa a ke li te di: “Vwala, yon grenn <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:54">Luc 12:54</ref></char></note>nwaj piti tankou men a yon moun ap monte soti kote lanmè a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 18:44">Epi li te di: “Ale monte, pale Achab pou di l: ‘fè cha ou a parèt e desann pou gwo lapli a pa rete ou.’”<verse eid="1KI 18:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 18:45"/>Nan yon ti tan, syèl la te vin fènwa avèk nwaj ak van e te gen yon lapli fò. Epi Achab te monte pou te ale kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:11">És 8:11</ref></char></note>Jizréel. <verse eid="1KI 18:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 18:46"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:11">És 8:11</ref></char></note>men SENYÈ a te sou Élie. Li te mare senti li e te kouri pi vit ke Achab pou rive nan lantre kote Jizréel.<verse eid="1KI 18:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1KI 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 19:1"/>Alò, Achab te di Jizréel tout sa ke Élie te fè ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:40">I Wa 18:40</ref></char></note>jan li te touye tout pwofèt yo avèk nepe. <verse eid="1KI 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 19:2"/>Epi Jizréel te voye yon mesaje kote Élie. Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 1:17">Rt 1:17</ref></char></note>“Konsa ke dye yo fè m sa e menm plis si mwen pa fè lavi ou tankou youn nan sa yo avan demen vè menm lè sa a.”<verse eid="1KI 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 19:3"/>Epi Élie te vin pè, e li te leve kouri pou sove lavi li. Li te rive nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:31">Jen 21:31</ref></char></note>Beer-Schéba, ki pou Juda a, e li te kite sèvitè li a la. <verse eid="1KI 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 19:4"/>Men li menm te vwayaje pandan yon jou antre nan dezè a, pou l te rive chita anba yon bwa pikan. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 20:14-18">Jr 20:14-18</ref></char></note>li te fè demann pou l ta mouri e te di: “Sa se kont! Koulye a, O SENYÈ, pran lavi mwen; paske mwen pa pi bon ke zansèt mwen yo.”<verse eid="1KI 19:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 19:5"/>Li te kouche dòmi anba bwa pikan an. Epi vwala, te gen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 28:12">Jen 28:12</ref></char></note>yon zanj ki touche li. Li te di: “Leve, manje!”<verse eid="1KI 19:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 19:6"/>Li te gade, e vwala, te gen bò tèt li yon gato pen wòch cho, ak yon veso dlo. Konsa, li te manje, bwè e te kouche ankò. <verse eid="1KI 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 19:7"/>Zanj Bondye a te vini ankò yon dezyèm fwa, li te touche li e te di: “Leve, manje, paske vwayaj la twò gran pou ou.”<verse eid="1KI 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 19:8"/>Konsa, li te leve. Li te manje e bwè, epi li te ale ak fòs manje sa a pandan karant jou ak karant nwit pou rive <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:1">Egz 3:1</ref></char></note>Horeb, mòn Bondye a. <verse eid="1KI 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 19:9"/>Alò, li te rive la nan yon kav e li te rete ladann. Epi vwala, pawòl Bondye a te vini sou li, e Li te di li: “Kisa w ap fè isit la, Élie?”<verse eid="1KI 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 19:10"/>Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:5">Egz 20:5</ref></char></note>“Mwen te tèlman ranpli avèk zèl pou SENYÈ a, Bondye dèzame yo, pwiske fis Israël yo te abandone akò Ou a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:3-4">Wo 11:3-4</ref></char></note>yo te dechire lotèl Ou yo, e te touye pwofèt Ou yo avèk nepe. Epi se mwen sèl ki rete, e y ap chache lavi m pou pran l.”<verse eid="1KI 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 19:11"/>Pou sa, Li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:20">Egz 19:20</ref></char></note>“Ale kanpe sou mòn nan devan SENYÈ a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:11">Epi veye byen, SENYÈ a t ap pase! Yon gwo van fò t ap boulvèse mòn yo e t ap chire wòch yo an mòso devan SENYÈ a. Men SENYÈ a pa t nan van an. Epi apre van an, yon tranbleman detè, men SENYÈ a pa t nan tranbleman detè a. <verse eid="1KI 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 19:12"/>Apre van an yon dife, men SENYÈ a pa t nan dife a. Epi apre dife a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 4:16">Job 4:16</ref></char></note>yon ti bwi tankou yon souf lejè. <verse eid="1KI 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 19:13"/>Lè Élie te tande l, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Egz 3:6</ref></char></note>li te fin vlope figi li nan manto li a e li te ale deyò nan antre kav la. Epi vwala, yon vwa te parèt a li menm e te di: “Kisa w ap fè isit la, Élie?” <verse eid="1KI 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 19:14"/>Epi li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:10">I Wa 19:10</ref></char></note>“Mwen te tèlman ranpli avèk zèl pou SENYÈ a, Bondye dèzame yo, paske fis Israël yo te abandone akò Ou a, dechire lotèl Ou yo e te touye pwofèt Ou yo avèk nepe. Epi se mwen sèl ki rete; epi y ap chache lavi mwen pou pran l.”<verse eid="1KI 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 19:15"/>SENYÈ a te di li: “Ale, retounen sou chemen ou vè dezè Damas la, e lè ou fin rive, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:8-15">II Wa 8:8-15</ref></char></note>ou va onksyone Hazaël wa sou Syrie; <verse eid="1KI 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 19:16"/>epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:1-10">II Wa 9:1-10</ref></char></note>Jéhu, fis Nimschi a, ou va onksyone wa sou Israël; epi Élisée, fis a Schaphath a nan Abel-Mehola a, ou va onksyone li kòm pwofèt nan plas ou. <verse eid="1KI 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 19:17"/>Li va vin rive ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 13:3-22">II Wa 13:3-22</ref></char></note>sila ki chape anba nepe Hazaël la, Jéhu <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:14-37">II Wa 9:14-37</ref> </char></note>va mete l a lanmò e sila ki chape anba nepe a Jéhu a, Élisée va mete l a lanmò. <verse eid="1KI 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 19:18"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:4">Wo 11:4</ref></char></note>Sepandan, Mwen va kite sèt-mil an Israël, tout jenou ki pa t bese a Baal e tout bouch ki pa t konn bo li.”<verse eid="1KI 19:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 19:19"/>Konsa, li te kite la e te twouve Élisée, fis a Schaphath la, pandan li t ap raboure avèk douz pè bèf devan li, li menm avèk douzyèm nan. Epi Élie te pase bò kote li e te jete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:8-14">II Wa 2:8-14</ref></char></note>manto li sou li. <verse eid="1KI 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 19:20"/>Li te kite bèf yo e te kouri dèyè Élie. Li te di: “Souple, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:21">Mat 8:21</ref></char></note>kite m bo papa m avèk manman m e mwen va swiv ou.” Epi li te di li:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 19:20">“Ale, retounen, paske kisa ke m te fè ou?” <verse eid="1KI 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 19:21"/>Konsa, li te retounen soti swiv li, li te pran pè bèf la e li te fè sakrifis avèk yo, li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 24:22">II Sam 24:22</ref></char></note>bouyi chè avèk dife fèt ak zouti bèf e li te bay a pèp la pou yo te manje. Epi li te leve, li te swiv Élie pou te sèvi li.<verse eid="1KI 19:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1KI 20"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 20:1"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:18-20">I Wa 15:18-20</ref></char></note>Ben-Hadad, wa Syrie a, te ranmase tout lame li a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:31">I Wa 22:31</ref></char></note> Te gen trann-de wa avèk li, avèk cheval ak cha. Li te monte fè syèj sou Samarie e li te goumen kont li. <verse eid="1KI 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 20:2"/>Li te voye mesaje yo lavil Achab, wa Israël la, e yo te di li: “Konsa pale Ben-Hadad; <verse eid="1KI 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 20:3"/>‘Ajan ou avèk lò ou se pou mwen. Pi bèl madanm ou yo avèk pitit yo se pa m tou.’”<verse eid="1KI 20:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 20:4"/>Wa Israël la te reponn: “Se jan pawòl ou yo ye a, mèt mwen, O wa a. Mwen se pa w ak tout sa ke m genyen.”<verse eid="1KI 20:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 20:5"/>Alò, mesaje yo te retounen. Yo te di: “Konsa pale Ben-Hadad: ‘Anverite, mwen te voye kote ou pou te di: “Ou va ban mwen ajan ou avèk lò ou avèk madanm ou ak pitit ou yo, <verse eid="1KI 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 20:6"/>men vè lè sa a demen mwen va voye sèvitè mwen yo kote ou. Yo va chache fouye tout lakay ou avèk lakay sèvitè ou yo, epi nenpòt sa ki gen valè nan zye ou, y ap pran nan men yo pou pote ale.”’”<verse eid="1KI 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 20:7"/>Epi wa Israël la te rele tout ansyen peyi a e te di: “Souple, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:7">II Wa 5:7</ref></char></note>gade byen jan mesye sila a ap chache pwoblèm. Li te voye kote mwen pou madanm mwen avèk pitit mwen yo ak ajan mwen avèk lò mwen, epi mwen pa t refize li.”<verse eid="1KI 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 20:8"/>Tout ansyen yo avèk tout pèp la te di li: “Pa koute l ni vin dakò avè l.”<verse eid="1KI 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 20:9"/>Konsa, li te di a mesaje Ben-Hadad yo: “Di mèt mwen an, wa a, ‘Tout sa ke ou te premye mande sèvitè ou a, m ap fè yo. Men sila ou mande koulye a, mwen p ap kab fè l.’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:9">Mesaje yo te pati, epi te pòte bay li mesaj la. <verse eid="1KI 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 20:10"/>Ben-Hadad te voye kote li e te di: “Ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:2">I Wa 19:2</ref></char></note>dye yo ta fè m sa e menm plis, si pousyè Samarie rete kont pou ranpli men a moun ki swiv mwen yo.”<verse eid="1KI 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 20:11"/>Epi wa Israël la te reponn li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 27:1">Pwov 27:1</ref></char></note>“Pa kite sila k ap fenk abiye ak boukliye a vante tèt li tankou sila k ap retire l la.”<verse eid="1KI 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 20:12"/>Lè Ben-Hadad te tande mesaj sila a, pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:9">I Wa 16:9</ref> </char></note>li t ap bwè avèk wa yo nan tonèl pwovizwa pa yo, li te di a sèvitè li yo: “Pran plas nou”. Konsa, yo te pran plas yo kont vil la.<verse eid="1KI 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 20:13"/>Alò, lapoula, yon pwofèt te pwoche Achab, wa Israël la, e te di: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a, ‘Èske ou te wè tout gran kantite foul sila a? Veye byen, Mwen va livre yo nan men ou jodi a e ou va konnen ke se SENYÈ a Mwen ye.’”<verse eid="1KI 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 20:14"/>Epi Achab te di: “Pa kilès?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Epi li te di: “Pa jennonm ki se chèf a pwovens yo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Epi Achab te di: “Se kilès ki pou louvri batay la?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:14">Epi li te reponn: “Ou menm”.<verse eid="1KI 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 20:15"/>Alò, li te rasanble jennonm a chèf pwovens yo, te gen de-san-trann-de. Apre yo, li te rasanble tout pèp la; menm tout fis Israël yo, sèt-mil. <verse eid="1KI 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 20:16"/>Yo te sòti a midi, pandan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:9">I Wa 16:9</ref></char></note>Ben-Hadad t ap bwè jiskaske li sou nan tonèl pwovizwa avèk trann-de wa ki te ede li yo. <verse eid="1KI 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 20:17"/>Jennonm a chèf pwovens yo te sòti devan. Ben-Hadad te voye mesaje deyò, yo te pale li, e te di: “Moun yo gen tan parèt sòti Samarie.”<verse eid="1KI 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 20:18"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 14:8-12">II Wa 14:8-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò, li te di: “Si yo sòti pou fè lapè, pran yo vivan; oswa si yo te sòti pou fè lagè, pran yo vivan.”<verse eid="1KI 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 20:19"/>Men sa yo te sòti depi lavil la; jennonm a chèf pwovens yo ak lame ki te swiv yo. <verse eid="1KI 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 20:20"/>Chak moun te touye yon nonm pou kont li; epi Siryen yo te sove ale e wa Israël la te kouri dèyè yo e Ben-Hadad, wa Syrie a, te chape sou yon cheval avèk chevalye yo. <verse eid="1KI 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 20:21"/>Wa Israël la te parèt deyò, li te frape cheval yo avèk cha yo e te touye Siryen yo nan yon gwo masak. <verse eid="1KI 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 20:22"/>Alò, pwofèt la te pwoche wa Israël la e te di li: “Ale, ranfòse ou menm e okipe pou wè sa ou gen pou fè; paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 11:1">II Sam 11:1</ref></char></note>nan fen ane a, wa a Syrie va vin monte kont ou.”<verse eid="1KI 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 20:23"/>Alò, sèvitè a wa Syrie a te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 16:19-21">Jr 16:19-21</ref></char></note>“dye pa yo se dye mòn yo ye. Pou sa, yo te pi fò pase nou. Men pito ke nou fè lagè kont yo nan ba plèn nan e asireman, nou va vin pi fò pase yo. <verse eid="1KI 20:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 20:24"/>Fè bagay sa a: retire chak wa sou plas yo e ranplase yo avèk kapitèn nan plas yo, <verse eid="1KI 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 20:25"/>epi rasanble yon lame tankou lame ke ou te pèdi a, cheval pou cheval e cha pou cha. Nou va goumen kont yo nan plèn nan e asireman, nou va pi fò pase yo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:25">Epi li te koute vwa yo e te fè l konsa. <verse eid="1KI 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 20:26"/>Nan fen ane a, Ben-Hadad te ranmase Siryen yo e te monte nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 13:17">II Wa 13:17</ref></char></note>Aphek pou goumen kont Israël. <verse eid="1KI 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 20:27"/>Fis Israël yo te deja rasanble avèk tout pwovizyon yo pou te ale rankontre yo. Yo te fè kan devan Siryen yo tankou de ti bann kabrit, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:3-5">Jij 6:3-5</ref></char></note>men Siryen yo te ranpli peyi a. <verse eid="1KI 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 20:28"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:18">I Wa 17:18</ref></char></note>yon nonm Bondye te vin toupre pou te pale a wa Israël la. Li te di: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a: ‘Akoz Siryen yo te di: “SENYÈ a se yon dye a mòn yo, men Li pa yon dye nan vale yo,” pou sa, mwen va bay tout vast kantite moun sa yo nan men ou e ou va konnen ke Mwen se SENYÈ a.’”<verse eid="1KI 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 20:29"/>Konsa, yo te fè kan an, youn kont lòt, pandan sèt jou. Epi nan setyèm jou a, batay la te ouvri e fis Israël yo te touye nan Siryen yo san-mil sòlda apye nan yon sèl jou. <verse eid="1KI 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 20:30"/>Men tout moun ki te rete yo te sove ale antre nan lavil <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 20:26">I Wa 20:26</ref> </char></note>Aphek e miray la te tonbe sou venn-sèt-mil òm ki te rete. Epi Ben-Hadad te sove ale pou te rive anndan vil la <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:25">I Wa 22:25</ref></char></note>nan yon chanm enteryè. <verse eid="1KI 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 20:31"/>Sèvitè li yo te di li: “Alò, gade byen, nou konn tande ke wa lakay Israël yo se wa ki gen mizerikòd. Souple, annou mete <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:34">Jen 37:34</ref></char></note>twal sak sou senti nou avèk kòd sou tèt nou pou ale parèt kote wa Israël la. Petèt, li va sove lavi nou.”<verse eid="1KI 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 20:32"/>Konsa, yo te mare twal sak sou senti yo, avèk kòd sou tèt yo pou te vin kote wa Israël la e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 20:3-6">I Wa 20:3-6</ref></char></note>“Sèvitè ou, Ben-Hadad voye di: ‘Souple, kite mwen viv.’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:32">Epi li te di: “Èske li toujou vivan? Li se frè m.”<verse eid="1KI 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 20:33"/>Alò mesye yo te pran sa kòm yon sign, yo te sezi sou pawòl la vit, e yo te di: “Frè ou, Ben-Hadad.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:33">Epi li te di: “Ale, mennen li.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:33">Alò, Ben-Hadad te vin deyò kote li e li te pran li monte nan cha a. <verse eid="1KI 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 20:34"/>Ben-Hadad te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:20">I Wa 15:20</ref></char></note>“Vil ke papa m te pran nan men papa ou yo, mwen va remèt yo e ou va fè ri yo pou ou menm nan Damas, tankou papa m te fè nan Samarie a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:34">Achab te di: “Epi mwen va kite ou ale avèk akò sila a.” Konsa, li te fè yon akò avèk li e te kite li ale.<verse eid="1KI 20:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 20:35"/>Alò, yon sèten nonm pami <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:3-7">II Wa 2:3-7</ref></char></note>fis a pwofèt yo te di a yon lòt mesye pa pawòl SENYÈ a: “Souple, frape mwen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:35">Men mesye a te refize frape li. <verse eid="1KI 20:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 20:36"/>Epi li te di li: “Akoz ou pa t koute vwa SENYÈ a, tande byen, depi ou kite mwen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:24">I Wa 13:24</ref></char></note>yon lyon va touye ou.” Epi depi li te kite li a, yon lyon te twouve li e te touye li.<verse eid="1KI 20:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 20:37"/>Alò, li te twouve yon lòt mesye e te di: “Souple, frape mwen.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:37">Epi mesye a te frape li e te blese li. <verse eid="1KI 20:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 20:38"/>Konsa, pwofèt la te pati e te tann wa a akote chemen an e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:2">I Wa 14:2</ref></char></note>kache idantite li avèk yon bandaj ki te kouvri zye li. <verse eid="1KI 20:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 20:39"/>Pandan wa a t ap pase, li te kriye a wa a e te di: “Sèvitè ou a te antre nan mitan batay la; epi tande byen, yon nonm te vire akote pou te mennen yon mesye kote mwen e li te di: ‘Veye nonm sa a; si pou nenpòt rezon li vin disparèt, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 10:24">II Wa 10:24</ref></char></note>alò lavi ou va peye pou lavi pa li, oswa ou va peye yon talan ajan.’ <verse eid="1KI 20:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 20:40"/>Pandan sèvitè ou a te okipe pa isit e pa la, li te vin disparèt.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 20:40">Epi wa Israël la te di li: “Se konsa jijman ou ap ye; se ou menm ki deside li.”<verse eid="1KI 20:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 20:41"/>Epi byen vit li te retire bandaj sou zye li e wa Israël la te vin rekonèt li kòm youn nan pwofèt yo. <verse eid="1KI 20:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 20:42"/>Li te di li: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a: ‘Akoz ou te kite sòti nan men ou nonm ke mwen te dedye a destriksyon an; pou sa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 20:39">I Wa 20:39</ref></char></note>lavi ou va ale pou lavi pa li e pèp ou a pou pèp pa li a.’”<verse eid="1KI 20:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 20:43"/>Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:4">I Wa 21:4</ref></char></note>wa Israël la te ale lakay li pa kontan e byen vekse pou te rive Samarie.<verse eid="1KI 20:43"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1KI 21"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 21:1"/>Alò, li te vin rive apre bagay sa yo ke Naboth, Jizreyelit la te gen yon chan rezen ki te nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 6:33">Jij 6:33</ref></char></note>Jizréel akote palè Achab, wa Samarie a. <verse eid="1KI 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 21:2"/>Achab te pale a Naboth e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:14">I Sam 8:14</ref></char></note>“Ban mwen chan rezen ou an, pou m ka genyen li kòm yon jaden legim, paske li toupre lakay mwen e mwen va ba ou yon pi bon chan rezen pase l pou ranplase li. Si ou pito, mwen va ba ou pri li an lajan.”<verse eid="1KI 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 21:3"/>Men Naboth te di a Achab: “Ke SENYÈ a ta anpeche m ba ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:23">Lev 25:23</ref></char></note>eritaj zansèt mwen yo.”<verse eid="1KI 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 21:4"/>Konsa, Achab te rive lakay li pa kontan e byen vekse akoz pawòl ke Naboth, Jizreyelit la, te pale a li a, paske li te di: “Mwen p ap bay ou eritaj zansèt mwen yo.” Li te kouche sou kabann li, te vire figi li akote e li pa t manje manje. <verse eid="1KI 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 21:5"/>Men Jézabel, madanm li, te vin kote li e te di li: “Kijan lespri ou tèlman ba ke ou pa manje manje a?”<verse eid="1KI 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 21:6"/>Konsa, li te di li: “Akoz mwen te pale Naboth, Jizreyelit la, e mwen te di li: ‘Ban mwen chan rezen ou an pou lajan; oswa, si li fè ou kontan, mwen va ba ou yon chan rezen pou ranplase li.’ Men li te di: ‘Mwen p ap ba ou chan rezen mwen an.’”<verse eid="1KI 21:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 21:7"/>Jézabel, madanm li te di li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 8:14">I Sam 8:14</ref></char></note>“Èske koulye a se ou ki renye sou Israël? Leve, manje pen e kite kè ou kontan. Mwen va ba ou chan rezen a Naboth, Jizreyelit la.” <verse eid="1KI 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 21:8"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 3:12">Est 3:12</ref></char></note>Konsa, li te ekri lèt nan non Achab e te sele yo avèk so pa li pou te voye yo bay ansyen yo avèk prens ki te rete avèk Naboth nan vil pa li a. <verse eid="1KI 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 21:9"/>Alò, nan lèt sa yo li te ekri e te di: “Pwoklame yon jèn e fè Naboth chita sou tèt a pèp la. <verse eid="1KI 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 21:10"/>Fè chita dèzòm sanzave devan li pou fè temwayaj kont li pou di: ‘Ou te modi Bondye avèk wa a.’ Konsa, pran li deyò e lapide li jiskaske li mouri.”<verse eid="1KI 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 21:11"/>Konsa, mesye lavil li yo, ansyen avèk prens ki te rete la yo, te fè jan Jézabel te voye di yo a, jis jan ke li te ekri nan lèt ke li te voye yo. <verse eid="1KI 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 21:12"/>Yo te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 58:4">És 58:4</ref></char></note>pwoklame yon jèn e te fè Naboth chita sou tèt a pèp la. <verse eid="1KI 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 21:13"/>Epi dèzòm sanzave te antre ladann e te chita devan li. Epi de mesye sanzave yo te fè temwayaj kont li, menm kont Naboth, devan pèp la, e yo te di: “Naboth te modi Bondye avèk wa a.” <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:55-59">Trav 7:55-59</ref></char></note>Konsa, yo te pran l mennen deyò lavil la e yo te lapide l jiska lanmò avèk kout wòch. <verse eid="1KI 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 21:14"/>Epi yo te voye kote Jézabel e te di: “Naboth te lapide e fin mouri.”<verse eid="1KI 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 21:15"/>Lè Jézabel te tande ke Naboth te lapide e te mouri, Jézabel te di a Achab: “Leve, pran posesyon a chan rezen Naboth la, Jizreyelit la, ke li te refize ba ou pou lajan an; paske Naboth pa vivan, men li mouri.”<verse eid="1KI 21:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 21:16"/>Lè Achab te tande ke Naboth te mouri, Achab te leve desann kote chan rezen a Naboth la, Jizreyelit la, pou l te pran posesyon li.<verse eid="1KI 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 21:17"/>Epi pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote Élie, Tichbit la, e te di: <verse eid="1KI 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 21:18"/>“Leve, ale desann rankontre Achab, wa Israël la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:29">I Wa 16:29</ref></char></note>ki Samarie. Gade byen, li nan chan rezen Naboth kote li te desann pou pran posesyon li. <verse eid="1KI 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 21:19"/>Ou va pale li e di: ‘Konsa pale SENYÈ a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 12:9">II Sam 12:9</ref></char></note>Èske ou te touye e anplis pran posesyon?’” Epi ou va pale avèk li pou di: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a: ‘Nan plas kote chen yo te niche san Naboth la, chen yo va niche san pa ou menm.’”<verse eid="1KI 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 21:20"/>Achab te di a Élie: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:10">I Wa 14:10</ref></char></note>“Èske ou vin jwenn mwen, O lènmi mwen?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 21:20">Epi li te reponn: “Mwen te jwenn ou akoz ou te vann tèt ou pou fè mechanste nan zye SENYÈ a. <verse eid="1KI 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 21:21"/>Gade byen, Mwen va mennen mal sou ou, Mwen va bale fè ou disparèt e Mwen va koupe retire sou Achab tout gason, ni esklav, ni lib nan tout Israël. <verse eid="1KI 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 21:22"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:29">I Wa 15:29</ref></char></note>Mwen va fè lakay ou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:3-11">I Wa 16:3-11</ref></char></note>tankou lakay Jéroboam, fis a Nebath la ak tankou lakay Baescha, fis Achija a, akoz pwovokasyon avèk sila li te pwovoke M a lakòlè a, e akoz ou te fè Israël peche.” <verse eid="1KI 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 21:23"/>De Jézabel osi SENYÈ a te pale, e te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:10-37">II Wa 9:10-37</ref></char></note>“Chen yo va manje Jézabel nan distri Jizréel la. <verse eid="1KI 21:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 21:24"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:11">I Wa 14:11</ref></char></note>Sila ki apatyen a Achab, ki mouri nan vil la, chen va manje yo e sila ki mouri nan chan an, zwazo syèl yo va manje yo.”<verse eid="1KI 21:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 21:25"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 16:30-33">I Wa 16:30-33</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Anverite, pa t gen moun tankou Achab ki te vann tèt li pou fè mal devan SENYÈ a, akoz madanm li, Jézabel te chofe li. <verse eid="1KI 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 21:26"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:12">I Wa 15:12</ref></char></note>Li te aji byen abominab nan swiv zidòl li yo, selon tout sa ke Amoreyen yo te fè, ke SENYÈ a te mete deyò devan fis Israël yo.<verse eid="1KI 21:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 21:27"/>Li te vin rive ke lè Achab te tande pawòl sa yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 37:34">Jen 37:34</ref></char></note>li te chire rad li e li te mete twal sak sou li pou te fè jèn. Li te kouche nan twal sak e li te vin mache avèk chagren nèt.<verse eid="1KI 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 21:28"/>Alò, pawòl SENYÈ a te vini a Élie, Tichbit la, e te di: <verse eid="1KI 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 21:29"/>“Èske ou wè kijan Achab te vin imilye li devan Mwen? Akoz li te imilye li devan mwen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:25-37">II Wa 9:25-37</ref></char></note>Mwen p ap mennen mal la nan jou li yo; men Mwen va mennen mal la sou lakay li nan jou a fis li yo.”<verse eid="1KI 21:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1KI 22"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1KI 22:1"/>Twazan te pase san gen lagè antre Syrie avèk Israël. <verse eid="1KI 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1KI 22:2"/>Nan twazyèm ane <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:24">I Wa 15:24</ref></char></note>Josaphat a, wa Juda a te desann kote wa Israël la. <verse eid="1KI 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1KI 22:3"/>Alò, wa Israël la te di a sèvitè li yo: “Èske nou konnen ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:33">Det 4:33</ref></char></note>Ramoth-Galaad apatyen a nou menm e jiska prezan, nou p ap fè anyen pou rache li nan men wa Syrie a.” <verse eid="1KI 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1KI 22:4"/>Epi li te di a Josaphat: “Èske ou va ale avèk mwen nan batay a Ramoth-Galaad la?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:4">Josaphat te di a wa Israël la: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 3:7">II Wa 3:7</ref></char></note>“Mwen tankou ou menm, pèp mwen an tankou pèp pa w la, cheval mwen yo tankou cheval pa ou yo.” <verse eid="1KI 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1KI 22:5"/>Anplis, Josaphat te di a wa Israël la: “Souple, fè demann premyèman selon pawòl SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="1KI 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1KI 22:6"/>Alò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:19">I Wa 18:19</ref></char></note>wa Israël la te rasanble pwofèt yo ansanm, anviwon kat-san mesye. Li te di yo: “Èske mwen dwe ale kont Ramoth-Galaad nan batay la, oswa èske mwen dwe fè bak?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:6">Yo te di: “Ale monte, paske SENYÈ a va bay li nan men a wa a.”<verse eid="1KI 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1KI 22:7"/>Men <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 3:11">II Wa 3:11</ref></char></note>Josaphat te di: “Èske pa gen yon pwofèt SENYÈ a ki la pou nou kab mande li?”<verse eid="1KI 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1KI 22:8"/>Wa Israël la te di a Josaphat: “Genyen toujou yon nonm pa sila nou kapab fè demann SENYÈ a, men mwen rayi li, akoz li pa pwofetize sa ki bon pou mwen, men sa ki mal. Michée, fis a Jimla a.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:8">Men Josaphat te di: “Pa kite wa a di sa.”<verse eid="1KI 22:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1KI 22:9"/>Wa Israël la te rele yon ofisye e te di: “Mennen byen vit Michée, fis a Jimla a.”<verse eid="1KI 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1KI 22:10"/>Alò, wa Israël la avèk Josaphat, wa Juda a te chita chak sou pwòp twòn pa yo, abiye an wòb pa yo nan pòtay pou antre Samarie a, epi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:6">I Wa 22:6</ref></char></note>tout pwofèt yo t ap pwofetize devan yo. <verse eid="1KI 22:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1KI 22:11"/>Alò Sédécias, fis a Kenaana a te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:18-21">Za 1:18-21</ref></char></note>kòn yo an fè pou kont li, e te di: “Konsa pale SENYÈ a: ‘Avèk sila yo, ou va frape Siryen yo jiskaske yo fin detwi.’” <verse eid="1KI 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1KI 22:12"/>Tout pwofèt yo t ap pwofetize konsa e t ap di: “Ale monte Ramoth-Galaad e byen reyisi; paske SENYÈ a va mete li nan men wa a.”<verse eid="1KI 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1KI 22:13"/>Mesaje a ki te ale rele Michée te pale li. Li te di: “Koulye a, gade byen, tout pawòl a pwofèt yo favorab anvè wa a. Souple, kite pawòl ou yo fèt tankou pawòl a youn nan yo, e pale avèk favè.”<verse eid="1KI 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1KI 22:14"/>Men Michée te di: “Jan SENYÈ a viv la, sa ke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 22:18">Nonb 22:18</ref></char></note>SENYÈ a pale mwen an, se sa mwen va pale.”<verse eid="1KI 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1KI 22:15"/>Lè li te vin kote wa a, wa a te di li: “Michée, èske nou dwe ale Ramoth-Galaad nan batay la, oswa èske nou dwe fè bak?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:15">Konsa, li te reponn li: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:12">I Wa 22:12</ref></char></note>“Ale monte e byen reyisi e SENYÈ a va bay li nan men wa a.”<verse eid="1KI 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1KI 22:16"/>Alò, wa a te di li: “Konbyen de tan èske mwen oblije di ou pou pa pale anyen avè m sof ke laverite nan non SENYÈ a?”<verse eid="1KI 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1KI 22:17"/>Pou sa, li te di: “Mwen te wè tout Israël gaye sou mòn yo, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mat 9:36</ref></char></note>tankou mouton ki san bèje. Konsa, SENYÈ a te di: ‘Sila yo pa gen mèt. Kite yo chak retounen lakay yo anpè.’”<verse eid="1KI 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1KI 22:18"/>Epi wa Israël la te di a Josaphat: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:8">I Wa 22:8</ref></char></note>“Èske mwen pa t di ou ke li pa t ap fè bon pwofesi pou mwen, men pito move?”<verse eid="1KI 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1KI 22:19"/>Michée te di: “Pou sa, tande pawòl SENYÈ a. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 1:26-28">Éz 1:26-28</ref></char></note>Mwen te wè SENYÈ a te chita sou twòn Li e tout lame syèl la te kanpe akote Li adwat Li e agoch Li. <verse eid="1KI 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1KI 22:20"/>SENYÈ a te di: ‘Kilès k ap sedwi Achab pou ale monte e tonbe Ramoth-Galaad?’ Epi youn te di sesi e youn te di sela.”<verse eid="1KI 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1KI 22:21"/>Alò, yon lespri te parèt devan SENYÈ a e te di: “Mwen va sedwi li.”<verse eid="1KI 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1KI 22:22"/>SENYÈ a te di li: “Kijan?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:22">Epi li te reponn: “Mwen va sòti deyò pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:9">Éz 14:9</ref></char></note>devni yon lespri twonpè nan bouch a tout pwofèt li yo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1KI 22:22">Epi Li te di: “Ou gen non sèlman pou sedwi li, men pou vin genyen li nèt. Ale fè sa.” <verse eid="1KI 22:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1KI 22:23"/>“Alò, pou sa, gade byen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 14:9">Éz 14:9</ref> </char></note>SENYÈ a te mete yon lespri twonpè nan bouch a tout pwofèt pa ou yo; epi SENYÈ a te pwoklame dega nèt kont ou.”<verse eid="1KI 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1KI 22:24"/>Konsa, Sédécias, fis a Kenaana a te vin toupre e te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 18:23">II Kwo 18:23</ref> </char></note>frape Michée sou machwè li. Li te di: “Kijan lespri SENYÈ a te pase sòti nan mwen pou pale avèk ou?”<verse eid="1KI 22:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1KI 22:25"/>Michée te di: “Gade byen, ou va wè sa nan jou lè ou antre nan yon chanm a lenteryè pou kache kò w.”<verse eid="1KI 22:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1KI 22:26"/>Alò, wa Israël la te di: “Pran Michée e retounen li vè majistra lavil la ak Joas, fis a wa a, <verse eid="1KI 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1KI 22:27"/>epi di li: ‘Konsa pale wa a: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 16:10">II Kwo 16:10</ref></char></note>“Mete nonm sa a nan prizon a e bay li tikras pen ak dlo sèlman kòm manje jiskaske mwen retounen san mal pa rive m.”’”<verse eid="1KI 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1KI 22:28"/>Michée te di: “Si ou, anverite, retounen san ke mal pa rive, SENYÈ a pa t fè m pale.” Epi li te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 1:2">Mi 1:2</ref></char></note>“Koute, tout pèp nou an!”<verse eid="1KI 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1KI 22:29"/>Konsa, wa Israël la avèk Josaphat, wa Juda a, te monte kont Ramoth-Galaad. <verse eid="1KI 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1KI 22:30"/>Wa Israël la te di a Josaphat: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:22">II Kwo 35:22</ref></char></note>“Mwen va kache idantite mwen e antre nan batay la, men ou menm, mete vètman pa ou.” Konsa, wa Israël la te kache idantite li e te antre nan batay la.<verse eid="1KI 22:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1KI 22:31"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 20:1-24">I Wa 20:1-24</ref></char></note>wa Syrie a te kòmande trann-de kapitèn a cha li yo. Li te di: “Pa goumen avèk piti ni gran, men sèlman avèk wa Israël la.”<verse eid="1KI 22:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1KI 22:32"/>Konsa, lè kapitèn a cha yo te wè Josaphat, yo te di: “Anverite, sa se wa Israël la,” epi yo te vire akote pou goumen kont li e Josaphat te kriye fò. <verse eid="1KI 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1KI 22:33"/>Lè kapitèn a cha yo te wè ke li pa t wa Israël la, yo te rale bak e te sispann swiv li. <verse eid="1KI 22:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1KI 22:34"/>Alò, yon sèten nonm te rale banza li pa aza e te frape wa Israël la. Flèch la te antre nan yon kwen nan vètman pwotèj la. Konsa, li te di chofè cha li a: “Retounen fè bak e retire mwen nan batay la, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:23">II Kwo 35:23</ref></char></note>paske mwen blese byen sevè.” <verse eid="1KI 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1KI 22:35"/>Batay la te boule rèd pandan jou sa a. Yo te soutni wa a pou l kanpe nan cha li devan Siryen yo, e nan leswa a, li te mouri. San a te soti nan blesi a pou l antre nan enteryè cha a. <verse eid="1KI 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1KI 22:36"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:12">II Wa 14:12</ref></char></note>Epi yon kri te sòti toupatou nan lame a nan lè solèy kouche a. Yo te di: “Chak moun rive nan vil li, e chak mesye nan pwòp peyi pa l.”<verse eid="1KI 22:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1KI 22:37"/>Konsa, wa a te mouri. Yo te mennen l Samarie, epi yo te antere wa a Samarie. <verse eid="1KI 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1KI 22:38"/>Yo te lave cha a akote sous dlo Samarie a, e chen yo te niche san li nan kote pwostitiye yo te konn benyen, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:19">I Wa 21:19</ref></char></note>selon pawòl SENYÈ a te pale a.<verse eid="1KI 22:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1KI 22:39"/>Alò, tout lòt zèv a Achab yo avèk tout sa ke li te fè ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 3:15">Am 3:15</ref></char></note>kay ivwa ke li te konstwi a ak tout vil ke li te bati yo, èske yo pa ekri nan Liv Kwonik a Wa Israël yo? <verse eid="1KI 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1KI 22:40"/>Konsa, Achab te dòmi avèk zansèt pa li yo, e Achazia, fis li a, te devni wa nan plas li.<verse eid="1KI 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1KI 22:41"/>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 20:31">II Kwo 20:31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Alò Josaphat, fis Asa a, te devni wa sou Juda nan Katriyèm ane Achab, wa Israël la. <verse eid="1KI 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1KI 22:42"/>Josaphat te gen trann-senk ane lè li te devni wa, e li te renye pandan venn-senk ane Jérusalem. Epi non manman li se te Azuba, fi a Schilchi a. <verse eid="1KI 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1KI 22:43"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 17:3">II Kwo 17:3</ref></char></note>Li te mache nan chemen Asa, papa li. Li pa t vire akote e li te fè sa ki te dwat nan zye SENYÈ a. Sepandan, wo plas yo pa t retire. Pèp la te toujou fè sakrifis e te brile lansan sou wo plas yo. <verse eid="1KI 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1KI 22:44"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:16-18">II Wa 8:16-18</ref></char></note>Josaphat osi te fè lapè avèk wa Israël la.<verse eid="1KI 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1KI 22:45"/>Alò, tout lòt zèv a Josaphat yo, avèk pwisans ke li te montre ak jan li te fè lagè, èske yo pa ekri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:34">II Kwo 20:34</ref></char></note>nan liv Kwonik a Wa a Juda yo? <verse eid="1KI 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1KI 22:46"/>Retay a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:17">Det 23:17</ref></char></note>sadomit ki te rete nan jou papa li yo, Asa, li te fè ekzile yo sòti nan peyi a. <verse eid="1KI 22:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1KI 22:47"/>Alò, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:14">II Sam 8:14</ref></char></note>pa t gen wa nan Édom. Se yon depite ki te wa. <verse eid="1KI 22:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1KI 22:48"/>Josaphat te fè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 20:36">II Kwo 20:36</ref></char></note>bato a Tarsis yo vwayaje a Ophir pou lò, men yo pa t rive, paske bato yo te kraze kote Etsjon-Guéber. <verse eid="1KI 22:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1KI 22:49"/>Alò, Achazia, fis Achab la, te di a Josaphat: “Kite sèvitè mwen yo ale avèk sèvitè ou yo nan bato yo.” Men Josaphat pa t dakò. <verse eid="1KI 22:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1KI 22:50"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:1">II Kwo 21:1</ref></char></note>Konsa, Josaphat te dòmi avèk zansèt pa li yo e te antere avèk zansèt li yo nan vil a papa li a, David e Joram, fis li a, te renye nan plas li.<verse eid="1KI 22:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1KI 22:51"/>Achazia, fis a Achab la te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:1">II Kwo 21:1</ref></char></note>devni wa nan plas li. <verse eid="1KI 22:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1KI 22:52"/>Li te fè mal nan zye SENYÈ a e li te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:26">I Wa 15:26</ref></char></note>mache nan chemen papa li, nan chemen manman l ak nan chemen Jéroboam, fis a Nebath la, ki te fè Israël peche a. <verse eid="1KI 22:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1KI 22:53"/><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:53 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:11">Jij 2:11</ref></char></note>Konsa, li te sèvi Baal, li te adore li e te pwovoke SENYÈ a, Bondye Israël la, a lakòlè, selon tout sa ke papa li te konn fè yo.<verse eid="1KI 22:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1KI 22"/>
</usx>
